Aka qellqatajj oraqpachan Bibliat yatichañataki luratawa , uka yatichäwejja yanaptʼañ munirinakan donacionanakapampiw apasi , janiw aljasiñapäkiti .
Kunjamsa donacionamampi yanaptʼasma uk yatiñatakejja , Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma .
Textonakajja , Génesis librot Malaquías librokamajj Qullan Arunaka , 1992 Bibliat apstʼatawa .
Mateo librot Apocalipsis librokamajja , Machaq Mundon Jakirinakataki Diosan Arunakapa Bibliata apstʼatarakiwa .
Kawkjantï NM letranakampi qhanañchaskejja Traducción del Nuevo Mundo de las Santas Escrituras ( con referencias ) español aruta apstʼatarakiwa . Jan ukhamäkanejja qhanañchasiniwa .
Aka yatichäwinakaniwa
3 Kusisit jakasiñatakejj chʼamachasiñasawa
4 Wajjtʼasirïñasawa , utjkistu ukampis kusisitäñasawa
6 Janiw llakimp aynachtʼañasäkiti , cuerposas qʼomäñapawa
8 Munasirïñasawa
10 Perdonir jaqëñasawa
12 Mä amtamp jakasiñasawa
14 Jutïr urunak suytʼañasawa
16 Jukʼamp yatjjatañasawa
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Jan juchañchkay sarnaqer jaqejj kusisiñaniwa , Tatitun yatichäwiparjam sarnaqerejj kusisiñaniwa ” sasa ( Salmo 119 : 1 ) .
Aka revistan paqallqo yatichäwinakapajja , kunjamatsa kusisit jakassna uka toqetwa parli .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
¿ JUMAJJ KUSISITAT JAKASTA ?
Ukhamächi ukhajja , ¿ kunas kusisiytam ?
¿ Familiama , trabajoma , jan ukajj religionamacha ?
Inas akham amuysta : “ Estudiañ tukuyasa , mä suma trabajo jikjjatasa , jan ukajj mä machaq auto alasisaw kusisit jakasï ” sasa .
Walja jaqenakajja , kuntï munapki ukanak jikjjatasakiw wal kusisipjje .

Ukampis janiw wiñayatak kusisitäpkiti .
Kusisiñajja , sum jikjjatasiña , mayni pachpat kusisitäña , chuymatpach kusisit jakasiña sañwa muni . Cheqas taqeniw ukham jakasiñ muntanjja .
Janiw qollqesa cosasanakasa cheqpach kusisiñ churkistaspati , jan ukasti jakkasajj kunanaksa lurasktan ukaw cheqpach kusisiñ churistaspa .
Ukhamajj “ akanak jikjjatkä ukhaw kusisit jakasï . . . ” sasin sissna ukhajja , janiw kusisit jakasksnati .
Aka toqet amuytʼañäni .
Jan usuntañatakejja , mä jaqejj chʼamañchtʼkir manqʼanakwa manqʼañapa , ejercicionaksa lurañaparakiwa .
Kusisit jakasiñatakejja , ukhamarakiw jiwasajj kunanakatï jakäwisan yanaptʼkistaspa ukanak lurañasa .
¿ Kunjam chuymanïñas kusisit jakasiñatak yanaptʼistaspa ?
Ukwa jichhajj mä qhawqhanak uñjañäni . WAJJTʼASIRÏÑASAWA , UTJKISTU UKAMPIS KUSISITÄÑASAWA
JANIW LLAKIMP AYNACHTʼAÑASÄKITI , CUERPOSAS QʼOMÄÑAPAWA
MUNASIRÏÑASAWA
PERDONIR JAQËÑASAWA
MÄ AMTAMP JAKASIÑASAWA
JUTÏR URUNAK SUYTʼAÑASAWA
Wali suma ewjjtʼanakani mä librojj akham siwa : “ Jan juchañchkay [ jan ukajj sum ] sarnaqer jaqejj kusisiñaniwa ” sasa ( Salmo 119 : 1 ) .
Kunanakas kusisit jakasiñatak yanaptʼistaspa uk jichhajj yatjjatañäni .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
“ KHITINAKATÏ QOLLQENÏPKI , WALJA COSASANAKANÏPKI UKANAKAW KUSISIT JAKASIPJJE ” sasaw waljanejj sapjje .
Ukatwa walja jaqenakajj jukʼamp qollqenïñatak wal trabajipjje .
¿ Cheqapunit walja qollqenïpki jan ukajj cosasanakanïpki uka jaqenakajj kusisit jakasipjjpacha ?
¿ Kunas jichhakam uñjasiwayi ?
Mä revistajj akham siwa : ‘ Jaqenakan manqʼañapasa , isipasa , utapas utjchi ukhajja , kusisitaw jakasipjje . Jukʼamp qollqenïñajj janiw kusisit jakasiñatakisa ni sum jikjjatasiñatakis yanaptʼkistuti ’ sasa ( Journal of Happiness Studies ) .
Yaqha revistajj akham sarakiwa : “ Janiw qollqejj llakisiykistuti , jan ukasti qollqe jikjjatañ munañaw llakisiyistu ” sasa ( Monitor on Psychology ) .
Bibliajj niya pä waranqa maranak nayrajj niya ukhamarakwa säna : “ Qollqe añcha munañajj taqe jan waltʼäwinakan mä saphipawa . Qollqe añcha munañampi apayasipjjatap laykuw yaqhepajj [ . . . ] kunayman llakinakampis apjjatasipjjaraki ” sasa .
¿ Kuna ‘ llakinakansa ’ uñjassna ?
KUNATÏ UTJKISTU UKANAKAT LLAKISISAJJ JANIW IKSNATI .
“ Khititejj irnaqki , jukʼsa waljsa manqʼchi ukajja , sumaw iktʼasi ; ukampis qamirirojja janiw ikiykiti qamir yänakapajja ” ( Eclesiastés 5 : 12 ) .
TAQE KUNANÏKASAS JANIW KUSISIT JAKASKSNATI .
Jaqenakajj walja qollqenïkasasa , jukʼamp munasipkakiwa , ukatwa jan kusisit jakasipkiti .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Khititejj qollqe munki ukajja jukʼampwa muni ; khititejj qamirïki ukajj , jan utjirinjamakiwa amuyasi ” sasa ( Eclesiastés 5 : 10 ) .
Jukʼamp qollqenïñatak trabajisajja , waljaniw familiapampi amigonakapampi qamartʼaña , jan ukajj Diosar serviñ apanukupjje , cheqas ukanakaw cheqpach kusisiñ churistu .

QOLLQE APTʼASISAJJ WALI LLAKITAW JIKJJATASSNA .
“ Jan chʼamañchasimti qamiriptañataki [ . . . ] .
Qamir kankañajj mä jukʼatakikiwa ; mäkirakiwa tukusjje , kunjämatejj pakajj chheqhanëjjasin mäki thoqtawayjjejja ukhama ” ( Proverbios 23 : 4 , 5 ) .
KUNATÏ UTJKISTU UKANAKAMP KUSISITÄÑA .
“ Jiwasajj janiw kunsa akapachar apanktanti , janirakiw kunsa apkañäniti .
Jiwasantejj manqʼasa isisa utjaskchistojja , ukanakampejj kusisitakïskañäniwa ” .
Kunatï utjkistu ukanakamp kusisit jakasiñäni ukhajja , janiw quejaskañäniti , ni mayninakatsa envidiaskañäniti .
Janirakiw jila valorani cosasanak alañ munasajj llakimp apjjataskañäniti .
WAJJTʼASIRÏÑA .
“ Katoqañat sipansa churañanwa jukʼamp kusisiñajj utji ” .
Wajjtʼasirïpki ukanakajja , mayninakar yanaptʼasajj kusisitaw jakasipjje . Yaqhepajj jan qollqemp yanaptʼirjamäsajj tiempo apstʼasisaw mayninakar yanaptʼapjje .
Ukham yanaptʼirinakajja , wali munatäpjjewa , respetompi uñjatäpjjewa , suma amigonakanïpjjewa , amigonakapas ukhamarakiw jupanakar munasiñamp uñjapjje , taqe ukanakjja janiw qollqemp alksnati .
COSASANAKAR MUNASIÑAT SIPANSA JAQENAKARUW MUNASIÑASA .
“ Vaca aycha uñisiñampi manqʼañat sipansa , jukʼamp askiwa munasiñampi chʼojjñanaka manqʼañajja ” ( Proverbios 15 : 17 ) .
Walja qollqenïñat sipansa , suma amigonakanïña ukat taqenimp sum apasiñaw jukʼamp wakiskirejja .
Uka munasiñaw kusisitäñatakejj yanaptʼistu , ukwa qhepat yatjjataskañäni .
Sudamérica cheqan jakasiri Sabina warmejja , Bibliajj kunjamsa yanaptʼistaspa uk jupapachpaw uñjäna .
Esposopajj utat sarjjäna ukhajja , kunatï jakasiñatak wakiski ukanak alañatakisa pä wawanakapar uywañatakis wal chʼamachasïna .
Pä trabajonïnwa , sapüruw pusi alwa horasat trabajañ qalltäna .
Wali qaritäkchïnsa , Bibliat yatjjatañwa amtäna .
¿ Kunjamsa ukajj yanaptʼawayi ?
Janiw jukʼamp qollqenïkänti , ukampis Bibliat yatjjatasajj kusisitaw jakasjjäna .
Diosat yatjjatasasa , kuntï yateqkäna ukanak mayninakar yatichasas kusisitaw jakasïna .
Cheqpach amigonakwa jikjjatarakïna .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Maynin yatiñanïtapajj luratanakapanwa uñjasi ” sasa .
Kunatï utjkistu ukamp kusisitäñasa , wajjtʼasirïñasa , cosasanakar munasiñat sipansa jaqenakar munasiñasa , yatiñan jaqëtaswa uñachtʼayi . ‘ Qollqe añcha munañajj taqe jan waltʼäwinakan mä saphipawa .
Qollqe añcha munañampi apayasipjjatap laykuw yaqhepas kunayman llakinakamp apjjatasipjje ’ ( 1 Timoteo 6 : 10 ) .
¿ “ Qollqe añcha munañajj ” kuna jan walinakansa uñjasiyistaspa ?
Llakisisajj janiw iksnati .
Taqe kunanïkasas janiw kusisit jakasksnati .
Wali llakitaw jikjjatassna .
¿ Kunjam chuymanïñas kusisit jakasiñatak yanaptʼistaspa ?
Kunatï utjkistu ukanakamp kusisitäña .
Wajjtʼasirïña .
Cosasanakar munasiñat sipansa jaqenakar munasiña .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
USUNAKAJJ AYNACHTʼAYISTASPAWA .
Ulf sat chachajj sano jaqënwa , wal trabajtʼiriraki .
Ukampis mä akatjamat usuntasajj janiw cuerpop onjjtayirjamäjjänti .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Wal llakisiyäta , janiw kuns lurañ munjjayätti , ni chʼamas utj - jjetänti ” sasa .
Janiw khitis usuntañat salvasksnati , ukwa Ulf chachar kunatï paskäna ukajj amuytʼayistu .
Ukatwa usunakat jarkʼaqasiñatakejj cuidasiñasa .
Ukampis usuntsna ukhajja , ¿ janit kusisit jakasjjsna ?
Kunjamtï yatjjatkañänejja , usuntatäkasas kusisitaw jakassna .
¿ Kuna ewjjtʼanakas jan usuntañatak yanaptʼistaspa ?
AMUYUMPIW TAQE KUNS LURAÑASA . .
Sinti manqʼañasa umañasa usuntayistaspawa , qollqsa tukjasiraksnawa .
Ukatwa Bibliajj akham ewjjtʼistu : “ Machir jaqenakampejj jan mayachasimti , janirak sinti manqʼeri jaqenakampisa .
Machirinakasa , sinti manqʼerinakasa tukjasiñaruw puripjje ” sasa ( Proverbios 23 : 20 , 21 ) .
CUERPOSAJJ QʼOMÄÑAPAWA .
“ Kunanakatï cuerposarus amuyusarus qʼañuchki ukanakat qʼomachasipjjañäni ” .
Walja jaqenakaw cigarro fumasa , alcohol sint umasa jan ukajj drogasisajj cuerpop qʼañuchapjje .
Uka toqet yatjjattʼat jaqenakajj akham sapjjewa : “ Cigarro fumirejj kunayman usunakampiw usuntaspa , taqpach cuerpoparuw jan waltʼayarakispa ” sasa ( Centros para el Control y la Prevención de Enfermedades de Estados Unidos ) .
JAKÄWISAJJ DIOSAN REGALOPAWA .
“ Jiwasas jupïpanwa jakasktanjja , sarnaqasktanjja , utjaskaraktanjja ” .
Uk yatiñaw wali amuyumpi trabajiñatakisa , kusistʼañatakisa , auto apnaqañatakis yanaptʼistani .
Mä rat kusistʼañ laykuki wiñayatak usuchjata qheparañajja , janipuniw walïkaspati .
JANIW AYNACHTʼAYIR AMUYUNAKAMPI APAYASIÑASÄKITI .
Aynachtʼayir amuyunakajj cuerposar jan waltʼayiwa .
Ukatwa jan sint llakisiñatakisa , jan envidiasiñatakisa , coleramp jan atipayasiñatakis chʼamachasiñasa .
Bibliajj akham sasaw ewjjtʼistu : “ Qʼapisiñ apanukum , chuym chʼamaktʼayasiñ jaytanukum ” sasa ( Salmo 37 : 8 ) .
“ Jan qharürut llakisipjjamti , qharürojj yaqha llakinakaw utjarakini ” sasaw saraki .
KUNATÏ YANAPTʼKISTASPA UKANAKATWA LUPʼIÑASA .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Samarañ chuymanïñajj cuerporojj jakañwa churi ” sasa ( Proverbios 14 : 30 ) .
Ukat akham sarakiwa : ‘ Kusisit chuymajj jaqen jakañapwa sumaptayi ’ sasa ( Proverbios 17 : 22 ) .
Uka arunakajj cheqäskapuniwa .
Ministerio de Salud de Escocia ukan trabajiri , Derek Cox sat doctorajj akham siwa : “ Kusisit sarnaqer jaqenakajja , llakit sarnaqer jaqenakat sipansa , janiw jankʼak usuntapkiti ” sasa .
JANIW LLAKIMP AYNACHTʼAÑASÄKITI .
Ulf chachajja , jan qollkay usump usuntasajj janiw llakimp aynachtʼkänti .
Jiwasajj ukhamarakiw wali usuta uñjasiñäni ukhajj jan aynachtʼañasäkiti , antisas ukar saykatañatakiw chʼamachasiñasa .
Yaqhepajja , llakimp apayasisajj jukʼampiw aynachtʼapjje .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Tʼaqhesiña horasantejj mayjtʼasïta ukapachajja , jukʼa chʼamanikiwa jikjjatasjjäta ” sasa ( Proverbios 24 : 10 ) .
Yaqhep jaqenakajja , usuntasajj llakimp aynachtʼañat sipansa , ukar saykatañatakiw chʼamachasipjje .
Kunanaktï lurirjamäpki ukanakwa lurapjjaraki .
Ulf chachajj ukhamwa luräna , jupajj akham siwa : “ Diosar mayisiña ukat Biblian yatichäwinakapat lupʼiñaw llakisiñat sipansa , kuntï lurirjamäkta ukanak lurañatak yanaptʼitu ” sasa .
Walja jaqenakaw ukham wali usut uñjasipjje , jupanakjamarakiw Ulf chachajj khuyapayasirïña ukat mayninakat llakisiñ yateqäna , ukham chuymanïñaw jaqenakarus Bibliat yatiyañatak yanaptʼäna .
Steve sat chachajj ukhamarakiw tʼaqesïna . 15 maranïkasajja , mä arbolat jalaqtasaw jan walin uñjasïna , cuerpopajj janiw kunkat aynacharojj onjjtjjänti . 18 maranëjjäna ukhajj amparanakap onjjtayjjänwa .
Qhepatjja , universidadaruw saräna , ukanwa alcohol umañaru , droganakaru , qʼañu juchanakan sarnaqañar yatintäna .
Jupajj janiw sum jakasiñ suyjjänti .
Ukampis Bibliat yateqañaw vicionakap apanukuñatakisa , kusisit jakasiñatakis yanaptʼäna .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Walja maranakaw llakimp aynachtʼata jakasiyäta , jichhajj chuymajan sum jikjjatasta , kusisitaw jakasirakta ” sasa .
Steve ukat Ulf chachanakan jakäwipajja , Salmo 19 : 7 , 8 qellqatatwa amtayistu , ukan akham siwa : ‘ Tatitun arsutanakapajj cheqapawa , jaqen chuymapar machaqaptayiriwa .
Tatitun arunakapajj cheqapawa , chuymar kusisiyiriwa ; Tatitun arsutanakapajj qʼomawa , nayranakar qhan chuririwa ’ sasa .
Diosan leyinakapasa yatichäwinakapasa chʼam chuririwa , chuymasar kusisiyiriwa , nayranakasar qhanartayiriwa ( Salmo 19 : 7 , 8 ) .
¿ Kun lurañasatakis Bibliajj chʼamañchtʼistu ?
Amuyump taqe kuns lurañataki .
Cuerposar jan qʼañuchañataki .
Jakäwisar wali valoranit uñjañataki .
Aynachtʼayir amuyunakamp jan apayasiñataki .
Kunatï yanaptʼkistaspa ukanakat lupʼiñataki .
Llakimp jan aynachtʼañataki .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
JAQENAKAJJ MAYNINAKAN MUNATÄÑ WAL MUNAPJJE .
Matrimonionsa , familiansa , amigonakamp sum apasiñatakisa , munasiñajj wali wakiskiriwa .
Munasiñajj amuyusansa chuymasansa sum jikjjatasiñatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Ukampis ¿ kuna kasta munasiñatsa parlasktanjja ?
Janiw chacha warmjam munasiñat parlktanti , jan ukasti jukʼamp wakiskir yaqha munasiñatwa parlasktanjja .
Uka kasta munasiñan jaqejja , janiw munañapak thaqkiti , jan ukasti chuymatpachwa mayninakat llakisi .
Uka munasiñajj Biblian yatichäwinakaparjamawa . Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Munasir jaqejj paciencianiwa , khuyapayasiriwa .
Munasir jaqejj janiw envidiasirïkiti , janiw jachʼa jachʼa tukurïkiti , janiw wali wal tukurïkiti , janiw kunatï jan lurañäki ukanak lurkiti , janiw kunatï jupatak walïki ukak thaqkiti , janirakiw jankʼak coleraskiti .
Janiw kuna jan wal luratas amjjäskiti .
Kunatï jan cheqapäki ukatjja janiw kusiskiti , jan ukasti kunatejj cheqäki ukatwa kusisi .
Munasir jaqejj taqe kunansa amukiw tʼaqesi , [ . . . ] taqe kun suytʼi , taqe kun aguanti .
Munasiñajj janipuniw tukuskiti ” .
“ Munasiñajj janipuniw tukuskiti ” .
Tiempompejj jukʼampiw uka munasiñajj jiltaspa .
Munasir jaqejj pacienciani , khuyapayasiri , perdonasiri ukhamawa , ukatwa Bibliajj “ munasiñajj wali sum mayachthapi ” sasin qhanañchi .
Ukhamasti , munasiñajj utjki ukhajj taqenimpiw sum apastanjja .
Pantjasirïkstansa , kusisitaw jakastanjja .
Jichhajj casarat chacha warminakat parltʼañäni .
Jesucristojj chacha warmjam sum jakasiñatakejj suma ewjjanakwa yatichäna .
Jupajj akham sänwa : “ ‘ Chachajj awkiparus taykaparus jaytjjani [ wa ] , ukatsti warmipampiw mayachasjjarakini , panipasti mä jañchikëjjapjjaniwa ’ [ . . . ] .
Ukhamajj kuntï Diosajj mä yukur mayachki ukjja , jan khiti jaqes jaljtaypanti ” sasa .
Aka textonjja , pä suma ewjjanakaw utji .
“ PANIPASTI MÄ JAÑCHIKËJJAPJJANIWA ” .
Matrimonionjja munasiñaw utjañapa . Chacha warminakatï munasipjjani ukhajja , janiw yaqha chachampisa ni yaqha warmimpis sarnaqapkaniti .
Mä arunjja , janiw yaqha chachampisa ni yaqha warmimpis ikintasipkaniti .
Maynejj yaqhamp sarnaqki ukhajja , familiarojj jan waltʼayiwa , wawanakas wal tʼaqesipjje . Awk taykapajj janis jupanakar munasipkaspa ukhamwa amuyasipjjaspa , chuym ustʼataw jakasipjjarakispa .
‘ KUNTÏ DIOSAJJ MAYACHKI UKA ’ .
Matrimoniojj Dios nayraqatan wali qʼomawa .
Chacha warminakajj ukham uñjapjje ukhajja , sum apasiñatakiw chʼamachasipjje .
Jan walinak utjkipansa janiw jaljtapkiti .
Niyakejjay wal munasipjjchejja , jan walinak askichañataki , sumankañataki , purapat sum uñjasiñatakiw chʼamachasipjje .
Wawanakajja , awk taykapajj purapat munasiñampi uñjasipjje ukhajj kusisitaw jakasipjje .
Jessica sat mä tawaqojj akham siwa : “ Awk taykajajj wali munasiñampi respetompiw uñjasipjje .
Papitujajj kuns amti ukhajja , mamitajajj respetompiw istʼi , uk uñjañajj mamajat yateqasiñatakiw chʼamañchtʼitu ” sasa .
Diosajj wali munasiriwa .
Ukatwa “ Diosajj munasiñawa ” sasin Bibliajj qhanañchi .
‘ Kusisiri Diosawa ’ sasin Jupat saraki .
Ukhamajj jiwasatï Diosjam munasirïñäni ukhajja , kusisitaw jakasiñäni .
Efesios 5 : 1 , 2 qellqatajj akham siwa : “ Diosan munat wawanakapjamajj jupat yateqasipjjam , munasiñan sarnaqasipkakim ” sasa .
Munasir jaqejj paciencianiwa , khuyapayasiriwa , taqe kunansa amukiw tʼaqesi , taqe kun suytʼi , taqe kun aguanti .
Munasiñajj janipuniw tukuskiti ( 1 Corintios 13 : 4 - 8 ) .
¿ Kunatsa munasiñajj kusisit jakasiñatak yanaptʼistu ?
Mayninakat llakisiñatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Tiempompejj jukʼampiw munasiñajj jiltaspa .
Matrimonionsa amigonakasampis sumwa apasiñäni , jan waltʼäwinakarus atipjarakiñäniwa .
Wawanakajj kusisitaw jakasipjjani .
Diosat yateqasiñatakiw yanaptʼistu .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
“ WAWÄKAYÄTA UKHAJJA , FAMILIAJAN WAL TOQESIPJJERÏNA ” sasaw Patricia warmejj säna .
Jupajj akham saskakiwa : “ Janiw perdonañ yatkayätti .
Jilirëjjasasa , chuym ustʼayapjjetäna ukhajj walja urunakaw ukjjat lupʼiskakirïta , janiw ikirïktsa ” sasa .
Colerasiñasa chuym ustʼayasiñasa janiw kusisit jakaykistaspati , usuntaraksnawa .
Yatjjattʼat jaqenakarjamajja , mayninakar jan perdonañ yatipki ukanakajj ¿ kunjamäpjjesa ?
Colerata , chuym ustʼataw sarnaqapjje , mayninakampis janiw sum apasipkiti .
Ukatwa saparstʼata , yaqhachata amuyasipjje .
Jankʼakiw kunatsa chuym ustʼayasipjje , llakimpis wal aynachtʼapjje .
Mayninakajj kunjamsa chuym ustʼayapjje ukjjat wal lupʼipjje , ukatwa jan kusisit jakasipkiti .
Jan wal lurapjjatap amuyasisajj llakitakiw sarnaqapjje .
Llakimpiw aynachtʼapjje , presión alta , artritis , migraña asunakampiw usuntapjjarakispa , jan ukajj chuymatwa usuntapjjaspa .
*
¿ PERDONAÑAJJ KAMSAÑSA MUNI ?
Jan colerasiña , jan chuyma ustʼayasiña , jan pachpat pachpa kuttʼayaña sañwa muni .
Ukampis ukajja , janiw kuna jan waltï maynejj lurki ukajj walikïkaspasa , janis kunas paskaspa ukham uñjaña sañ munkiti .
Perdonir jaqejja , mayninakamp sum apasiñatakiw chʼamachasi , ukatwa perdonañ amti .
Perdonir jaqejja , janiw mayninakan jan pantjasipjjañap suykiti , taqeniw luratanakasansa arsutanakasansa pantjastanjja .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Jumanak taypin kuna quejasiñas utjchi ukhasa , maynit maynikam aguantasisipkakim , jumanakkamajj taqe chuyma perdonasipjjarakim ” sasa .
Ukhamajj mayninakar perdontan ukhajja , jupanakar munasitaswa uñachtʼaytanjja . “ Munasiñajj wali sum mayachthapi ” .
Clínica Mayo ukarjamajja , ¿ perdonir jaqenakajj kunjamäpjjesa ?
Niyakejjay mayninakat sinttʼasiri khuyaptʼayasiri ukhamäpjjchejja , taqenimpiw sum apasipjje .
Janiw jan wali amuyunakamp apayasipkiti , Diosampis sum apasipjje .
Janiw llakimp aynachtʼapkiti , ni ratukis colerasipkiti .
Janiw aynachtʼayir amuyunakampi apayasipkiti .
JIWASPACHPA PERDONASIÑA .
Mä revistajj akham siwa : “ Jiwaspachpa perdonasiñajja , jan usuntañataki ukat suma amuyunakanïñatakiw yanaptʼistu . Ukampis ukham lurañajj wali chʼamawa ” ( Disability & Rehabilitation ) .
Jiwaspachpa perdonasiñatakejja , ¿ kunjam chuymanïñas yanaptʼistaspa ?
Janiw perfectöñ suyañasäkiti .
Pantjasiñajj utjakipuniniwa ( Eclesiastés 7 : 20 ) .
Pantjasitanakasatwa yateqañasa , ukhamat jan mayamp pantjasiñataki .
Paciencianïñasawa .
Kunjam jaqëtansa uk janiw jankʼak apanuksnati .
Suma amigonakwa thaqañasa , jupanakaw chʼamañchtʼistani , yanaptʼistani , ukhamarak qhana arunakamp ewjjtʼapjjestani ( Proverbios 13 : 20 ) .
Yaqhanakar chuyma ustʼaykañäni ukhajja , jankʼakiw humilde chuymamp perdón mayisiñasa .
Mayninakampi sum apasiñajja , chuymasan sum jikjjatasiñatakiw yanaptʼistani .
Patricia warmirojja , Biblian yatichäwinakapaw perdonirïñatak yanaptʼäna .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Colerasiñajj janiw sum jakaykitänti .
Uk apanukjjasajj sumakiw jakasjjayäta .
Janiw tʼaqesjjayätti ni yaqhanakarus tʼaqesiyjjayätti .
Diosajj wal munasistu , sum jakasiñaswa munaraki , ukwa Bibliajj yatichistu ” sasa .
Ron sutini mä chacharojja , Biblian yatichäwinakapaw sum jakasiñatak yanaptʼarakïna .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Kuntï mayninakajj amuyapki lurapkaraki uk janiw nayajj mayjtʼaykiristti , ukampis kunanaksa lurä lupʼirakï ukajj nayatäjjewa .
Suman jakasiñatakejja , janiw chuyma ustʼayasiñajäkänti ni colerasiñajäkänsa ” sasa .
Ukanakajj aka cheqanakat apstʼatawa : sitio web de la Clínica Mayo , sitio web de Johns Hopkins Medicine , ukhamarak revista Social Psychiatry and Psychiatric Epidemiology .
“ Maynit maynikam aguantasisipkakim , jumanakkamajj taqe chuyma perdonasipjjarakim ” ( Colosenses 3 : 13 ) .
¿ Kunjamsa perdonasirïñajj yanaptʼistu ?
Mayninakampejj sum apasiñäni , chuymasas chuymäniwa .
Janiw llakimp aynachtʼkañäniti , ni colerampis apayaskañäniti .
Janiw jan wali amuyunakamp apayaskañäniti , janirakiw usuntkañäniti , Diosampis sum apasiñäni .

¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
JAQENAKAJJ QELLQAÑA , PINTAÑA , KUNAYMANINAK LURAÑWA YATTANJJA , AKHAM SASAW JISKTʼASIRAKTANJJA : ¿ Khitis oraqsa alajjpachsa lurawayi ?
¿ Khitis lurawayistu ?
¿ Kuna amtamp luratätansa ?
¿ Kunas jutïr urunakan pasani ?
Yaqhep jaqenakajja , “ janiw khitis uka jisktʼanakar qhanañchkaspati ” sasaw amuyapjje , ukatwa uka jisktʼanak jan jisktʼasjjapjjeti .
Yaqhepasti , “ monot jutatätanwa , ukhamajj janiw uka jisktʼanak jisktʼasiñajj wakiskiti ” sasaw amuyapjjaraki .
Historia ukat Biología yatichiri William Provine sat profesorajj akham sänwa : “ Janiw diosanakasa ni kunat jakañas utjkiti .
Kunatï walïki jan walïkaraki uk lurañas janiw wakiskiti , janiw jakañataki mä suma amtas utjkistuti ” sasa .
Ukampis yaqhep jaqenakajj janiw ukham amuyapkiti .
“ Taqe kunatï alajjpachansa oraqensa utjki ukanakajj suma uttʼayata leyinakarjamaw onjjtapjje , taqe kunas lugarapankiwa ” sasaw amuyapjje .
Animalanaka ukat panqaranak uñjasajj wal musparapjje , ukanakar uñtasitaw kuna aparatonaksa lurañ munapjje .
Taqe kunan wali suma lurtʼatätap uñjasajja , “ janiw ukanakajj aleq ukhamatak uñstkaspati ” sasaw sapjje .
Ukatwa evolución toqet yaqhep yatjjatirinakajj jan nayrjam amuyjjapjjeti .
Uka toqet jichhajj mä chachampita mä warmimpit parltʼañäni .
ALEXEI MARNOV , NEUROCIRUJANO .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Escuelanjja , Diosajj janiw utjkiti , taqe kunas evolución toqew utji sasaw yatichapjjetäna .
Diosar creyipkäna ukanakajj janis kuns yatipkaspa ukham uñjatäpjjänwa ” sasa .
Ukampis 1990 marat aksarojja , janiw ukham amuyjjänti .
Jupajj akham saskakiwa : “ Kunatsa taqe kunas utji uk wal yatiñ munirïta .
Aka toqet amuytʼañäni , jaqen lejjwipajja jan ukajj lajjwipajj wali musparkañ luratawa .
Ukampis jaqenakajj mä qhawqha maranakakwa jaktanjja . Ukhamajj ‘ ¿ kunatsa lejjwejj taqe kun yateqañataki suma lurtʼatäpacha ? ’
sasaw jisktʼasirïta .
Ukajj janiw amuyañjamäkänti .
Ukatwa akham jisktʼasiyäta : ‘ ¿ Kuna amtamp luratätansa ?
¿ Kunatsa jaktanjja ? ’
sasa . Uka toqet wal amuykiptʼasajja , taqe kunas maynin luratätapwa amuyayäta ” .
Kuna amtamp luratätansa uk wal yatiñ munasajja , Alexei chachajj Bibliat yateqañwa qalltäna .
Uka tiemponjja , doctorat trabajiri esposapajj janiw Diosar creykänti , ukatwa esposopan pantjasiskatap uñachtʼayañatakejj Bibliat yateqañ qalltarakïna .
Jichhajj panpachaniw Diosar creyipjje , jaqenakajj kuna amtamp luratätansa uksa yatjjapjjarakiwa .
HUABI YIN , CIENTÍFICA .
Física toqet yatjjattʼata Huabi Yin sat warmejja , walja maranakaw Intejj kunjamasa uka toqet yatjjatäna .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Kunapachatï cientificonakajj kunanakatï alajjpachansa oraqensa paski ukanakat yatjjatapjjta ukhajja , taqe kunas suma uttʼayata leyinakarjam onjjtapjjatapwa amuyapjjta .
Ukatwa akham jisktʼasirïta : ‘ ¿ Khitis uka leyinak uttʼayawayi ?
Manqʼa phayañatak apnaqktan uka ninas maynin uñjatäñapawa , ¿ Intit kamsaraksnasa ?
¿ Jan sinti juntʼuptañapatakejj khitis leyinak uttʼayawayi ? ’ sasa .
Biblian aka arunakapaw jisktʼanakajar qhanañchitäna : ‘ Taqe kunan qalltäwipanjja Diosajj alajjpacha , ukhamarak akapacha luräna ’ ” ( Génesis 1 : 1 ) .
Kunatï alajjpachansa oraqensa utjki ukanakajj kunjamäpjjesa uk amuyañatakejja , cientificonakaw yanaptʼapjjestu .
Akanakat amuytʼañäni , pʼeqesan utjki uka neuronanakajj kunjamäpjjesa , Intejj kunjamsa qhantani juntʼuptaniraki ukanak amuyañatakiw cientificonakajj yanaptʼapjjestu .
Ukampis kunatsa alajjpachasa oraqes utji , kunatsa ukanak apnaqeri suma uttʼayat leyinakas utjaraki , jaqenakas kuna amtamp luratätansa ukanakjja , Bibliaw amuytʼayistu .
Ukwa Alexei chachasa Huabi warmisa uñjawayapjje .
Diosajj janiw aka oraqjja chʼusäñapatak lurkänti , ‘ jan ukasti jaqenïñapatakiw ’ luräna sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi ( Isaías 45 : 18 ) .
Diosajj mä amtampiw aka oraq lurawayi .
Kunjamtï jutïr yatichäwin yatjjatkañänejja , Diosan amtapajj jutïr urunakanwa phoqasini , ukwa suyasktanjja .
Diosajj janiw aka oraqjja chʼusäñapataki lurkiti , jan ukasti jaqenïñapatakiw luräna ( Isaías 45 : 18 ) .
“ Mä amtamp jakañasawa ”
“ Jukʼamp maranak jakañatakisa llakimp jan aynachtʼañatakisa , mä amtamp jakañasawa ” sasaw Psicología yatichiri William McDougall sat profesorajj säna .
Psicología yatichiri Carol Ryff sat profesorajj akham sarakïnwa : “ Mä amtamp jakapki uka jaqenakajja , janiw añch usuntapkiti . Janirakiw llakimpis aynachtʼapkiti . Chuymatsa janiw facilak usuntapkaspati . Wilajj pʼeqepan phallaspa ( derrame cerebral ) ukhasa , jankʼakiw waliptapjjaspa . Jukʼamp maranakaw jakapjjarakispa ” sasa .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
‘ Amtäwinakajajj jumanakan askimatakiwa , janiw jan waltʼapjjañamatakïkiti , ukhamat qhepa urunakan wali sum jakasipjjañamataki , suytʼañansa phoqantataraki ’ ( Jeremías 29 : 11 ) .
“ DIOSAMP SUM APASIÑATAKEJJA , JUTÏR URUNAK SUYTʼAÑAJJ WALI WAKISKIRIWA ” sasaw mä librojj qhanañchi .
“ Ukarakiw jan sapak jikjjatasiñatakisa , janis kun lurirjamäksna ukham jan amuyasiñatakisa , jan ajjsarañatakis yanaptʼistu ” ( Hope in the Age of Anxiety ) .
Jutïr urunak suytʼañajj kunja wakiskirisa uk Bibliajj qhanañcharakiwa , ukampis akham sasaw ewjjtʼarakistu : “ Jilïr jaqenakarojj jan alkatapjjamti , jiwir jaqëpjjatap laykojj , janiw qhespiyapkaspati ” sasa ( Salmo 146 : 3 ) .
Jaqenakar confiyañat sipansa , Diosaruw confiyañasa , Jupajj promesanakap phoqañatakejj wali chʼamaniwa .
Kunanak lurañsa Diosajj arsuwayi ukwa jichhajj mä qhawqhanak uñjañäni .
JAN WALINAKAJJ JANIW UTJ - JJANITI , SUMA CHUYMAN JAQENAKAS WIÑAYATAKIW JAKAPJJANI .
“ Akat mä jukʼa urunakarojj ñanqha lurir jaqenakajj chhaqtjjaniwa ; [ . . . ] llampʼu chuymaninakasti oraq katoqapjjani , jilarkir sumankañampiw kusisipjjarakini ” ( Salmo 37 : 10 , 11 ) .
Salmo 37 : 29 textojj akham sarakiwa : ‘ Aski jan ukajj suma chuyman jaqenakajj wiñayatakiw aka oraqen jakapjjani ’ sasa .

GUERRANAKAJJ JANIW UTJ - JJANITI .
“ [ Jehová Diosajj ] aka oraq tukuskamaw nuwasiñ tʼakurayi ; arconak jiskʼa jiskʼa pʼakinoqe , lansanak tʼunari , nuwasiñ carronaksa ninampiw phichhantaraki ” ( Salmo 46 : 8 , 9 ) .
JANIW USUNAKASA , TʼAQESIÑASA , JIWAÑAS UTJ - JJANITI .
“ Diosajj taqe jachanakapwa nayranakapat picharani , janiw jiwañajj jukʼamp utj - jjaniti , janirakiw llakisiñasa , jachañasa ni usuyasiñasa jukʼamp utj - jjaniti ” .
TAQENITAKIW WALJA MANQʼAÑANAKAJJ UTJANI .
“ Trigojj yapunakan jilarkir utjpan , qollu patanakansti jilantarakpan ” ( Salmo 72 : 16 ) .
CRISTON REINOPAJJ CHEQAPAR APNAQERI MÄ SUMA GOBIERNÖNIWA .
“ [ Jesucristoruw ] munañanïñasa , jachʼa kankañasa , reinosa churatarakïna , taqe markankiri jaqenaka , kunayman casta parlani jaqenakarakiw juparojj servipjjäna .
Chʼamapajj pachpakïskaniwa , reinopasa janirakiw tʼunjatäkaniti ” ( Daniel 7 : 14 ) .
Uka promesanakajj phoqasipuniniwa sasin ¿ kunatsa sissna ?
Jesusajj aka oraqenkkäna ukhajja , mä reyjam apnaqañatakejj suma wakichtʼatätapwa uñachtʼayäna .
Jupajj usutanakaruw qolläna , pobrenakaruw manqʼa churäna , jiwatanakarus jaktayarakïnwa .
Jukʼampisa , kunjamatsa jaqenakajj sumankañana , mayachtʼata wiñayatak jakasipjjaspa ukwa yatichäna .
Qhepa urunakan kunanakas pasani uksa qhanañcharakïnwa .
Jesusan arunakaparjamajja , kunayman jan walinakaw qhepa urunakan utjañapäna .
‘ Akapachajj niya tukusiñampïskani ukhajja ’ , mä markajj yaqha marka contraw sartani , manqʼat pistʼañanakasa , usunakasa , jachʼa terremotonakas ukjan akjan utjani sasaw Jesusajj säna .
Ukat akham sarakïnwa : “ Jan wali luräwinakan jiljjattatap laykojja , niya taqe jaqenakan munasiñapaw thayarani ” sasa .
Kunjamtï 2 Timoteo 3 : 1 - 5 textojj siskejja , jaqenakan jan sinttʼasirïpjjatapajj qhanaw jichhürunakan uñjasi .
Uka textorjamajja , “ qhepa urunakanjja ” jaqenakajj jupanak pachpa munasirinaka , qollqe añcha munirinaka , pachpa munañapak thaqerinaka , jachʼa jachʼa tukurinaka , qhorunaka , jan munasirinaka , awkiparus taykaparus jan istʼirinaka , Dios chuymäpkaspas ukham tukurinaka ukhamäpjjañapänwa .
Jan waltʼäwinakajj utjki ukanakajj qhepa urunakan jakataswa uñachtʼayistu .
Diosan Reinopajj wali jakʼankatapwa uñachtʼayarakistu , uka tiemponjj taqeniw wali sum jakasjjañäni .
Qhepa urunakat parlkasajja , Jesusajj akham sarakïnwa : “ Reinon aka suma yatiyäwinakapajja aka oraqpachanwa yatiyasini , ukhamat taqe markanakan yatipjjañapataki .
Ukjjaruw akapachan tukusiñapajj jutani ” sasa .
Uka suma yatiyäwinakajja , jan wali jaqenakatakejj juchañchir arunakawa .
Suma chuyman jaqenakarusti , “ Diosajj niyaw promesanakap phoqani ” sasin confiyañatakiw yanaptʼi .
¿ Diosan promesanakapat jukʼamp yatiñ munasmati ?
Ukhamächi ukhajja , aka revistan qhep qhepa yatichäwip liytʼañamatakiw chʼamañchtʼapjjsma .
¿ KUNJAMATSA KUSISIT JAKASSNA ?
¿ Kunjamatsa familian kusisit jakasirista ?
Suma amigöñatakisa suma amigonak jikjjatañatakisa , ¿ kunas yanaptʼitaspa ?
¿ Jiwat familiaranakajajj jaktanipjjpachäniti ?
¿ Tʼaqesiñanakajj tukusjjpachäniti ?
¿ Jaqenakat aka oraqe tukjapjjpachäni ?
¿ Taqpach religionanakat Diosar adorapjjpacha ?
Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma , uka cheqajj 900 jila arunakanwa utji .
Ukanwa walja toqenakat parliri suma yatichäwinak liytʼäta .
Kunayman jakasiri jaqenakajj kunjamatsa kusisit jakasiñ jikjjatawayapjje , jichhas kusisit jakasisipkaki uka toqet parliri videonakaw uka cheqan utji .
Jupanakat yaqhepajj drogasipjjerïnwa , jan ukajj carcelan jistʼantatäpjjänwa .
Suma yatjjattʼata jaqenakatwa uka videonakajj parlaraki , jupanakat waljanejj cientificonakäpjjewa .
Biblia jan ukajj Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanak liytʼañatakisa apaqañatakisa , Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma .
Uka qellqatanakat yaqhepajj akanakawa :
Familiamajj kusisitaw jakasispa
Kunjamatsa wali kusisit jakassna
Diosan apayanit suma yatiyäwinaka
© 2018 Watch Tower Bible and Tract Society of Pennsylvania
Aka qellqatajj oraqpachan Bibliat yatichañataki luratawa , uka yatichäwejja yanaptʼañ munirinakan donacionanakapampiw apasi , janiw aljasiñapäkiti .
Kunjamsa donacionamampi yanaptʼasma uk yatiñatakejja , Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma .
Textonakajja , Génesis librot Malaquías librokamajj Qullan Arunaka , 1992 Bibliat apstʼatawa .
Mateo librot Apocalipsis librokamajja , Machaq Mundon Jakirinakataki Diosan Arunakapa Bibliata apstʼatarakiwa .
Kawkjantï NM letranakampi qhanañchaskejja Traducción del Nuevo Mundo de las Santas Escrituras ( con referencias ) español aruta apstʼatarakiwa . Jan ukhamäkanejja qhanañchasiniwa .
Aka tiemponjja , familianakajj janiw sum jakasjjapjjeti sasaw waljanejj sapjje , ukampis ¿ kunatsa walja familianakajj mayachtʼata sum jakasipjje ?
¿ Kunas uka familianakar yanaptʼpacha ?
Instituto Nacional de Estadísticas ( INE ) ukarjamajja , Bolivia markan 2014 maranjja , 9.788 divorcio certificadonakaw churasïna , ukampis 2015 maranjja , 14.268 divorcio certificadonakaw churasjjäna .
Wali yatjjattʼat jaqenakajja , wawanakarojj janiw jawqʼjañäkisa ni kamsañäkisa sasaw sapjje . Yaqhepasti , wawanakarojj jawqʼjasapuniw yatichañasa sasaw sapjjaraki .
Awk taykanakajj kun lurañas walïspa uk janiw yatjjapjjeti .
Wayn tawaqonakajja , jilïr jaqëjjasin sum jakasiñatakejj janiw wakichtʼatäpkiti .
Ukampis janiw ukhamäñapapunïkiti .
Chacha warmjamajj kusisita , jan jaljtasaw jakassna .
Awk taykanakajj wawanakapar munasiñamp cheqañchañwa yateqapjjaspa .
Wayn tawaqonakajja , jilïr jaqëjjasin sum jakasiñatakiw wakichtʼasipjjaspa .
¿ Kunas familianakar yanaptʼaspa ?
¡ Sartapjjañäni !
sat aka payïr revistanwa , familian sum jakasiñataki 12 yanaptʼanakajj utji .
Janipun jaljtañ amtaña
Purapat yanaptʼasiña
Respetasiña
Perdonasiña
Sum parltʼasiña
Cheqañchaña
Sum yatichaña
Luratasamp yatichaña
Kunjam jaqëtas uk yatiña
Confiykañ jaqëña
Suma trabajtʼirïña
Kuns luräta uk amtaña
Jan jaljtañ amtamp casarasiñajj mä anclar uñtatawa , ukaw problemanakamp jan atipjayasiñatak yanaptʼistu .
CHACHA WARMINAKATAKI
Janipun jaljtañ amtamp casarasipki uka chacha warminakajja , jan jaljtasa jiwañkam jakañatakiw amtapjje .
Ukaw taqe confiyansamp sum jakasiñatak yanaptʼi .
“ Kunas kunäpan janipuniw jaljtkañäniti ” sasaw casarasipjje .
Yaqhep chacha warminakajja , familiapana jan ukajj amigonakapan “ janiw jaljtapjjañamäkiti ” satakiw jan jaljtapkiti .
Ukampis munasiñampi respetomp utjatapatwa jan jaljtapjjañapäkiti .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Chachajj janirakiw warmipar jaytanukuñapäkiti ” ( 1 Corintios 7 : 11 ) .
“ Jan jaljtañ amtamp casarasktan ukhajja , janiw jankʼak chuym ustʼayasktanti .
Perdonañasa perdón mayisiñas janiw chʼamäkiti . Jan waltʼäwinakajj utjki ukhasa , jaljtañ amtañat sipansa , ukanak jankʼak askichañatakiw chʼamachastanjja ” ( Micah ) .
Jaljtañ amtamp casarasir chacha warminakajja , familian problemanakajj utjki ukhajj chachapas warmipas janis jupatakïkaspa ukhamwa amuyjjapjje , jankʼakiw jaljtañatak kuns thaqapjjaraki .
“ Waljaniw divorciasiñ amtamp casarasipjje .
Jumatï uka amtamp casarastajja , maynimp jan jaljtasa jakañajj janiw chuymaman utjkänti ” ( Jean ) .
AKHAM JISKTʼASIM
“ Chacha warmjam jan waltʼayasipkta ukhajja , . . .
. . ¿ ‘ kunatakis casaraspachätjja ’ sasat arrepentistjja ? ” .
. . ¿ ‘ yaqhampïrista ukhajj kunjamakïspasa ’ sasat amuytjja ? ” .
. . ¿ ‘ jaytjämawa ’ jan ukajj ‘ yaqhampiw sarjjä ’ sasat saraktjja ? ” .
Uka jisktʼanakat mayarukis “ jïsa ” sasin sawaysta ukhajja , jan jaljtañ amtamp casaraskta ukarjam sarnaqañatakiw chʼamachasiñama .
CHACHA WARMI PARLTʼASIÑATAKI
¿ “ Jiwañkamaw juntüñäni ” sasin arsuwayktan uk armasjjtanti ?
Ukhamächi ukhajja , ¿ kunatsa ukhamar purtʼastanjja ?
Jan jaljtañ amtamp casarasktan ukarjam sarnaqañatakejj ¿ kunas yanaptʼistaspa ?
AKANAKWA LURASMA
Esposomarusa jan ukajj esposamarus qhawqsa munasta uk mä jiskʼa tarjetar qellqtʼasaw jupar churasma .
Jupan fotopwa kawkjantï trabajta ukan uchasisma .
Trabajonkkasasa yaqha cheqar sarasasa , sapür jawsañatakiw chʼamachasiñama .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Kuntï Diosajj mä yukur mayachki ukjja , jan khiti jaqes jaljtaypanti ” ( Mateo 19 : 6 ) .
Purapat yanaptʼasipjjäta ukhajja , avión apnaqeri mä pilotompi yanapiripampjamaw mä amtampik kuns lurapjjäta .
CHACHA WARMINAKATAKI
Purapat yanaptʼasiri chacha warminakajja , avión apnaqeri mä pilotompiru yanapiripampir uñtatäpjjewa .
Problemanakajj utjki ukhajja , kunas sapa maynitak walïspa uk lupʼiskañat sipansa , kunas panipar yanaptʼaspa uk amuyañatakiw chʼamachasipjje .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Janiw paninëjjapjjeti , jan ukasti mä jañchikëjjapjjewa ” ( Mateo 19 : 6 ) .
“ Chacha warmjam sum jakasiñatakejja , purapatwa yanaptʼasipjjañapa ” ( Christopher ) .
Chacha warmitï purapat jan yanaptʼasipkani ukhajja , problemanakajj utjkani ukhajj askichañat sipansa , jupanakpurakiw jan waltʼayasipjjani . Kuna jiskʼa problemanaksa jachʼaruw tukuyapjjani .
“ Matrimonionjja purapat yanaptʼasiñajj wali wakiskiriwa .
Nanakatï chacha warmjam purapat jan yanaptʼasipkirista ukhajja , esposojampejj jan kuna amtarus purirjama , pachpa utan jakiri pä jaqjamakëjjapjjeristwa ” ( Alexandra ) .
AKHAM JISKTʼASIM
“ ¿ Qollqe ganatajajj nayankkakispas ukhamti amuytjja ? ” .
“ ¿ Chachajas jan ukajj warmijas jan utankki ukhakit kusisitätjja ? ” .
“ Chachajasa jan ukajj warmijas familiapamp sum apasi , ¿ nayajj ukhamarakit familiapamp sum apastjja ? ” .
CHACHA WARMI PARLTʼASIÑATAKI
¿ Kunanakansa purapat sum yanaptʼastanjja ?
¿ Kunanakansa jukʼamp sum yanaptʼasiñatak chʼamachassna ?
Purapat yanaptʼasiñatakejja , ¿ kunanak lurañasäspasa ?
AKANAKWA LURASMA
Casarat chacha warmjam jakasiñajj pelot anatañamp sasiwa .
Pachpa equipon anatañatakejj ¿ kunsa lurasma ?
Kunjamsa juma sapak atipasma uk lupʼiskañat sipansa , kunjamsa panpachan atipapjjasma ukwa lupʼiñama .
“ Khitis pantjasiwayi ukjjat lupʼiskañat sipansa , mayachtʼata suman jakasiñaw jukʼamp wakiskirejja ” ( Ethan ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Jan jumanak pachpatak llakisipjjamti , jan ukasti mayninakatsa llakisipjjarakim ” ( Filipenses 2 : 3 , 4 ) .
Respetomp parlasiñajj cemento mezclamp sasiwa , ukaw mayachtʼatäñatak yanaptʼistu .
CHACHA WARMINAKATAKI
Respetomp uñjasiri chacha warminakajj janis mä pachpak amuyapkchejja , munasiñampiw uñjasipjje .
Diez claves para transformar tu matrimonio librojj akham siwa : “ Respetomp uñjasiri chacha warminakajj janiw maynikis razonanïkaspa ukham amuyapkiti .
Antisas kuna jan walinakas utji ukanakat respetompiw parltʼasipjje .
Kunsa maynejj amuyi uksa respetompiw istʼapjje , kunas panipar yanaptʼaspa ukarjamaw mä amtar puripjjaraki ” sasa .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Munasir jaqejj [ . . . ] janiw kunatï jupatak walïki ukak thaqkiti ” ( 1 Corintios 13 : 4 , 5 ) .
“ Nayatakejja , esposajar respetañajj wali valoranit uñjaña , jan chuyma ustʼayaña , kunatï matrimoniojar jan waltʼaykaspa ukanak jan lurañawa ” ( Micah ) .
Chacha warminakajj jan respetasipki ukhajja , jiskʼachiri , chuym ustʼayiri arunakampiw parlapjjaspa .
Yatjjatat jaqenakajja , ukham parlasir chacha warminakajj divorciasiñaruw puripjjaspa sasaw sapjje .
“ Chachatï warmipar chuyma ustʼayir arunakamp parlani , jiskʼacharakini ukhajja , warmejj janis kunatak walïkaspa ukhamwa amuyasini , chachaparus janiw confiyjjaniti ” ( Brian ) .
AKHAM JISKTʼASIM
Pasïr semanajj kunjamsa apasipjjta jan ukajj kunjamsa parltʼasipjjta uk amtasajj akham jisktʼasim :
“ ¿ Qhawqha kutis arunakajamp jiskʼachtjja , qhawqha kutirakis suma luratanakapat ‘ walik ukham lurtajj ’ sasin sistjja ? ” .
“ ¿ Kunanak lurasas respetataj uñachtʼaytjja ? ” .
CHACHA WARMI PARLTʼASIÑATAKI
¿ Kuna arunakasa , kuna luratanakas respetomp uñjasiñatak yanaptʼistu ?
¿ Kuna arunakasa , kuna luratanakas janis respetomp uñjatäksna ukham amuyayistu ?
AKANAKWA LURASMA
Kunjamsa respetomp uñjatäñ munapjjta ukwa kimsa toqet qellqtʼasipjjañama .
Ukanak churasisajja , ukarjam lurañatakiw chʼamachasipjjañama .
Chachamana jan ukajj warmiman kunjam chuymanïtapas jumatak wali valorani uk qellqtʼasajja , jupar yatiyam .
“ Nayatakejja , luratanakajampi esposojar wali valoranit uñjaña , jupajj kusisit jakasispa uk munañaw respetomp uñjañajja .
Janiw jachʼa luräwinak lurasapunejj respeto uñachtʼayksnati , nayajj mä qhawqha arunakampi jan ukajj jiskʼa luräwinak lurasaw esposojar respetataj uñachtʼaytjja ” ( Megan ) .
“ Nayajj respetompiw uñjta ” sañat sipansa , jupajj respetat amuyasispa ukaw jukʼamp wakiskirejja .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Chuymatpach sinttʼasiñampi , suma chuymanïñampi , humilde chuymanïñampi , llampʼu chuymanïñampi , paciencia chuymanïñampi isthapisipjjam ” ( Colosenses 3 : 12 ) .
Perdonañajj ninar uñtata jan waltʼäwinakwa jiwayaspa .
CHACHA WARMINAKATAKI
Perdonañajj chuym ustʼayapkistu uk armaña sañwa muni .
Ukampis janiw jan wal lurapkistu ukajj janis kunäkaspa ukham uñjaña sañ munkiti .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Jumanak taypin kuna quejasiñas utjchi ukhasa , maynit maynikam aguantasisipkakim , jumanakkamajj taqe chuyma perdonasipjjarakim ” ( Colosenses 3 : 13 ) .
“ Maynir munasktan ukhajja , janiw jan wali luratanakapak uñchʼuktanti , antisas kunjamsa suma jaqëñatak chʼamachasiski ukwa uñjtanjja ” ( Aaron ) .
Chuyma ustʼat sarnaqañajj usuntañaru , jan ukajj llakimp aynachtʼañaruw apistaspa .
Janirakiw chacha warmjamas sum jakasjjsnati .
“ Mä kutejja , esposojajj wal chuym ustʼayitäna , ukatwa ‘ perdontʼita ’ sasin sitäna .
Jupar perdonañajj chʼamakïchïnsa , perdonayätwa .
¡ Qalltatpach perdoniriskayäta !
Janiw chacha warmjam jan waltʼayasiñajj utjkaspänti ” ( Julia ) .
AKHAM JISKTʼASIM
Chuym ustʼayätam ukhajja , akham jisktʼasiñamawa :
“ ¿ Jankʼakit chuym ustʼayastjja ? ” .
“ ¿ Perdón mayisiñap suyapuntti , jan ukajj pantjasitap armañatakich chʼamachastjja ? ” .
CHACHA WARMI PARLTʼASIÑATAKI
¿ Jankʼakit perdonastanjja ?
¿ Jankʼak perdonasiñatakejj kunanaksa lursna ?
AKANAKWA LURASMA
Chachamana jan ukajj warmiman chuym ustʼayatajj jan akham amuyamti : “ Yatkasaw ukham luritu ” sasa .
“ Taqeniw walja kuti pantjastanjja ” .
Ukhamajj chachamaru jan ukajj warmimar perdonañatak chʼamachasipunim .
“ Panpachan pantjastan ukhajja , perdonañajj janiw chʼamäkiti .
Ukampis ‘ jupaw juchanejja ’ sasin amuyasktan ukhajja , perdonañajj chʼamakiwa .
Cheqas maynir perdonañatakejj wali humilde chuymanïñaw wakisi ” ( Kimberly ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Juma contra quejaski ukampejj jankʼaki askicham ” ( Mateo 5 : 25 ) .
Chuyma ustʼat sarnaqañajj usuntañaru , jan ukajj llakimp aynachtʼañaruw apistaspa .
Janirakiw chacha warmjamas sum jakasjjsnati
Sum parltʼasiñajj mä puentempi sasiwa , ukaw wawanakasar jakʼachasiñatak yanaptʼistu .
AWK TAYKANAKATAKI
Sum parltʼasiñatakejja , awk taykanakasa wawanakasa , kunjamäsipkisa kunsa amuyapjje ukanakatwa parltʼasipjjañapa .
Qʼajjo wayn tawaqonakamp parltʼañajj chʼamakiwa .
Jiskʼäsipki ukhajja , taqe kunwa awk taykapar yatiyapjje .
Ukampis wayn tawaqöjjapjje ukhajja , janiw jupanakamp sint parljjapjjeti , kunjamäsipkisa kunsa amuyapjje ukas janiw yatisjjeti .
Wawanakajj awk taykapat uma jawir khurkatankapkaspas ukhamawa .
Wawanakajj janis jiwasamp parlañ munapkaspa ukham amuysna , ukampis ukhaw jupanakajj parlañ wal munasipkaspa .
Chʼamachasiñamawa .
Chika arumkam parltʼañas wakiskchinejja , chʼamachasiñamawa .
“ Awisajj akham sañjamawa : ‘ ¡ Uru jurnalarakis juntüsktanjja !
¿ Jichhakit parlañ munta ? ’ sasa .
¡ Ukampis wawan parltʼasiñ munatapat kunjamarak colersnasti !
Cheqas taqeniw wawanakasamp parltʼasiñ muntanjja ” ( Lisa ) .
“ Urut ikintjjañaw gustitu , ukampis awisajj chika arum pasataw wawanakajamp sum parltʼasipjjerïta ” ( Herbert ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Sapa maynis kunatejj jaqe masipatak walïki uk thaqaskakpan , jan jupatakik thaqpanti ” ( 1 Corintios 10 : 24 ) .
Sum istʼañamawa .
Mä chachajj akham siwa : “ Awisajj wawanakajajj parlasipkitu ukhajja , nayajj yaqhanak lupʼiskta .
Jupanakajj uk amuyapjjewa ” sasa .
¿ Ukham pasaraktamti ? Ukhamajj televisionsa , celularsa , yaqha ukham aparatonaksa jiwtʼayañamawa .
Wawaman llakipajj janis jumatak jachʼäkchejja , jupar sum istʼañamawa , ukhamatwa wawamajj kunatï llakisiyki ukajj jumatak wali wakiskirïtap amuyani .
“ Wawanakasajj kunjamäsipkisa ukjjat llakisitas yatipjjañapawa .
Jan ukajj janiw jiwasamp parlañ munjjapjjaspati , yaqhanakan yanaptʼapwa thaqapjjarakispa ” ( Maranda ) .
“ Wawanakamajj jan amuytʼasisas parlapkchinejja , janiw ratuk colerasiñamäkiti ” ( Anthony ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Kunjamsa istʼasipkta uk amuyasipjjam ” ( Lucas 8 : 18 ) .
Wawanakamamp parltʼasiñamapuniwa .
Wawanakajja , yaqhanak lurkasaw awk taykapamp jukʼamp sum parltʼasipjje .
“ Nanakajja , viajkasaw wawanakajamp parltʼasipjjta .
Uñkatasis parlañat sipansa , ladopar qontʼat sarkasaw jupanakamp jukʼamp sum parltʼasipjjta ” ( Nicole ) .
Manqʼaskasaw wawanakamp sum parltʼassna .
“ Arumanakajj manqʼaskasaw kuna jan walinakasa , kuna sumanakas uka urun pasapjjetu ukanakat parltʼasipjjta .
Ukham parltʼasiñaw familiajar mayachtʼi .
Jan waltʼäwinakar saykatañatakis jan sapak amuyasiñatakiw yanaptʼapjjetu ” ( Robin ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Sapa maynis istʼañatakejj jankʼakïñapawa , janiw jan amuytʼasisajj parlañapäkiti ” ( Santiago 1 : 19 ) .
Cheqañchañajj barcon timonapamp sasiwa , ukaw jan saranukupjjañapatakejj wawanakar yanaptʼi .
AWK TAYKANAKATAKI
Cheqañchañajja , wawanakasar yanaptʼaña , yatichaña , jan wali luratanakapat amuytʼayaña sañwa muni .
Suma amtanakar puripjjañapataki kunatï walïki jan walïkaraki ukanak yatichaña sañwa munaraki .
Aka qhepa maranakanjja , yaqhep awk taykanakajj janiw wawanakapar cheqañchjjapjjeti , “ wawajajj janis kunatak walïkaspa ukhamwa amuyasispa ” sasaw sapjje .
Ukampis wawanakapar sum uywiri awk taykanakajja , kun lurapjjañapas wakisi , kunatsa ukarjam sarnaqapjjañapa ukanakwa wawanakapar yatichapjje .
“ Wawanakasajj sum amuytʼasir jaqëpjjañapatakejja , kunatï walïki jan walïkaraki uk jiskʼatpachwa sum amuyapjjañapa .
Jan ukajj kunjamtï jan timonani mä barcojj saranukusin chhaqkejja , ukhamarakiw jupanakajj jan wali thakir saranukupjjani ” ( Pamela ) .
Lurataparjamaw wawanakamar uñjañama .
Jan istʼasitapat kuna jan walinsa uñjasini uk qhanwa wawamarojj sañama .
Maysa toqetjja , jupajj istʼkätam ukhajj “ walik ukham lurtajja ” sañamarakiwa .
“ Niyakejjay jichhürunakan wawanakajj jan istʼasirïpjjchejja , wawanakajajj istʼapkitu ukhajj felicittʼapuntwa .
Ukaw jupanakarojj cheqañchatäpki ukhajj jan sint chuym ustʼayasiñatak yanaptʼi ” ( Christine ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Kuntï maynejj phawki , ukrakwa apthapini ” ( Gálatas 6 : 7 ) .
Amuyumpiw cheqañchañama .
Wawar cheqañchasajja , qhawqha maranisa , qhawqsa yateqaspa , luratapajj jan walipuniti janicha ukanakwa amuyañama .
Kunansa pantjasi ukarjamaw cheqañchañama , sañäni , wawamatï jan istʼasis celularap jan sum apnaqchi ukhajja , mä qhawqha tiempo aparañwa amtasma .
Maysa toqetjja , janiw wawaman pantjasitapajj sinti jan walïkaspas ukham amuyañamäkiti .
“ Wawajajj yatkasinti jan istʼitu jan ukajj jan amuyasisach pantjasi uk amuyañatakiw chʼamachasta .
Yatkasin jan wali luratapat cheqañchañampi , pantjasitap amuytʼayañampejj janiw pachpäkiti ” ( Wendell ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Awkinaka , jan wawanakamarojj colerasiyapjjamti , ukhamat jupanakajj jan llakisipjjañapataki ” ( Colosenses 3 : 21 ) .
Munasiñampiw cheqañchañama .
Awk taykanakajj wawanakapar munasiñamp cheqañchapki ukhajja , wawanakajj uk amuyapjjewa , ukarakiw cheqañchatäpki ukhajj jan sint chuym usuyasipjjañapatak yanaptʼi , pantjasitanakapatsa yateqapjjarakiwa .
“ Yoqall wawajajj pantjasirïkäna ukhajja , suma amtanakar puriwayki ukajj qhawqsa kusisiyapjjetu uk jupar sapjjapunirïtwa .
Ukatjja , ‘ jan wali luratam askichäta ukhajja , janiw wiñayatak jan wali jaqet uñjapkätamti , nanakas yanaptʼapjjämawa ’ sasaw sapjjerïta ” ( Daniel ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Munasir jaqejj paciencianiwa , khuyapayasiriwa ” ( 1 Corintios 13 : 4 ) .
Suma jaqëñatak yatichañajj mä brujulampi sasiwa , ukaw wawanakarojj suma amtanakar puriñatak yanaptʼani .
AWK TAYKANAKATAKI
Awk taykanakajja , kunatï walïki ukarjam sarnaqañatakiw chʼamachastanjja .
Jumatï honradöñatak chʼamachasiskstajja , ukham jaqëpjjañapatakiw wawanakamar yaticharakïta .
Trabajir jaqëñasa , mayninakar jan yaqhachañasa , sinttʼasirïñas kunja wakiskirisa ukwa wawanakasar yatichañ munaraktanjja .
Wayn tawaqökasaw ukanak sum yateqapjjaspa .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Wawarojja suma sarnaqañapatakejja jiskʼatpach sum yaticham , ukatsti awkëjjan ukkhajja janiw uka yatichäwinakatjja armaskaniti ” ( Proverbios 22 : 6 ) .
Tecnologiampi phoqantat akapachanjja , kunatï walïki jan walïkaraki uk yatiñajj wali wakiskiriwa .
“ Wawanakasajj celularansa tabletansa jan walinak kuna horasas uñapjjakispawa , ladosankkasas jan walinakwa uñasipkaspa ” ( Karyn ) .

BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : ‘ Jilïr jaqenakajj sapa kuti amuytʼjjasajja , kunatï walïki jan walïki ukanak amuytʼañjja yateqjjapjjewa ’ ( Hebreos 5 : 14 ) .
Mayninakat llakisiñajj wali wakiskiriwa .
“ Mirä amp suma ” , “ yuspära ” sañasa , mayninakat llakisiñasa wali wakiskiriwa , ukampis ukanakajj chhaqtaskiwa . Jaqe masipat llakisiñat sipansa , celularapata jan ukajj yaqha ukhamanakatwa jukʼamp llakisipjje .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Kunjamtï jaqenakampi uñjatäñ munapktajja , ukhamaraki jumanakajj jupanakar uñjapjjam ” ( Lucas 6 : 31 ) .
Kunanakatï jumatak jan walïki uk wawanakamar qhan yatichañamawa .
Yatjjatasiwayki ukarjamajja , awk taykanakajj wawanakar jan casaratäkasin maynimp ikintasiñajj jan walïtap yatichapki ukhajja , wayn tawaqöjjasajj janiw facilak ukar purtʼasipkiti .
AKHAMWA LURASMA : Noticianakat parlasaw wawanakamar sum yatichasma .
Sañäni , mä noticiatï jaqe jiwayapjjatapat parlani ukhajja , “ ¡ jan walirakisä !
¿ Kunatsa yaqhep jaqenakajj ukham lurapjjpacha ? ”
sasaw jisktʼasma . “ Wawanakasajj suma amtanakar puripjjañapatakejja , kunatï walïki jan walïkaraki ukanakwa nayraqat sum amuytʼapjjañapa ” ( Brandon ) .
Mayninakat llakisiñ yaticham .
Jiskʼa wawanakasa , “ mirä amp suma ” , “ yuspära ” sañsa , mayninakat llakisiñsa yateqapjjarakispawa .
Mä librojj akham siwa : “ Wawanakajj janiw jupanakakis jaqëpkaspa ukham amuyasipjjañapäkiti , jan ukasti familiapata , escuelankir masinakapata , yaqha jaqenakat llakisipjjañapajj kunja wakiskirisa ukwa amuyapjjañapa , ukhamatwa yaqhanakar yanaptʼañ munapjjarakini ” ( Parenting Without Borders ) .
AKHAMWA LURASMA : Yaqhanakar yanaptʼañajj kunja wakiskirisa uk yateqapjjañapatakejja , lurañanakwa wawanakamar churasma .
“ Wawanakajj kuna lurañanakatï utan wakiski ukanak lurañ yateqapjjani ukhajja , sapak jakasjjapjjani ukhajj janiw sint chʼam tukupkaniti , lurañanakapampi phoqañ yatitäjjapjjaniwa ” ( Tara ) .
¿ Wawanakamajj jumat yateqasis sarnaqapjjañap munasmati ?
AWK TAYKANAKATAKI
Luratanakasamp yatichañajja , yatichktan ukarjam sarnaqaña sañwa muni .
Akham amuytʼañäni , punk leqtʼanipan awkejj “ janiw akankkiti ” sañapatak wawapar mayispa ukhajja , janiw wawapan cheq parlañap maykaspati .
“ Awk taykanakatï sisktan ukarjam jan phoqkañäni ukhajja , janiw wawanakasarojj ukham lurapjjañap mayksnati .
Wawanakajj mä esponjar uñtatäpjjewa , jupanakajj ratukiw kuntï sisktan lurktan ukanak yateqapjje .
Jiwasatï yatichatasarjam jan lurkañäni ukhajja , wawanakajj uk amuyasin ratukiw sapjjestani ” ( David ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ ‘ Janiw lunthatasïtati ’ sasaw yatiytajja , ukhamajj ¿ kunataraki lunthatasisktasti ? ”
( Romanos 2 : 21 ) .
Colegionkir masinakapat sipansa , awk taykanakaw wawanakar yanaptʼapjjaspa , qʼajjo wayn tawaqöjjapjje ukhas yanaptʼasipkakispawa .
Ukhamajj awk taykanaka , jumanakaw sum sarnaqapjjañapatak wawanakamar yanaptʼapjjasma , ukatakejj yatichapkta ukarjam sarnaqañatakiw chʼamachasipjjañama .
“ Walja kutiw wawanakasar kuns sasksna , jupanakajj janis istʼapkistaspa ukhamäkchisa , kuntï sisktan ukarjam jan lurkañäni ukhajj ratukiw sapjjestani .
Janis ukhamaw sañjamäkchejja , jupanakajj kuntï lurktan uk sum uñjasipki ” ( Nicole ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : ‘ Alajjpachat jutki uka yatiña katoqer jaqejja , janiw kʼari chuymani jaqëkiti ’ ( Santiago 3 : 17 ) .
Akham jisktʼasim : “ ¿ Kunjamsa esposajarusa wawanakajarus uñjtjja ?
¿ Kunanaksa televisionan uñchʼuktjja ?
¿ Amigonakajajj kunjam jaqenakäpjjesa ?
¿ Mayninakat llakistti ? ”
sasa . Mä arunjja , ¿ wawanakamajj jumjam jaqer tukupjjañap munasmati ?
“ Janiw esposojasa nayas kuntï nanakajj jan lurapkta uk lurapjjañap wawanakajar mayipkti ” ( Christine ) .
Perdón mayisiñamawa .
Wawanakajj awk taykapan pantjasirïpjjatap yatipjjewa .
Ukhamajj jumatï pantjasisajj esposamatsa wawanakamatsa perdón mayisïta ukhajja , cheq parlaña humilde chuymanïñwa wawanakamar yatichäta .
“ Pantjasisajj qhan arsusiñasawa , perdón mayisiñasarakiwa . Janitï ukham lurkañänejja , wawanakasajj janiw perdón mayisiñ yateqapkaniti ” ( Robin ) .
“ Awk taykanakajj wawanakasar wal yanaptʼsna .
Ukatwa jupanakan yateqasipjjañapatak sum sarnaqañasa .
Luratanakasajj janatatat mä libromp sasiwa , uruy arumaw wawanakasajj uka librot yateqasipki ” ( Wendell ) .
Kunjam jaqëtas uk yatiñajja , jachʼa thayanakar uñtata jan walinak aguantañatakiw yanaptʼätam .
WAYN TAWAQONAKATAKI
Kuna sutinïtasa , kunjam uñnaqanïtasa , ukanakajj janiw kunjam jaqëtas uk uñachtʼaykiti , jan ukasti kunanakarus creyta , kunjam chuymanïtasa ukanakaw kunjam jaqëtas uk qhan uñachtʼayi .
Kunapachatï kunjam jaqëtas uk sum yatisjjta ukhajja , kunatï walïki ukpun lurtajja , janirakiw wayna masinakamampis apnaqayasktati .
“ Waljaniw isi aljañ tiendanakan utjki uka jachʼa muñeconakar uñtasitäpjje , kuna laykutejj kuna issa uchasipjjani uk janiw jupanak pachpajj amtirjamäpkiti ” ( Adrian ) .
“ Chʼamäkipansa kunatï walïki ukjjat saytʼasiñwa yateqawayta .
Amigonakajajj kunjam jaqëpjjesa uk luratanakap uñjasaw yatta , nayas jupanakampïsaw kunjam jaqëtsa uk yatisirakta ” ( Courtney ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Jan jukʼampejj akapachankir jaqenakat yateqasis sarnaqapjjamti , jan ukasti machaqar tukupjjañamatakejj amuyunakam machaqar tukuyapjjam ” ( Romanos 12 : 2 ) .
Jichhajj kunjam jaqëtasa , kunjam jaqer tukuñsa munta uk yatiñatakejja , kunanaksa sum lurta , kunanakansa pantjasiskta , kunanakarus creyta ukanak amuytʼañamawa .
Ukatakejj akham jisktʼasiñaw yanaptʼätam :
Suma luratanakama : “ ¿ Kunanak lurañsa sum yattjja ?
¿ Kunanakansa nayranktjja ?
¿ Munañanakajar atipjtti ?
¿ Horasapar phoqeri , trabajtʼiri , wajjtʼasiri ukham jaqëtti ?
¿ Kunanaksa sum lurtjja ? ” .
AKHAMWA LURASMA : ¿ Kunjam jaqëtas uk amuyañajj jumatak chʼamakiti ?
Ukhamächejja , awk taykamaru jan ukajj mä amigomaruw uk yatiñatak yanaptʼa mayisma .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Sapa mayniw pachpa luratanakapat amuykiptʼasiñapa , ukhamatwa luratanakaparjam kusisini .
Jupajj janiw luratanakapjja yaqhan luratanakapampejj igualayañapäkiti ” ( Gálatas 6 : 4 ) .
Pantjasitanakama : “ ¿ Kunanakansa chʼamachasiñaja ?
¿ Kunapachas jan walïki uk lurañatak jukʼamp yantʼat uñjastjja ?
¿ Kunjamanakan uñjasisas munañanakajar atipjañajajj jukʼamp wakisi ? ” .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Jiwasatejj ‘ janiw juchanïktanti ’ sisstan ukhajja , jiwas pachpaw engañjasisktanjja ” ( 1 Juan 1 : 8 ) .
Creyitanakama : “ ¿ Kuna yatichäwinakarjamas sarnaqtjja , kunatsa ukham sarnaqtjja ?
¿ Diosar creyti ?
¿ Diosajj utjatap kunjamsa uñachtʼayiristjja ?
¿ Kunanakas nayatakejj jan walïki , kunatsa ukham sistjja ?
¿ Kunsa jutïr urunakat amuytjja ? ” .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Jumarusti suma ewjja arunakampi , chʼikhi chuymampiwa imätam ” ( Proverbios 2 : 11 ) .
Awk taykamar istʼañajja , bancor phoqerïñamp sasiwa .
Lurañanakam phoqapunïta ukhajja , awk taykamajj jukʼamp confiyapjjätam .
WAYN TAWAQONAKATAKI
Confiykañ jaqejja , mayitanak phoqeri , arsutanakap phoqeri , jan kʼarisiri ukhamawa .
Ukatwa awk taykapasa , amigonakapasa , jefepasa jupar confiyapjje .
Jumatï lurañanakamamp phoqeri , istʼasiri ukham jaqëyätajja , awk taykamajj janiw taqe kunat jarkʼapkätamti .
“ Awk taykamajj jumar confiyapjjañapatakejja , amuytʼasir jaqëñataki , lurañanakam sum phoqañatak chʼamachasiñamapuniwa , janiw jupanakan uñjkatakejj ukham lurañamäkiti ” ( Sarahi ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Kunjam jaqëpjjtasa uksa uñakiptʼasisipkakim ” ( 2 Corintios 13 : 5 ) .
Awk taykamajj jumar mayamp confiyapjjañapatakisa jan ukajj jukʼamp confiyapjjañapatakisa , aka ewjjtʼanakaw yanaptʼätam :
Cheq parlañamawa .
Jumatï kʼarisïtajja , jaqenakajj janiw confiyjjapjjätamti .
Maysa toqetjja , pantjaskasas cheqpun parläta , honradorakïyäta ukhajja , jukʼampiw jumar confiyapjjätam .
“ Taqe kunas walikïski ukhajja , cheq parlañajj facilakiwa . Ukampis jiwasatak jan walïkipansa cheqpun parltan ukhaw mayninakajj jiwasar jukʼamp confiyapjjestu ” ( Caiman ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Taqe kunansa honrado chuymampiw sarnaqañ munapjjarakta ” ( Hebreos 13 : 18 ) .
Lurañanakam phoqañamawa .
Estados Unidos markanjja , recursos humanos ukan trabajiri jaqenakaruw jisktʼasïna , jupanakat jilapartew ( 78 % ) akham sapjje : “ Mä trabajo churañatakejj lurañanakap sum phoqerïñapajj wali wakiskiriwa ” sasa .
Jichhatpach lurañanakam phoqerïñ yateqäta ukhajja , jilïr jaqëjjäta ukhajj wal yanaptʼätam .
“ May satak kuns lurta ukhajja , awk taykajajj amuyapjjewa .
Ukham sapa kuti lurataj uñjasajj jukʼampiw confiyapjjetu ” ( Sarah ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Nayajj wal jumar confiysma [ . . . ] . Nayajj yattwa , kunanaktï sisksma ukanakat sipansa jukʼampwa jumajj luräta ” ( Filemón 21 ) .
Paciencianïñamawa .
Maynejj jiltaskiti janicha uk facilakwa amuysna , ukampis amuytʼasir jaqëjjeti janicha uk amuyañatakejj tiempow munasi .
“ Awk taykamasa yaqhanakasa , janiw mä suma luratam uñjasakejj jumar confiyapkätamti , jan ukasti lurañanakam sum phoqañatak chʼamachasipunïta ukhaw jukʼamp confiyapjjätam ” ( Brandon ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Paciencia chuymanïñampi isthapisipjjam ” ( Colosenses 3 : 12 ) .
Suma trabajtʼirïñajj jan jaytasa ejercicio lurañamp sasiwa , ukaw jichhasa jutïrinsa sum jakasiñatak yanaptʼätam .
WAYN TAWAQONAKATAKI
Suma trabajtʼir jaqenakajj janiw kunan trabajiñs ajjsarapkiti , antisas wal trabajiñ munapjje .
Mayninakan yanaptʼatäñ suyañat sipansa , jupanakaw yaqhanakar yanaptʼapjje , trabajopajj janis suma trabajökchejja , trabajasipkakiwa .
Janis trabajañ gustkchistojja , taqeniw walja lurañanakanïtanjja .
Yamas jichha tiemponjja , suma trabajtʼir jaqenakajj wali thaqatäpjjewa , kuna laykutejj jilaparte jaqenakajj janiw chʼama trabajonak lurañ munjjapjjeti ( Eclesiastés 3 : 13 ) .
“ Wal trabajta ukhajja , wali kusisita chuymas chuymätwa .
Ukatwa sapürutjam jukʼamp trabajiñ muntjja .
Sum trabajiñatak chʼamachastan ukhajja , jaqenakajj suma trabajtʼir jaqetwa uñtʼapjjestu ” ( Reyon ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Taqe trabajitatwa jilpacha katoqañajj utji ” ( Proverbios 14 : 23 , Aymar Biblia ) .
Jukʼamp suma trabajtʼirïñatakejj aka ewjjtʼanakaw yanaptʼiristam :
Sum lurañatak chʼamachasim .
Utan lurañanak lurkasasa , tareanak lurkasasa , trabajonsa , taqe kunsa sum phoqañatak chʼamachasim .
Kunsa sum lurañ yatsta ukhasa , kunjamsa uk jukʼamp suma , jankʼak lurasma uk amuytʼasim .
Ukham lurasaw jukʼamp kusisit jakasïta .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Khititejj mä kunsa suma lurkani ukajja , reyinakaruwa servini , janiwa aynachtʼata jaqenakar sirvkaniti ” ( Proverbios 22 : 29 ) .
Mayninakat llakisim .
Lurañanakam phoqasajj mayninakaruw yanaptʼaraktajja .
Akham amuytʼañäni , utantï lurañanakamp yanaptʼäta ukhajja , familiamajj janiw sint qaripkaniti .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Katoqañat sipansa churañanwa jukʼamp kusisiñajj utji ” ( Hechos 20 : 35 ) .
Jukʼamp trabajiñatak chʼamachasim .
Janiw kuntï mayipkätam ukak lurañamäkiti , jan ukasti jukʼamp lurañatakiw chʼamachasiñama .
Ukhamatwa juma pachpajj kuntï jakäwiman lurañ amtkäta uk lurarakïta .
Inas jukʼamp trabajchïta , ukampis janiw khitin obligatas ukham trabajkätati , jan ukasti juman amtatamatwa ukham trabajïta .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : ‘ Kuna suma lurañanaktejj jumajj lurkäta ukjja , janiw obligat lurañamäkiti , jan ukasti chuymamat lurañamawa ’ ( Filemón 14 ) .
Janiw trabajoruk chuym uchañamäkiti .
Suma trabajtʼirïñajj janiw trabajoruk chuym uchaña sañ munkiti .
Trabajtʼasajja , samartʼañatakejj tiemp apstʼasiñasarakiwa .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Mä jukʼa samartʼañajja askiwa , pä chʼama qaritat sipansa , thayaru katthapiñ munasa ” ( Eclesiastés 4 : 6 ) .
Kunanaksa luräta uk amtañajja , uta lurañatak mä planompi sasiwa .
Chʼamachasïta ukhajj amtanakam phoqätawa .
WAYN TAWAQONAKATAKI
Kun lurañ amtasajj janiw aleqak munañasäkiti , jan ukasti uk phoqañatakejj sum amuytʼasiña , paciencianïña , wal chʼamachasiñaw wakisi .
Kuntï lurañ amtkañäni ukanakjja , mä qhawqha urunakata jan ukajj phajjsinakatwa phoqsna , yaqhep amtanakjja mä qhawqha maranakatwa phoqaraksna .
Ukampis jaya tiempotak uchasktan uka amtanakjja , jukʼat jukʼatwa phoqañasa .
Kun lurañtï amtkta uk phoqasajja , jukʼampwa juma pachpar confiyasïta , amigonakamampis jukʼamp sum apasïta , kusisitaw jakasirakïta .
Jukʼampwa juma pachpar confiyasïta .
Jan sinti chʼamäki ukanak lurañ phoqäta ukhajja , jukʼamp lurañanak phoqañjja janiw ajjsarkätati .
Jan walinakan uñjasiñsa janirakiw ajjsarkätati . Jan walinak lurayañ munapkätam ukhas janiw istʼkätati .
Amigonakamamp jukʼamp sum apasïta .
Amtanakap phoqañatak chʼamachasiri jaqenakampi chikachasiñajj taqeniruw gustistu .
Yamas amtanakas phoqañatak maynit maynikam yanaptʼasktan ukhajja , amigonakasampejj jukʼamp sum apastanjja .
Kusisitaw jakasïta .
Kuna amtanaktï uchaskta uk phoqasajja , kusisitaw jakasïta .
“ Kunanaksa lurä uk amtañajja , tiempo jan aptʼasiñataki , chʼamachasiñatakiw yanaptʼitu .
Amtanakaj phoqañajj wal kusisiyitu .
Akham saraktwa : ‘ Walikpun ukham lurtjja ’ sasa ” ( Christopher ) .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Thayar uñchʼukirejja , janiw yapuchkaniti , ukhamarak qenayar uñchʼukirisa , janiw achunak apthapkaniti ” ( Eclesiastés 11 : 4 ) .
Kunsa luräta uk amtañatakisa , ukanak phoqañatakisa , aka ewjjtʼanakarjam lurañamawa :
Kunanaksa luräta uk amtañamawa .
Kunanaksa lurañ munasma ukanak qellqtʼasiñamawa , ukatsti kawkïrinak phoqañatakis nayraqat chʼamachasïta uk qellqtʼasiñamarakiwa .
Kunjamsa amtanakam phoqäta uk amuytʼañamawa .
Akanakwa lurasma :
Qhawqha tiemponsa phoqäta uk amuytʼasim .
Phoqañatakejj kunanaksa luräta uk qellqtʼasim .
Kuna jan walinakas utjaspa , kunjamsa ukanakar atipjasma ukanak amuytʼasim .
Amtanakam phoqañatak chʼamachasim .
Qalltanjja , janiw taqe kunas sum phoqasiñapapunejj wakiskiti .
Jan ukasti , kunsa nayraqat lurañama ukwa amuytʼasiñama , ukarjamaw lurañamaraki .
Kunjamsa amtanakam phoqaskta ukwa mä qhawqha tiempot amuytʼasiñama .
BIBLIAJJ KAMSISA : “ Suma amuytʼampi kuna amtäwinaka wakichatasa sumakiwa phoqhasi ” ( Proverbios 21 : 5 ) .
BIBLIAJJ WALI SUMA EWJJTʼANAKANIWA , ukajj casarat chacha warminakaru , awk taykanakaru , wayn tawaqonakaruw yanaptʼaspa .
Biblian ewjjtʼanakapajj sum amuytʼasiñataki , suma amtanakar puriñatakiw yanaptʼistu ( Proverbios 1 : 1 - 4 ) .
BIBLIAJJ AKA JISKTʼANAKARUW QHANAÑCHARAKI :
¿ Kuna amtamp luratätansa ?
¿ Diosat tʼaqesiñanakat juchanïpacha ?
¿ Maynejj jiwjje ukhajj kunas paspacha ?
Bibliajj kunjamsa uka jisktʼanakarusa , yaqha jisktʼanakarus qhanañchi uk juma pachpa yatjjatañamatakiw chʼamañchtʼapjjsma .
¿ Kunatsa Bibliat yatjjatañama ?
sat video uñtasma .
Ukatakejja , Internetan jw.org cheqaruw mantasma .
Kunjamsa chacha warmjamasa familiansa sum jakassna uka toqet jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , Internetan jw.org cheqar mantasajja , ENSEÑANZAS BÍBLICAS > EL MATRIMONIO Y LA FAMILIA siski ukaruw mantarakïta .
Internetan jw.org cheqaruw mantasma .
¿ Taqinix mayachtʼat jakassnati ?
¿ AKAPACHAX kunarus purtʼasini ? ¿ Sumankañaruti jan ukax jan walirucha ?
¿ Kamsasmasa ?
Uka tuqitxa , waljanix janiw kun sañs yatipkiti .
Ukat politiconakaxa , markanakax jan sumankthapipkaspa ukhax kunarus purtʼasipxaspa uka amuyañat sipansa , aka Uraqpachan taqiniw sumankxañäni sasaw sapxi .
Ukampis yaqhipanakaxa , yaqha markanakaw axsarkañ wali jachʼa armamentonakapamp nuwasiñ qalltapxaspa sasaw axsarayasipxaraki .
Ukhamäspa ukhaxa , ¿ kunakïkaspa jiwasanakatakixa ?
Nayrapachanakatpachwa uñisisiñampi jiskʼachasiñampixa , sumankthapiñampi ukat mayachtʼat sarnaqañampirux chhaqtayawayi .
Ukat religionanakaxa , chʼaxwankir markanakar sumankthapiyañat sipansa , jukʼamp pitthapiwayi .
Ukatwa , James Haught sat periodistax akham säna : “ Kunanakatï jaqinakar jaljtayki ukaxa uñisiñ uñstayi , ukat religionawa jaqinakar jukʼamp mä jaljtayirixa ” sasa .
Ukat saskakïnwa : “ Religionaw ‘ suma jaqinakaptayi ’ sasas taqinis amuyapkchixa , ukampis religionaw yaqhip jaqinakarux jukʼamp sinti jan walinak lurayi ” sasin säna .
Steven Weinberg sat física tuqit wali yatxattʼat jaqixa niya ukham arsurakikïna : “ Suma jaqinakar jan walinak lurayañatakixa , religionaw munasi ” sasa .
Ukampis mä tiemponxa sumankañaw utjani , mayachtʼataw jakasxañäni , ¿ sasax sissnati ?
Jïsa .
Ukampis kunjamtï jutir yatichäwin yatxatkañänixa , janiw jaqin amtaparjam ukax phuqaskaniti , janirakiw jaqin uñstayat religionasa ukanak apankaniti .
[ 3 janan qhanañchäwipa ]
Akapachaxa , ¿ janit aka granada sat armamentjam phallirjamäkpacha ?
Walja jaqinakaw mayachtʼat sumaki sarnaqxapxi
¿ KUNSA mayachtʼat sumaki sarnaqañat amuyta ?
Yaqhipanakatakix jan nuwasisa jan chʼaxwasa sarnaqañäkaspas ukhamakiwa .
Sañäni , walja markanakax jan nuwasiñatakiwa mä arsutʼäwir puripxi , ukampis mayachtʼat sumankthapit sarnaqañat sipansa , uñchʼukisisipkakiwa .
Ukatakixa , kunatsa markanakax jan chʼaxwañataki amtäwinakaparux pʼakintapxi ukanakat amuytʼañasawa .
¿ Kunatsa ukham waranq waranqa amtäwinakaparux pʼakintapxpacha ?
Kunattix akapach apnaqirinakaxa , mayachtʼat suman sarnaqañat sipansa , markapax jachʼankaspa ukatakwa llakisipxi .
Ukatwa , nuwasiñatakix wal armamentonakampi wakichrantasisipki , kunattix janiw qhiparañ munapkiti .
Pä markax jan chʼaxwankkchi ukhaxa , mayachtʼataw suman sarnaqapxi sasax janiw sisksnati .
Amuytʼañataki : pä jaqix fusilas aptʼatkam jiwayasiñataki wakichasisipkchi ukhaxa , ¿ janïr jiwayasipkipan sumankapxiw sasmati ?
Janiw khitis ukham sisksnati .
Walja markanakax niya ukhamaw jichha tiempon jikxatasipxi : janiw jupanak purax atinisxapxiti , ukat kawkïr markasa akatjamat nuwasiñ qalltakispawa .
Jan ukhamar puriñatakixa , ¿ kunas lurasiski ?
Armas nucleares sat armamentonakax janiw mayachtʼat jakasiñatakixa yanaptʼkiti
Tratado de No Proliferación Nuclear sat arustʼäwiwa 1970 maran uttʼayasiwayäna , ukat patak kimsaqallq tunka markanakat sipansa jilaw uka arustʼäwirux qillqayasipxäna , uka arustʼäwiruw walja jaqinakax atinisipxi .
Aka pä amtampiw uka arustʼäwirux puripxäna : 1 ) kawkïr markanakatï jan “ armas nucleares ” sat armamentonïpki uka markanakan jan uka armamento lurapxañapataki , 2 ) ukat uka armamentonakanïpki uka markanakax jan jukʼampi lurxapxañapataki .
Ukat chiqpachansa , jan khitis ukham armamentonakanïxañapatakiw uka arustʼäwirux puripxäna .
Chiqas uka amtäwix wali askiwa .
Ukampis yaqhipanakax uka amtäwix sallqjañatakikiw sasaw sapxi , kunattixa , jan uka armamentonïpki uka markanakar apanukuñatakiwa , mä arunxa , jarkʼasiñatakikiw uka arustʼäwix sasaw sapxi .
Ukat kawkïr markanakatï uka arustʼäwir mantapkäna ukanakax arsüwinakaparux janiw phuqapkaspati sasaw yaqhipanakax axsarayasipxaraki .
Ukhamarak yaqhip markanakaxa , uka armamento lurañ jarkʼkistu ukax janiw walïkiti sapxiwa , kunattix walïskaspaw jarkʼaqasiñatakix sasaw sapxaraki .
Ukampis kunampitï “ armas nucleares ” sat armamentonakax luraski ukanak yaqhanakatak apnaqañax walikïskiwa , janiw kawki markansa jarkʼatäkiti ukaw jukʼampi llakkañaxa .
¿ Kunatsa ?
Kunattix yaqhip markanakaxa , janiw “ armas nucleares ” sat armamentonak lurañatakïkiti sasinxa , jamasatwa uka armamentonak lurasipki .
Ukampis janiw ukakïkiti , kunattix uka armamentoni yaqhip markanakaxa akatjamatwa Tratado de No Proliferación Nuclear sat arustʼäwirux pʼakintapxaspa .
Ukat uka arustʼäwi contra parlirinakaxa , janiw jachʼa munañan markanakax uka armamentonakap jaytapkaspati , janiw ni chhaqtayapkaspasa sasin arsupxaraki .
Ukat maynix sarakiwa , uka armamentonaka apanukxañatakixa “ chʼaxwankasipki uka markanakawa taqi chuyma amtxapxañapa ukat maynit maynirusa atinisipxañaparakiwa , ukampis janiw khitis uk lurkaspati ” sasa .
Kunjamtï uñjawayktanxa , jaqinakax walsa mayachtʼat sarnaqañataki chʼamachasisipkchixa , ukampis inamayakiw ukham lurasipki .
Ukampis Diosan Arupat yatxatirinakax uka tuqit yatxapxiwa , kunattix Bibliax siwa : “ Jaqix janiw alaskiti pachpa jakañapxa , janirakiw tukuyäwipsa munañapar apnaqkaspati ” sasa ( Jeremías 10 : 23 ) .
Ukat saskakiwa : “ Jaqin amuyatapatxa sarnaqäwinakapax walikjamakiwa , ukampis tukuyapax jiwañakiwa ” sasa ( Proverbios 16 : 25 ) .
Ukhamasti qhanawa , akapach apnaqirinakax janiw kunjamatsa aka Uraqirux mayachtʼat sarnaqañ apankaspati .
Ukampis mä wawakïksnas ukham sarnaqañax utjaspawa .
¿ Khitis mayachtʼat sarnaqañ apanispa ?
Jaqinakax janiw kunjamatsa suman jakasiñ apankaspati , ukampis niyaw taqinix mayachtʼat jakasxapxani sasaw Diosax Qullan Qillqatanakapan säna .
Taqi kun lurir Diosakiwa ukham sarnaqasiñ apanispa .
Ukat yaqhipanakatakix janis ukhamäspaw sañjamäkchixa , ukampis Diosan arsutanakapax phuqasiniwa .
Jaqinakax suman mä amtaki sarnaqañapwa Diosax qalltatpach munäna , ukat uka amtapax janiw mayjtʼkiti sasaw Bibliax qhanañchistu .
* Ukat akïr qillqatanakawa uk sum uñachtʼayistu :
• “ [ Jehová ] Tatitun muspharkañ luräwinakap uñjir jutapxam , uraqin lurki uka muspharkañ luräwinaka : aka uraq tukuskamaw nuwasiñ tʼakurayi ; arconak jiskʼa jiskʼa pʼakinuqi , lansanak tʼunari , nuwasiñ carronaksa ninampiw phichhantaraki . ”
( SALMO 46 : 8 , 9 . )

• “ Nayan qullan qulluxansti janiw khiti kuna ñanqha luriris utjkaniti , kunjämatix umax qʼal phuqhantixa ukhamarakiw [ Jehová ] Tatitun yatiñapax taqi markpacharu phuqhantani . ” ( ISAÍAS 11 : 9 . )
• “ Tatitux wiñayatakiw jiwañarux tʼunjani , taqi jaqinakana nayranakapatsti jachanakapsa pichararakiniwa , markapan aynachtʼatapsti taqi aka uraqpachatxa chhaqtayxarakiniwa .
[ Jehová ] Tatituw ukham arsu . ” ( ISAÍAS 25 : 8 . )
• “ Ukampis jiwasax arsutaparjamaw suytʼasktan mä machaq uraqi , mä machaq alaxpachampi , kuntix Diosax : ‘ Churapxämaw ’ siskistu uka .
Ukansti taqi kunasa chiqapapunïniwa . ”
• “ Diosax taqi jachanakapwa nayranakapatxa picharani , janirakiw jiwañas , jachañas utjkxaniti , warariñasa ni usuyasiñasa .
Taqi kunanakatï nayrax utjkän ukanakax tukusxiwa . ”
Taqi uka arsutanakapax phuqasiniw sasinxa atinissnawa , kunattix taqi kun Lurir Jehová Diosaxa , sumankaña mayachtʼat sarnaqañ aka Uraqir apaniñatakix wali jachʼa chʼamaniwa .
Ukhamarak jupaw ukham lurañ amti .
Diosax ‘ munañaparjamaw ’ ‘ taqi kunsa , alaxpachankirinaksa aka uraqinkirinaksa , Criston munañapankañapatakix ’ mayachthapini siw Bibliaxa .
‘ Machaq uraqiw ’ utjani “ ukansti taqi kunasa chiqapapunïniwa ” siski ukaxa , amuyktan ukat sipansa jukʼampi sumäniwa .
Jutïrit parlasax Jehová Diosax akham sistuwa : “ Lakaxat mistkis uka arunakaxa , janiw nayan ukarux chʼusaki jan kun lurasax kuttankaniti , jan ukasti kuntix nayax munkta ukwa luri , kuntix nayax siskta ukwa phuqharaki ” sasa ( Isaías 55 : 11 ) .
Diosan Arupan mayachthapita
Kunjamtï nayrïr yatichäwin siskänxa , jaqinakan jaljtapxañapatakixa jila partix religionanakaw juchanixa .
Taqi kun Lurir Diosar iyawsir yaqhip jaqinakaxa “ kamisarak ukhamänisti ” sasaw sapxi .
Ukampis ¿ janit Diosan luqtirinakapasti sumaki mayachat sarnaqapxañapäki ?
Ukhamwa religionax jaqinakar jaljtayi , ukampis janiw Jehová Diosasa ni Bibliasa uka tuqit juchanïkiti .
Chiqpachansa , Diosan yatichäwinakapar istʼañat sipansa jaqinakan arupar istʼapki uka kʼari yupaychäwinakan juchapatwa ukhaman uñjasipxi .
Jesús tiempon judionakan yupaychäwip irpirinakaxa niya ukham amuyunakanïpxarakikïnwa .
Ukatwa Jesusax kʼari chuyman jaqinaka sasax sänxa , ukat akham sänwa : “ Walikpun Isaías profetax jumanakatxa saskänxa : ‘ Aka jaqinakax lakapampikiw jachʼañchapxitu , ukampis chuymanakapax nayatxa jayankiwa .
Janiw akchʼas walïkiti jupanakan yupaychaña churatanakapaxa , jupanakan yatichäwipax jaqinakan yatichäwipakïtap laykuʼ ” sasa .
Ukat sipanxa , chiqpach yupaychäwix jukʼampwa jaqinakar mayachthapi .
Uka tuqitxa Isaías profetax akham sänwa : “ Qhipa urunakansti suma saytʼatäxarakiniwa , kawkhankkitix Tatitun templopax uka qulluxa . Wali alto qullüniwa , taqi qullunakat sipansa wali altorakïniwa .
Taqi markanakasti uka qulluruw jutapxarakini , Tatituw taqi markanakaru taripani , walja markanakan chʼaxwatanakapwa tʼaqjarakini .
Uka markanakasti espadanakapxa qhulliñ aradoruw tukuyxapxani , lansanakapsti yawthapiñ hocenakaruraki .
Janirakiw kawkïr markas yaqha markampix nuwasiñatak sartkaniti .
Janirakiw guerran nuwasiñatakis yatichäwinakxa katuqapkaniti ” sasa ( Isaías 2 : 2 , 4 ) .
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapaxa , jichhürunakanxa pä patak kimsa tunka jila markanakanwa Diosan yatichäwinakapar istʼasaxa mayachtʼata sum sarnaqasipxi .
¿ Kunjamatsa mayachat sarnaqapxi ?
Apóstol Pablox sänwa : “ Munasiñampi isintasipxam , ukawa phuqhat kankañaru chikthapiyirixa ” sasa .
Aka qillqatan ‘ chikthapiyiri ’ siski uka aruxa griego arunxa ankunak sañwa munarakispa .
Uka ankunakaxa wiskhäkaspas ukham wali chʼullqinakawa ukat chʼakhanak wayxasi ukhamaraki chuymsa ukat yaqhanaksa kawkjankañapäkitix ukawjaruw wayxasi .
Munasiñax niya ukhamarakiwa : kunattix jaqinakaruw mayachthapi .
Kunjamtï Jesusax yatichawaykäna uka munasiñaxa , janiw jiwayasiñ mayak jarkʼkiti , jan ukasti taqi kasta jaqinakaruw mayachthapi ukat sumankthapit utjasiyi .
Ukham munasiñ utjipanwa aka suma arunakarjamax sarnaqapxi : “ Kunjämtï jumanakax jaqinakampi uñjatäñ munapktas ukhamarak jumanakax jupanakar uñjapxam ” .
Jesusan aka yatichäwipaxa , walja jaqinakaruwa jan jiskʼachas sarnaqapxañapatakix yanaptʼawayi .
‘ Maynit maynikam munasipxätaʼ
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapax aka arunak istʼasaw Criston chiqpach arkirinakäpxatapxa uñachtʼayapxi : “ Jumanakatix maynit maynikama munasipxätaxa , taqiniw amuyapxani nayan discipulonakaxäpxatama ” sasa .
Kunapachatï jaqinakax kastat jiskʼachasis chʼaxwarasipkäna ukhamaraki politiconakar yanapañ layku nuwarasisipkäna ukhawa cristianonakan aka munasiñapax sum amuyasïna .
Amuytʼañataki , khä 1994 maran kunapachatï Ruanda markan wal jiwarayasipkäna ukhaxa , Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapaxa jupanakkamax wali munasiñampiw sarnaqasipxäna .
Uka tiemponakanxa , jakäwinakap aptʼirjamäskasinsa , hutu sat tribunkir jilat kullakanakaxa tutsis sat tribunkir jilat kullakanakaparuw imantapxäna .
Ukampis janiw aka Uraqpacharux sumankañ jiwasax apanksnati , janiw jaqi masir munasiñsa taqinir yatichskaraksnati .
Ukat kunjamtï Bibliax siskixa , Diosaw amtaparjama horasapar uk lurani .
Ukampis jichha tiemponakanxa , mayachtʼata suman jakasiraksnawa .
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapawa ukham jichha tiempon sarnaqasipki , pasïr maranxa , waranqa millón millón horanakawa Bibliarjam sarnaqapxañapatakixa jaqinakar yatichawayapxatayna .
Diosan Arupan jikxataski uka chiqap arunakawa millón millón jaqinakarux mayachthapiski , ukatxa jan uñisisisa , jan jiskʼachasisa sarnaqañwa yatichaskaraki .
Taqiniruw ukham yatichtʼasipki , sañäni , arabenakaru ukat judionakaru , armenionakaru ukat turconakaru , alemananakarus ukat rusonakarusa .
Kunjamatsa Diosan Arupax mayachtʼat sarnaqañ yanaptʼaspa , ¿ uka tuqit yatxatañ munasmati ?
Markamankir Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapampi parltʼam jan ukax 2 janan jikxataski uka direccionarusa qillqanirakismawa .
[ Qhanañchäwi ]
Kuna amtampis jaqinakar luratayna uka tuqit yatxatañatakixa , ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ? sat libron 3 jaljap uñxatäta , ukasti Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapan luratawa .
[ 4 janan qhanañchäwipa ]
Jan nuwasiñatak waranq waranqa amtäwinakawa pʼakintasiwayi
[ 7 janan qhanañchäwipa ]
Akapach apnaqirinakax inamayaw chʼamachasisipki , ukampis Biblian yatichäwinakapaw mayachthapiski
[ 5 janan fotopa ]
Diosan Arupaw mayachtʼat sarnaqañ yanaptʼistu
[ 7 janan fotopa ]
Hutu ukat tutsi tribunakankiri Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapaw mä yupaychañ uta mayachtʼat lurasipki
Aka revist liytʼirinakan jisktʼäwinakapa
¿ Kunjamsa cristianonakax pampankir qutankir animalanakar katuñ uñjapxañapa ?
Animanalanak katuñax Bibliarjamax janiw juchäkiti ( Deuteronomio 14 : 4 , 5 , 9 , 20 ; Mateo 17 : 27 ; Juan 21 : 6 ) .
Ukampis khitinakatï ukham katur sarapxirïchi uka jilat kullakanakax Qullan Qillqatanakan jikxataski uka yatichäwinakapwa uñxattʼapxañapa .
Noé chachasa wawanakapasa manqʼañatakix animalanak katupxirïnwa , ukampis Diosax janïr manqʼkasax wilap apsupxäta sasaw säna ( Génesis 9 : 3 , 4 ) .
Ukhamax kunjamtï siskixa , animalanakan jakäwiparux respetasiñapänwa , kunattix Diosan uchatawa .
Ukatwa cristianonakax animalanakar respetapxi , janiw anatañ laykusa , ni kʼuchistʼañ laykukis jiwayapkiti ( Proverbios 12 : 10 ) .
Ukampis kunjam chuymampisa katur sartan uka tuqit amuytʼañaw wakisispa .
Kawkïr apostolanakatix chʼawlla katuñ wal yatipkäna uka apostolanakaxa , walja chawlla katusax wal kusisipxirïpachäna .
Ukampis jupanakax janiw katuñ yatisax jachʼa jachʼa tukupxirïkpachänti , ukat katurixa , janiw atipañ layku , chacha chach tukuñ layku sarapxirïkpachänti ; ukat janiw animalanakampi nuwasisasa , ni alisnaqasasa , ni jiwayasasa kusisipxirïkpachänti ( Salmo 11 : 5 ; Gálatas 5 : 26 ) .
Ukhamax mä cristianox akham jisktʼasiñapawa : “ ¿ Kunjamtï Jehová Diosax jakañar uñjki , ukhamti respetasktxa ?
¿ Animalanak katuñakiti amuyujankaski , ukat ukatakti parlasktxa ?
¿ Animalanak katurjamati sapürus sarnaqtxa jan ukax Diosan luqtiripjamacha sarnaqtxa ?
Animalanak katur sarañ laykuxa , ¿ Diosar jan iyawsir jaqinakampiti sarnaqtxa ukat familiajat amtasiskti ? ” sasa .
Kunapachatï animalanak katuñ urux purinki ukhaxa , yaqhip jilat kullakanakaxa , manqʼañatakiw animal katur sarta sasaw walïskaspas ukham tantachäwinaksa , Diosatak yaqha luräwinaksa jaytawayapxi .
Ukampis yaqha lurañanakat sipansa , Diosan Apnaqäwip nayrar uchasaw Diosar iyawsatassa atinisitassa uñachtʼaytanxa .
Ukat cristianonakjamaxa , animal katuñ tuqit Cesaran taqi kamachinakaparuw istʼtanxa , autoridadanakax phuqayasipkpansa janis istʼaskaktanwa .
Jehová Diosax animalanak katuñ tuqitxa kamsisa uk yatxasaxa , yaqhipanakax inas Diosan arunakaparjam lurxapxchini .
Ukampis kunjamxay chuymanakaparjam amtapxchini uk respetapxañasawa .
Ukatakix apóstol Pablon akïr iwxaparuw istʼapxañasa : ‘ Jan jiwasanakanx maynit mayniru jiskʼachasiñax utjpanti , ukat sipansa jan munapxamti jilaman lanktañapxa kunäkipansa , ni jucharus puriyapxarakimti ’ sänwa .
Ukham munasiña ukat respeto uñachtʼayañänixa , jilat kullakanakasampix sum apasiñäni , ukat taqi jakirinakar jakañ Churir Awkisarus kusisiyarakiñäniwa .
*
[ Qhanañchäwi ]
“ Preguntas de los lectores ” sat yatichäwi La Atalaya del 15 de mayo de 1990 revistat uñxattʼarakïta .
Munat liytʼirinaka
JICHHAT uksaruxa aka revistax mayjtʼayatäniwa , uk yatiyaniñ munapxsma .
Ukampis kunas pachpakïskani ukwa nayraqat qhanañchtʼaniñ munapxaraksma .
Yatiyañataki .
Jehová Diosan Apnaqäwipat yatiyaski satakïskaniwa .
Ukhamasti , Jehová Diosaruw chiqpach Diosarjam jachʼañchaskakini , ukatxa Apnaqäwipat yatiyasarakiw liytʼirinakar chuymachani .
Kunjamatï aka qillqatanxa 18 ukat 19 jananakan Diosan Apnaqäwipat sum qhanañchkixa ukhama .
Ukatxa janiw ukakïkaniti , kunjamtix nayratpach Jesucristor iyawsañataki chʼamañchkixa ukhamarakiw chʼamañchaskani , Diosan chiqa yatichäwinakapsa arxataskarakiniwa , ukat profecianakax kunjamsa jichhürunakan phuqasiski uksa sum qhanañchaskarakini .
Ukhamasti , sapa kimsa phaxsin mistunkani uka aymar revistanxa kunanakas mayjtʼayatäni ukanak jichhax uñjañäni .
*
Awisaxa mä tuqitaki qhanañchtʼir wakichäwinakaw utjarakini .
“ ¿ Yatiyätati ? ”
siski ukaxa Bibliat sum amuytʼañasatakiw yanaptʼistani .
“ Diosar jakʼachasipxam ” siski ukasti Jehová Diosat parlir chiqanakwa Bibliat sum qhanañcharakini .
Ukat “ Kunsa liytʼirinakax yatiñ munapxi ” siski uka wakichäwisti , kuntï wal yatiñ munktanxa uka tuqinakatwa Bibliampi qhanañcharakini .
Awisaxa , “ Familianakataki ” siski ukarakiw utjani ; ukanxa kuna jan walinakansa familianakax uñjasi ukat kunjamsa Bibliax uka jan walinak askichañ yanaptʼistaspa ukanakatwa qhanañcharakini .
Ukat “ Wawanakar yatichañataki ” siski uksti awk taykanakaw wawanakapamp chika liytʼapxarakispa .
Maysa tuqitsti , “ Wayn tawaqunakataki ” siski uka wakichäwix wali askirakïniwa , ukhamasti jupanakatakjam wakichatäniwa , ukhamata jupanakas Bibliat yatxattʼapxarakispa .
Ukat yaqha wakichäwinakarakiw awisax utjani .
“ Jupjam iyawsäwinïpxañäni ” siski ukaxa , Biblian qillqatäki uka jaqinakat yatiqasiñatakiw chʼamañchistani .
Kunjamatï aka pachpa qillqatan Elías profetat wali muspharkañ parlixa ukhama , ukax 14 - 17 jananakankiwa .
Kunajamtsa jupanakjam iyawsäwinïsna ukawa sum uñachtʼayistani .

Ukat “ . . . qillqata ” siski ukansti misioneronakan jan ukax yaqha chiqanakar khitat jilat kullakanakan qillqanitanakapaw uñstarakini .
Ukampis Biblian qallta yatichäwinakap sum qhanañchtʼañatakix “ Jesusan yatichäwinakapa ” siski ukaw utjarakini .
Chiqansa , Yatiyañataki sat aka revistax Bibliar respetirinakatakisa jan ukax kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichpach uk yatxatañ munirinakatakisa wali wakisirikïskaniwa .
Bibliat yatxatañ munirinakar aka qillqatax wal yanaptʼaspa ukwa wal munapxta .
QILLQIRINAKA
[ Qhanañchäwi ]
Jichhat uksarux Yatiyañataki sat revistax pä kastaw mistsunini .
Sapa kimsa phaxsit mistunkani ukanakax taqinitaki wakichatäniwa .
Ukampis sapa phaxsin mistunkani , mä arunxa sapa phaxsin 15 urunakan mistunkani ukaxa , Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapan tantachäwinakapan yatiqapxañapatakiw wakichatäni , khitis uka tantachäwinakar saraskakispawa .
Taqiniw ukham mayisipxi
WALJA millón millón jaqinakawa pachpa arunakampi taqi kunxar Munañan Diosaru mayisipxi , uka tuqit amuytʼañäni .
Ukampis kunsa mayisipki ukxa mä qhawqhanikiw yatipxi .
¿ Ukham jan yatisa mayiñax utjaspati ?
Chiqpachansa , sapüruw ukham mayipxi .
¿ Kunsa mayipxi ?
Munañamampix apnaqapxita , mä arunxa , Reinomax jutpan sasaw mayipxi .
Cristianüpxtwa sirinakatxa , niya 37.000 religionanakaw utji sasaw yatisi , ukatxa pä waranq millonat sipansa jila jaqinakarakiw ukar sarapxi .
Ukar saririnakatxa niya taqiniw Jesusan mayisïwipatxa yatipxi .
Jumax inas uka mayisïwit yatiraksta .
Kunjamtï Jesusax arkirinakapar yatichkänxa , uka mayisïwix akham sasaw qallti : “ Alaxpachankir nanakan Awkixa , sutimax jachʼañchatäpan .
Munañamampisti apnaqapxita .
Munañamasti luratäpan akapachanxa , kunjämäti alaxpachana luratäki ukhama ” sasa .
Ukham arunakampix walja maranakaw Diosat amtasir jaqinakax taqi chuyma rezasipxi , janiw iglesianakti mayisipkixa , jan ukasti sapakisa jan ukax utanakapansa mayisipxapuniwa .
Llakinkkasinsa ukhamarak kusisitäkasinsa , chuymatpachpunwa aka arunakampix mayisipxi .
Yaqhipanakaxa , kunsa mayipxi uk jan amuytʼasaw uka kikpa arunakampix mayisipxi .
Ukampis janiw cristianütwa sirinakakix Diosan Reinopat mayisipkiti , jan ukasti yaqhanakax mayisipxarakiwa .
Cristor jan iyawsir religionanakansa ukham mayisipxaraki
Jichha tiempo judionakan religionapanxa mä wali uñtʼat mayisïwipaxa qaddish fúnebre satawa .
Janis jiwatanak tuqita ukhamarak janis llakisiñ tuqita parlkchixa , ukampis jaqi jiwäwinwa uka mayisïwxa rezapxi .
Mä chiqax akham siwa : “ Jupay [ Diosay ] reinop jichhürunakanxa uttʼaypan [ . . . ] ukhamarak jutïr urunsa ” sasa .
* Ukat sinagoganakan mayiski uka nayra yaqha mayisïwipanxa , Davitan wawapat jutir Mesiasan Reinopat parlaraki .
‘ Janiw cristianonakäpkti ’ sapki uka religionanakar sarir walja jaqinakaxa Diosan uttʼayat Reinopat yatxatañxa munapxarakiwa .
The Times of India sat periodiconxa , India tuqinkir wali uñtʼat mä yupaychir jaqixa ( 1800 maranakan jakir jaqi ) , hinduismompiru , islam religionampiru ukhamaraki cristianüpxtwa sirinakampiruw mayachthapiñ munäna , ukat akham sänwa : “ Kunapachatï Inti jalsu tuqinkirinakampi Inti jalanta tuqinkirinakampix qhumantasxapxani ukhakiw Diosan chiqpach Reinopax purinini ” sasa .
Strathfield ( Australia ) markan jikxataski uka islamista universidadan pʼiqtʼiripaxa akham sasaw jichhak mä periodicon arsüna : “ Kunjamtï taqi musulmananakax sapkixa , Jesusax kuttʼaniniwa ukat Diosan chiqpach Reinop uttʼayani ukham amuyta ” sasa .
Chiqpachansa , walja millón millón jaqinakaw Diosan Reinoparux suyasipki ukhamarak mayisipki .
Ukampis mä jisktʼaruw jan kamsañsa yatipkiti .
Jumax yatpachätawa , aka revista qillqirinakaxa , mä arunxa , nänakaxa Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapjamax Bibliat parltʼañatakiw marka masinakamar utat uta sarasax visittʼapxta .
Aka uraqpachanwa ukham parlir sarapxta , jichhax 236 markanakanwa yatiyasipktxa , 400 arunakat sipansa jila arunakaru .
Chiqanxa , Diosan Reinopatwa , mä arunxa , Diosan Apnaqäwipatwa parlapxta .
Uk amuyañatakixa aka revistan sutip uñxattʼma : Yatiyañataki sat revista .
Jehová Diosan Apnaqäwipat yatiyaski .
Ukat “ ¿ Munañamampisti apnaqapxita ? ” sas Diosar mayisirïtati sasaw waljanir jisktʼapxta , ukat waljanix “ jïsa ” sapxiwa .
Ukat uka arunakampix kunsa maypachätan sataxa , janiw kamsañs yatipkiti , ukat yaqhipanakax yaqha tuqinakatak parlapxi .
¿ Kunatsa jan sum yatkasas Diosan Apnaqäwipat waljanix mayipxpacha ?
¿ Chʼamäpachat uka tuqit yatxatañaxa ?
Janiwa . Ukax Biblianwa wali sum qhanañchasi , uka tuqit yatiñaxa aka jan wali tiemponakan suytʼäwinïñamatakiw chuymachiristamxa .
Jutir yatichäwinxa , kamsis uka tuqit Biblianxa uk sum yatxatañäni .
[ Qhanañchäwi ]
Jesusax yatichkäna uka mayisïwjamarakiwa , qaddish sat mayisïwinxa Diosan sutipax jachʼañchatäpan sixa .
Yaqhipanakaxa , qaddish sat mayisïwix Jesusax aka Uraqinkkäna ukhaw qillqasïna sapkchisa , jan ukax uka nayraw qillqasïna sapkchisa , janiw uka tuqit llakisiñasäkiti .
Kunattix Jesusan mayisïwipax Qullan Qillqatanakarjam apsutänwa , janiw machaqat uñstayatäkänti , uka tiempo jakir judionakax uka Qillqatanakxa sumwa uñtʼapxäna .
Chiqpachansa , Jesusax kuntï judío jilat kullakanakapax mayipxañapäkäna ukanak mayiñwa chʼamañchaskäna .
¿ Kunas Diosan Apnaqäwipaxa ?
¿ KUNA tuqitsa Jesusax yatiyäna ?
Diosan Apnaqäwipat yatiyäna .
Jesusan parlatanakap istʼir jaqinakax walja kutiw uka Apnaqäwit parlir istʼapxpachäna .
¿ Janit uka jaqinakax uk sum amuyapkpachäna ?
¿ Kunas uka Apnaqäwix sasati Jesusar jisktʼapxpachäna ?
Janiwa .
Biblian janiw ukham jisktʼäwix utjkiti .
Ukhamaxa , ¿ kunas Diosan Apnaqäwipax uk sumti yatipxpachäna ?
Judionakax qullanjam uñjapkäna uka nayra Qillqatanakanxa , Diosan Apnaqäwipatxa sum parläna .
Chiqpachansa , kunas uka Apnaqäwixa ukhamarak kuns apanini ukxa wali qhana arunakampiw qhanañchäna .
Jichhürunakanxa , jiwasax Qullan Qillqatanakat uñxatasarakiw uka Apnaqäwitxa jukʼamp yatxatsna .
Kunanaktï Bibliax Diosan Apnaqäwipat yatichki ukanak paqallq tuqit uñxattʼañäni : Jesusan judío mitanakapasa ukat jupanakat nayra jakirinakasa kimsa yatichäwitxa sum yatipxäna .
Ukat Jesusampi apostolanakapampirakiwa kimsa yatichäwinakatxa qhanañchapxarakïna .
Ukat paqallqükis uka yatichäwixa jichha tiemponwa sum qhanstawayxi .
Diosan Apnaqäwipaxa chiqpach gobiernowa , ukasti wiñayatakiw apnaqani .
Biblian nayrïr profeciapanxa , Diosaxa Dios chuyma jaqinakar qhispiyañatakix mä qhispiyir khitanïx sasaw säna .
Uka qhispiyiriruxa ‘ wawa ’ sasiwa . Supayampi ukhamarak Adanampi Evampix Diosa contra saytʼasax kunanakarus aptʼawayistu ukanakwa uka Wawax chhaqtayani sasaw arsusïna ( Génesis 3 : 15 ) .
Walja maranak pasatatxa , uka ‘ wawatxa ’ jan ukax Mesías tuqitxa Davitarux sum qhanañchasirakïna : Jutaniw sat wawax mä Reinon apnaqani , janiw mayni gobiernonakjamäkaniti , kunattix wiñayatakïniwa sasa ( 2 Samuel 7 : 12 - 14 ) .
Diosan Apnaqäwipawa akapach apnaqirinakarux tukjani .
Kunjamsa nayrapachanakatpach jichhakamax yaqha yaqha jachʼa markanakax apnaqapxäna ukwa Daniel profetax mä visionan uñjäna .
Kunanaksa tukuyarux uñjäna uk uñxatapxañäni : “ Uka [ qhip qhipa ] reyinakan apnaqañapkamasti , alaxpachankiri Diosax mä yaqha reino saytʼayarakini , uka reinosti janipuniw tukjatäkaniti ni apnaqatäkarakinisa yaqha markanakampixa , jan ukasti jupaw taqi yaqha reinonakarux tukjani , wiñayan wiñayapaw uka reinox utjarakini ” .
Ukhamasti akapach taqi apnaqäwinakax wiñay wiñayatak tukjatäxaniwa , chʼaxwäwinakasa , ñanqha luräwinakapasa , lunthatasïwinakapasa chhaqtxarakikiniwa .
Kunjamtï uka profecian siskixa , Diosan Apnaqäwipax niyaw aka Uraqxaru apnaqxani ( Daniel 2 : 44 , 45 ) .
Janiw mä suma gobiernokïkaniti , jan ukasti uka gobiernokiw apnaqxani .
Diosan Apnaqäwipaxa chʼaxwäwinaksa , usuntañanaksa , manqʼat pisinkañanaksa , jiwañsa chhaqtayxaniwa .
Aka Uraqin kunanaksa Diosan Apnaqäwipax lurani ukanakat qhanañchiri walja profecianakaw Biblian utji .
Wali askinakpun lurani , janiw kuna apnaqäwis ukham lurkiti ni lurkarakispasa .
Amuytʼapxañäni : ¡ nuwasiñ armamentonakax wiñayatak chhaqtayatäxaniwa !
Bibliax akham siwa : “ [ Diosax ] aka uraq tukuskamaw nuwasiñ tʼakurayi ” sasa ( Salmo 46 : 9 ) .
Janiw qullirinakas ni hospitalanakasa munasxaniti , usunakax chhaqtatäxaniwa .
Ukanxa ‘ janiw khitis sisxaniti : “ Usutätwa ” sasaxa ’ ( Isaías 33 : 24 ) .
Janiw khitis manqʼatjam usutas jikxatasxaniti ni manqʼatjamsa jiwxaniti .
‘ Manqʼax yapunakan jilarkiriw utjani ’ ( Salmo 72 : 16 ) .
Janiw jiwirin utapar sarañasa , ukhamarak jiwatanakar allintañasa utjxaniti , panteonanakasa , morguenakasa , wali llakit jachtʼasisa sarnaqañas chhaqtxaniwa .
Jiwañas chhaqtayatäxaniwa .
Taqi kun lurir Jehová “ Tatitux wiñayatakiw jiwañarux tʼunjani , taqi jaqinakana nayranakapatsti jachanakapsa pichararakiniwa ” ( Isaías 25 : 8 ) .
Diosan Apnaqäwipanxa Dios kikpan ajllit Apnaqiriwa apnaqi .
Mesiasax janiw jupa kikpa apnaqirjam uttʼayaskänti , janirakiw juchan jaqinakas chhijllapkarakïnti .
Jan ukasti Jehová Dios kikpaw ajlliwayi .
Mesías ukat Cristo uka arunakax “ ajllita ” sañ muni , ukhamasti mayniw ajllïna .
Ukhamaxa , Jehová Diosaw apnaqañapatakix Jesusar ajllïna .
Diosax jupa tuqit akham siwa : “ Akax servirixaxa , khitirutix nayax uywaskta ukaxa , ajllisitaxawa , jupanrakwa kusistxa .
Ajayuxsa jupxarurakiw uchtxa , ukhamat kunatix chiqapäki ukanak taqi markanakaru apaniñapataki ” sasa ( Isaías 42 : 1 ; Mateo 12 : 17 , 18 ) .
Kunjam apnaqirsa muntan uka tuqitxa , ¿ khitis Lurir Diosasat sipansa jukʼampi yatispa ?
Diosan Apnaqäwipan kunjamsa uka Apnaqirix apnaqani ukxa taqi jaqinakaruw uñachtʼayäna .
Nazaretankir Jesusawa jutaniw sat Mesiasaxa .
Kawkïr familiat jutanix siskäntï Diosaxa ukhamarjamaw purinïna ( Génesis 22 : 18 ; 1 Crónicas 17 : 11 ; Mateo 1 : 1 ) .
Janïr jutkäna uka nayra qillqat profecianakawa Jesusan sarnaqäwipan phuqasïna .
Ukatxa , alaxpachatwa , jupax Mesiasaskapuniw sasax sasïna .
¿ Kunjamatsa ?
Dios pachpawa alaxpachat arsunïna ukat Yuqajaw sasaw sanirakïna , ukat angelanakax jupaw jutaniw satäkäna uka Mesiasaxa sasaw sapxarakïna .
Mä tuqitxa , Jesusax milagronak lurarakïna , ukhamatwa Diosan yanaptʼapampi luratapax amuyasïna , waranq waranqa jaqinakaw uka milagronak lurir uñjapxäna .
* Sapa kutiwa kunjam apnaqirïnisa ukxa uñachtʼayäna .
Jaqinakarux janiw chʼamanïsakix yanapkänti , jan ukasti , wal jaqinakar yanaptʼañ munäna .
Waxtʼasiri , khuyaptʼayasiri , jan axsariri , ukat altʼat chuyman jaqïnwa .
Uraqinkkasax kunjamsa sarnaqawayäna ukax Biblian qillqatäskiwa .
Diosan Apnaqäwipanxa , Cristomp chikax 144.000 ajllitanakaw apnaqapxani .
Yaqha jaqinakaw nayamp chikax alaxpachan apnaqapxani sasaw Jesusax säna , ukham sasax apostolanakapamppachatwa parlaskäna .
Uka jilat kullakanakarux “ jiskʼa tama ” sasaw säna .
Uka qhipatwa , jiskʼa tamaxa 144.000 Diosar luqtirinakäpxaniwa sasax apóstol Juanarux yatiyasiskäna .
Jupanakaw Cristompi chika sacerdotenakjam luqtapxani ukhamaraki apnaqapxani .
Diosan Apnaqäwipax alaxpachan apnaqxiwa , niyaw aka Uraqxaru apnaqanxani .
Diosan Apnaqäwipat paqallqükis uka yatichäwix wali muspharkañawa .
Jesusax alaxpachan munañanïñwa katuqxi sañatakixa , walja chiqanakanwa Biblian qillqata .
Alaxpachanwa jichhax apnaqxi ukat niyaw aka Uraqxaru apnaqanxani ukat kawkïr profecianaktï arsuwayktan ukanakwa phuqayani .
¿ Jumax Diosan Apnaqäwipan bendicionanakap katuqarakïtati ?
Jesusax kuntï yatiykäna ukham suytʼäwix janipuniw utjkiti .
Kunapachatï nayra waranq waranqa maranakan Adanax Diosa contra saytʼkäna ukhaxa , Jehová Diosax amtaj phuqañatakixa mä apnaqäwi uttʼayäxa sasaw säna .
¿ Kunas Diosan amtapaxa ?
Taqi chuyma luqtir jaqinakax aka Uraqin wiñay wiñayataki mä paraison jakasipxaspa ukaw Diosan amtapaxa .
Diosan nayrapach arsutaparjamax uka apnaqäwix jichhax uttʼayatäxiwa uk yatisaxa , ¿ janit chuymamax wali kusisitäki ?
Ukhamaxa , Diosan Apnaqäwipax janiw jan amuykañäkiti , jan ukasti uttʼayatäskapuniwa .
Diosan uttʼayata Apnaqirixa uñisirinakap taypin apnaqxiwa ( Salmo 110 : 2 ) .
Diosat jithiqtata ñanqha jaqinak taypitwa , Diosar uñtʼañ munirinakaru ukhamaraki ‘ ajayuna chiqakankañampi ’ yupaychañ munir jaqinakaruxa Mesiasax thaqhaski , ukhamatwa Jesusax Awkipan munañap phuqaski .
Diosan Apnaqäwipan wiñay wiñay aka Uraqin jakasxapxañapatakixa , taqi kasta jaqinakaru , jiskʼar jachʼaru , pisinkirinakaru ukhamarak qamirinakaruw yatiyasiski .
Jumax ukham sum jakasirakismawa ukatakiw chʼamachtʼapxsma .
Jïsa , Diosan Apnaqäwipat jukʼampi yatxataskakim ukhamatwa Diosan gobiernopan jakasïta . [ Qhanañchäwi ]
Ukatakixa Mateo 3 : 17 , Lucas 2 : 10 - 14 ukat Juan 6 : 5 - 14 uka jiskʼa tʼaqanak uñxattʼapxäta
¿ Utaman Bibliat yatxattʼañ munasmati ?
Diosata , Apnaqäwipata ukat jaqinakatak Diosan amtapata chiqa yatichäwinak yatiqasaxa , akham jan wali tiemponakansa kusisitaw sarnaqasisma .
Jukʼampi yatxatañ munsta jan ukax Bibliat inaki yatichayasiñ munsta ukhaxa Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakaparuw qillqañama , sucursalanakapan direccionanakapaxa 2 janankiwa .
