Eliasax Diosat mayisiskana ukhaxa , uywatapax “ quta tuqiri ” uñtäna
Wayn tawaqunakataki
Jan axsarir waynitu
Akham lurasmaxa : Kawkjantï jan pantjasiyapkiristamxa ukawjaruw liyir sarañama .
Liykasaxa , jumax ukankkasmas ukhamwa amuyasiñama .
Uñjam kamachasipkisa , istʼarakim kunjamsa arsusipki ukat kunjam chuymampis sapa maynix parlasipki uksa amuyañamarakiwa .
KUNA TUQITS PARLASI ( 1 SAMUEL 17 : 1 - 11 , 26 , 32 - 51 LIYTʼMA ) .
Goliatat amuytʼañäni .
