1 , 2 YATICHÄWINAKA 7 - 15 JANAKAMA
Nayrïr yatichäwinxa , familian Diosar yupaychañ tuqit jan ikjañatakix sapa mayniw yanaptʼañapa sasaw qhanañchi .
Payïr yatichäwinsti , familpacha suma nayranïñasa , mä arunxa jan qullqi chuymanïñasa , ukat Diosar jukʼamp yupaychañ amtanïñasa ukhamarak familiana Diosar sapa semana yupaychañas kunja wakiskiris ukwa qhanañchi .
3 YATICHÄWI 16 - 20 JANAKAMA
Cristianonakatakix Jehová Diosaw taqi kunat sipansa nayranki .
Aka yatichäwinwa kunsa Eva warmitsa , Job chachatsa ukat Diosan Yuqapatsa yatiqassna ukwa qhanañchistu .
4 YATICHÄWI 21 - 25 JANAKAMA
Romanos 11 qillqatanxa , apóstol Pablox mä olivo alitwa parli , ukasti mä uñachtʼäwikiwa .
¿ Uka alin saphipasa , troncopasa , ramapasa kunamp sasisa ?
Uka jisktʼan qhanañchäwipaxa , Jehová Diosan amtapata ukhamarak yatiñkankañapatwa jukʼamp sum qhanañchistani .
5 YATICHÄWI 28 - 32 JANAKAMA
Aka yatichäwinxa , Salmo 3 ukat 4 jaljanakatwa yatxataskañäni . Diosan amuytʼayataw Davitax uka qʼuchunak qillqäna .
Jehová Diosar taqi chuyma atinisiñäni ukat yanaptʼap mayiñänix janiw axsarkañäniti ukwa uka qʼuchunakax uñachtʼayistu .
Absalón yuqapax jupa contra saytʼasïna ukhasa ukat yaqha jan waltʼäwinakansa David reyix ukhamwa luräna .
