Hebreo Arut Qullan Qillqatanakanxa , Mesiasat parlir walja profecianakaw utji .
Uka profecianakat yatxatasax khitïnsa Mesiasax ukxa qhanwa amuyañäni .
Aka yatichäwinakax Diosan arunakap sum yatiyañatakis yanaptʼarakistaniwa .
Ukatxa kuntï Jehová Diosax Arupan siski ukar taqi chuym atinisiñwa yanaptʼarakistani .
