KUNA AMTAMPISA AKA YATICHÄWINAKAJJ WAKICHASI
1 , 2 YATICHÄWINAKA 3 - 12 JANAKAMA
Aka pä yatichäwinakajja , cristiano casadonakarojj Jehová Diosan ewjjanakapar istʼaña ukat chacha warmi jakañajj Diosan mä regaloparjam uñjañatakiw yanaptʼani .
Ukatsti , chacha warmi jan waltʼayasipki ukanakarojja , Biblian ewjjtʼanakapat kawkïrinakas kusisit wasitat jakasipjjañapatak yanaptʼaspa ukwa qhanañchtʼaraki .
3 YATICHÄWI 17 - 21 JANAKAMA
Jehová Diosaw tiempo uttʼayirejj siski ukajj kamsañsa muni ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjataskañäni , ukat Diosaru ukhamarak Bibliaru jukʼamp confiyañatakis yanaptʼarakistaniwa .
Ukatsti , Jehová Diosajj qhespiykistani uka uru puriniñapkamajj tiempo jan ina chʼusaru aptʼasiñatakiw yanaptʼarakistani .
4 YATICHÄWI 23 - 27 JANAKAMA
Juchararäkstansa , Diosar munasiñaw Jupajj kunjamäkitï uk uñachtʼayañatak yanaptʼistu .
Jehová Diosat yateqasiñatakisa ukat kusisiyañatakis kunsa lursna ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjatañäni .
Ukatsti , Diosar jachʼañchaskakiñatakejj kunsa lursna ukwa uñjarakiñäni .
YAQHA YATICHÄWINAKA
13 Jilïrinakaw wal yanaptʼawayapjjetu
22 Aka revista liytʼirinakan jisktʼäwinakapa
28 “ Amuyasipjjam fariseonakan levadurapata ”
31 ¿ Kunanakas imatäski ?
