KUNA AMTAMPISA AKA YATICHÄWINAKAJJ WAKICHASI
1 YATICHÄWI 3 - 7 JANAKAMA
‘ Waljaniw yatjjatañatak chʼamachasipjjani , ukatsti cheqa yatiñajj jukʼampiw jiljjattarakini ’ sasaw Danielajj mä profecian arsüna ( Dan .
12 : 4 , NM ) . Uka profeciajj kunjamsa phoqasiski ukat Jesusajj Jehová Diosan servirinakapampïskatap kunjamatsa yatsna ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjataskañäni .
2 YATICHÄWI 11 - 15 JANAKAMA
¿ Khitinakas Diosan Reinopan cheqpach markachirinakapäpjje ?
Jupanakajj kunsa lurapjjañapa ukat Jehová Diosan kamachinakapar munasipjjatap kunjamsa uñachtʼayapjje ukwa aka yatichäwin qhanañchasiskani .
3 , 4 YATICHÄWINAKA 20 - 29 JANAKAMA
Supayajja , jan amuykaya sipitanakwa Diosat jitheqtañasatakejj wakichi .
Aka yatichäwinakanwa kunjamsa aka phesqa sipitanakar jan jaltʼksna uk yatjjatañäni : 1 ) jan amuytʼasis mäki parlaña , 2 ) ajjsaraña ukat jaqenakampi jan wali lurañar wiytatäña , 3 ) jiwas pachpa juchañchasiña , 4 ) qollqe chuymäña ukat 5 ) casadöcasin yaqhampi sarnaqaña .
