1 , 2 YATICHÄWINAKA 4 - 13 JANAKAMA
¿ Khitinakas taqe luräwinakapan sumaru saranti ?
Aka yatichäwinwa , kunsa uka toqet jaqenakajj amuyapjje uk yatjjatañäni .
Ukat cheqpacha sumaru sarantañatakejja , Jehová Diosaruw atinisiñasa ukat kuna luräwtï churkistu ukwa phoqhañasaraki , uka toqets yatjjataskarakiñäniwa .
3 , 4 YATICHÄWINAKA 19 - 28 JANAKAMA
Alajjpachar sarañataki ajllitanakasa ukat ‘ yaqha uwijanakasa ’ ¿ kunatsa aka oraqen ‘ sarir jaqenakjamapjjewa ’ sasin sistanjja ?
Uka jisktʼar qhanañchtʼañatakiw aka yatichäwinakajj yanaptʼistani .
Ukatjja sarir jaqenakjam jakaskakiñatakisa ukat aka Oraqpachankir jilat kullakanakasamp Diosar serviskakiñatakiw yanaptʼarakistani .
YAQHA YATICHÄWINAKA
3 Jan walinakatakwa Biblia apnaqapjje , amuyasiñäni
14 Aka revista liytʼirinakan jisktʼäwinakapa
