32 Aka yatichäwinakaw utji : yatiyañataki 2012
NAYRÏR JANA : Corea del Sur uksa toqenjja , 100.000 jilat kullakanakaw utji .
Ukat politicaru jan mitisipjjatapatsa ukat enemigonakap contra armanakamp jan saytʼasipjjatapatsa , waljaniw carcelan jistʼantatäpjje .
Ukham jistʼantatas uñjasipkchejja , cartanak qellqasaw Diosan arunakap yatiyañatakejj chʼamachasipjje
