Uka markajj walja qotanakanirakiwa , jilpachajj chikachikana ukat Inti jalsu toqena .
Kawkhantï yatiyirinakajj jukʼamp munaski uka cheqanakar sarir jilat kullakanakajja , barcotwa yatiyir sarapjje .
