TAMAN YATJJATAÑATAKI
▪ Biblia liytʼasa askinak apsupjjañäni
▪ Diosan Arupajja juma pachpatakisa ukat yaqhanakar yanaptʼañatakis wali askiwa
Apóstol Pablojj akham sänwa : “ Diosan arupasti jakaskiwa , jachʼa chʼamanirakiwa ” sasa .
Ukampis Diosan Arupajja , yatjjatañäni ukat ukarjam sarnaqañäni ukhakiw yanaptʼistani .
Aka yatichäwinakawa kunjamsa Bibliat sum yatjjatsna uk qhanañchtʼaskani , ukat yateqatasajj kunjamsa yatiykasasa jakäwisansa yanaptʼistaspa uks qhanañchaskarakini .
▪ Askïkis ukpun ajllipjjañäni
▪ “ Janiw qarjasiñasäkiti ”
Niyakejjay Diosan alajjpachankiri ukat aka Oraqenkir markap taypinkstanjja , ¿ kuntï Diosan markapajj jichhürunakan luraski ukar kunjamsa yanaptʼsna ?
¿ Kunas jan qarjtasa Diosan markapamp chika saraskakiñatakejj yanaptʼistani ?
Uka jisktʼanakaruw aka yatichäwinakajj qhanañchtʼaskani .
YAQHA YATICHÄWINAKA
3 Jupanakajj taqe chuymaw sarapjjäna : México markaru
17 Phesqa tunka maranakaw círculo polar ártico jakʼan precursorjam irnaqtʼasipkta
32 ¿ Yatiyätati ?
NAYRÏR JANA : Walja tamanakanjja , jilat kullakanakajj 7 : 30 alwa horasaruw yatiyir sarañatakejj tantachasipjje ukat awisajj jukʼampi alwaw mistupjje .
Ukat thakin sarkasin jikisipki ukanakaruw yatiyapjje
