▪ Taqe kunatï utjki ukanakajj taqe chʼamani Diosan utjatapwa uñachtʼayi
Taqe chʼamani Diosaw taqe kunatï alajjpachan utjki ukanak lurawayi .
¿ Jumajj ukhamaw sasmati ?
Janiw taqenejj iyawsapkiti .
¿ Kunjamsa Jehová Diosar iyawsapjjañapatakejj jaqenakar yanaptʼsna ?
¿ Ukat kunjamsa jiwasajj ‘ jan uñjkay Diosan ’ utjatap iyawsktan uk chʼollqheñchaskaksna ?
Ukanak aka yatichäwin yatjjatam .
▪ Esclavjam Jehová Diosar servipjjam
Cristianonakajj esclavjamaw Jehová Diosar servipjjañapa sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Aka yatichäwinjja , kunsa mä esclavojj Moisesan katoqat Leyirjamajj luraspäna ukwa qhanañchi .
Ukatjja , kunjamsa Supayana ukat akapachapan esclavopar jan tuksna ukat Diosat jan jitheqtañajj kunjamsa yanaptʼistu uks qhanañcharakiwa .
▪ Wali suma amuytʼat mayisïwit askinak yateqapjjañäni
▪ Jesusan mayisitaparjam sarnaqapjjañäni
Diosan Arupat sapüru lupʼiñajj sum mayisiñasatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Nayrïr yatichäwinjja , kunjamsa levitanakajj israelitanakatak mayipjjäna ukwa uñachtʼayistu .
Payïr yatichäwinjja , Jesusan mayisïwiparjamajj kunjamsa sarnaqsna ukwa uñachtʼayarakistu .
Paypach mayisïwinjja , jiwasan munañasat sipansa kunatsa Jehová Diosan munañap nayrar uchañasa ukwa qhanstayi .
3 Jupanakajj taqe chuymaw sarapjjäna : Filipinas markaru
17 Jehová Diosar confiyasaw bendicionanak katoqapjjta
31 Yatiyañatak jukʼamp chʼamachasipjjañäni
NAYRÏR JANA : Mä jilataw Panajachel markan yatiyaski , uka jiskʼa markajj Atitlán qota lakanwa jikjjatasi .
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapajja , Guatemala markan utjki uka arunakatjja , 11 arunakanwa yatiyapjje , español arojj janiw uka taypin jakhutäkiti
