21 JANA • 125 , 53 QʼOCHUNAKA
¿ Jehová Diosan markapampi chikati sarasktanjja ?
26 JANA • 45 , 27 QʼOCHUNAKA
▪ ‘ Sapa mayniru kunjam qhanañchañsa yatiñasawa ’
▪ Jesusan ewjjaparjam yatiyapjjañäni
Utat uta yatiykasajja , awisajj kunayman toqetwa jisktʼapjjestu .
Aka nayrïr yatichäwinwa kunjamsa ukham jisktʼanakar qhanañchsna ukatakejj yanaptʼistani .
Ukat payïr yatichäwinsti , Diosan arunakap yatiykasajj Mateo 7 : 12 qellqat phoqañajj kunja wakiskirisa ukwa yatjjataskañäni .
▪ Jehová Diosajj taqe kunsa sum uttʼayi
▪ ¿ Jehová Diosan markapampi chikati sarasktanjja ?
Jehová Diosajj nayra maranakatpachwa , servirinakaparojj sum organizawayi .
Aka pä yatichäwinakanjja , Jehová Diosajj kunjam sarnaqañassa muni uka toqetwa yatjjataskañäni .
Ukat kunatsa markapat janipun jitheqtañasäki uksa yatjjataskarakiñäniwa .
3 ‘ Nayan manqʼajajj khitankitu ukan munañapa phoqañawa ’
16 Jehová Diosaw yanaptʼawayitu
31 ¿ Kunanakas imatäski ?
NAYRÏR JANA : Thaki lakankir mä chawlla qhatunwa yatiyaski .
Uka islanjja , 20 jila arunakaw parlasi
