21 JANA • 26 , 89 QʼOCHUNAKA
▪ ¿ Kunjamsa warminakajj Diosan amtap phoqasiñapatak yanapapjje ?
Edén huertan kunatï paskäna ukajja , ¿ kunarus chachanakampiru warminakapampiru aptʼawayi ?
Nayra pachan jakir Diosat jan jitheqtiri mä qawqha warminakasa kunsa lurapjjäna ukhamaraki jichha tiempon jakir kullakanakasa kunsa lurapjjaraki uk yatjjatam .
▪ Diosan jakkiri Arupampi yatichapjjañäni
Bibliat yateqañ munirinakaruw Diosan Reinopat yatiyirinakajj jikjjatañ munapjje .
Kunjamsa tratadonakampi yanaptʼayasisajj Bibliata jaqenakar parlañ qalltsna ukat chuymaparus purtʼaraksna uk mä qawqha uñjaskañäni .
▪ ¿ Kunjamsa Jehová Diosajj jakʼachasistu ?
Jehová Diosampejj wali sum apasiñ muntanjja .
Aka yatichäwinjja , kunjamsa Diosajj Yoqap toqe ukhamarak Biblia toqe Jupar jakʼachasiyistu ukwa yatjjataskañäni .
▪ Jehová Diosarojj kawkinkkasas istʼapjjapuniñäni
Jiwasatï cheqa thakin sarañ munstan ukhajja , Jehová Diosaruw istʼañasa .
Supayasti janiw Diosar istʼayañ munkistuti , chuymasajj ukhamarakiw Diosar istʼañat jarkʼistaspa .
Ukhamajj kunjamsa ukanakar atipasin Diosarojj istʼsna , ukat kunatsa Diosampi sum apasiñajj wali wakiskirejja ukanakwa aka yatichäwin yatjjataskañäni .
