NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA
“ Mayninakajj nacipjjewa , mayninakasti jiwapjjarakiwa , ukampis oraqejj janipuniw mayjtʼkiti . ”
( SALOMÓN REYIW NAYRA PACHA MARANAKAN UK ARSUWAYÄNA ) *
Uka arunakajja , jaqempi Oraqempejj jan pachpäpjjatapwa amuytʼayistu .
Oraqenjja , waljaniw nacipjje ukhamarak jiwapjje .
Ukampis Oraqenjja , jakañajj utjaskakïnwa .
Jichhajj ukajj mayjtʼaskarakiwa .
‘ Payïr Jachʼa Chʼajjwäwitjja , taqe kunas ratukiw pasawayjje ’ sasaw yaqhepanakajj sapjje .
Aka 70 maranakanjja , mä cheqat yaqha cheqar sarañ toqetsa , maynimp parltʼasiñ toqetsa , ciencia toqetsa kunaymaninak lurawayapjje .
Taqe ukanakajja , qollqe apnaqañ toqet mayjtʼayawayiwa . Jichhürunjja , waljaniw sum jakasjjapjje , nayrajj janiw ukham jakasiñajj utjkänti .
Ukhamarus aka Oraqen jaqenakajj jukʼampiw jiljjattawayi .
Ukampis taqe ukanak lurasajj jan waltʼäwinakajj utjarakiwa .
“ Jaqenakajj sintipuniw aka Oraq jan waltʼayapjje , ukat kunatï jakañatak wakiski ukanakjja , kuna ratus aynachtʼjjakispawa ” sasaw yaqhep jaqenakajj sapjje .
Yaqhep cientificonakajja , ‘ kunanaktï jaqenakajj aka qhepa maranakan lurawayapki , ukanakaw Oraqerojj qʼal mayjtʼayawayi ’ sasaw amuyapjjaraki .
Jaqenakaw Oraqe tʼunjapjjani sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchäna .
Uka profeciajj ¿ phoqasiskiti ?
¿ Kunapachkamas aka Oraqe tʼunjapjjani ?
Sinti jan walinak utjipanjja , ¿ janit askichañjamäjjpachäni ?
¿ Oraqejj qʼala tukjatapuniti ?
Tiempojj jan walëjjatap laykojj kuna jan waltʼäwinakas utjani uk yatiñajj chʼamäjjewa sasaw yaqhep cientificonakajj sapjje .
Maysa toqetjja , mä akatjamat Oraqen kuna mayjtʼäwis utjaspa ukajj jukʼampi jan waltʼäwinak utjayaspa sasaw llakisipjjaraki .
Amuytʼañäni , Antártida occidental sat cheqanjja , uma chhullunkhanakajj walipuniw utji .
Ukampis ‘ aka Oraqtï juntʼuptaskakini ukhajja , uka chhullunkhanakajj qʼalapuniw umatatani ’ sasaw yaqhepajj amuyapjje .
¿ Kunatsa ?
Uka chhullunkhajj mä espejor uñtataw Intin qhanap alajjpachar kutsuyi .
Ukampis chullurjjatap laykojj Intin qhanap kutsuyañat sipansa , jukʼampiw katoqe , ukhamatwa chhullunkhanakajj jukʼamp ratuki chullurjje .
Ukajj jan walipuniwa , ukham chullurjjatap laykojja , jukʼampiw umajj qotanakan jiljjattaspa , walja jaqenakarurakiw jan walin uñjasiyaspa .
‘ Oraqer yanaptʼañatakejj ’ mä qawqha yanaptʼanak amtawayapjje .
Maynïristi desarrollo sostenible satawa , ukarjamajj qollqe toqet jiltaskakiñataki , ukhamarak taqenin sum jakasipjjañapatakejj samanaru , oraqeru ni umaru jan mayjtʼayasaw ukanak lurasiñapa .
Ukampis uka amtanakajj ¿ phoqasiwayiti ?
Maysa toqetjja , jaqenakajj kunatï Oraqen utjki ukanakjja , qʼal tukuntaski , janiw Oraq pachpajj waliptirjamäjjeti .

¿ Kunas yanaptʼañatakejj lurasispa ?
Ecología toqet mä yatjjattʼat jaqejj akham sänwa : “ Kunjamsa aka Oraqejj sum apnaqasispa uk janiw yatipkti ” sasa .
Biblianjja , ukhamarakwa qhanañchi . Ukan akham siwa : ‘ Jaqejj janirakiw sarnaqäwipsa sum apnaqkaspati ’ sasa ( Jeremías 10 : 23 ) .
Jaqenakajj aka Oraqjja qʼal tukjaski , ukampis Diosajj janiw ukhamak uñchʼukkaniti sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Salmo 115 : 16 qellqatanjja , “ jaqerusti oraq katuyi ” sasaw qhanañchi .
Cheqas aka Oraqejj Diosan mä regalopawa .
Ukhamajja , Oraqejj luraskäna ¿ ukhakit suma jakasiñajj utjpachäna ?
Janiwa .
Oraqpachajj kunja suma lurtʼatasa uk uñjasaw sum amuyastanjja .
Kunjamsa Diosajj wal chʼamachasisa aka Oraqe luräna ukjja Génesis qellqata sum qhanañchi .
Akham siwa : “ Aka oraqesti [ qalltan ] jan kunani chʼusakïnwa , taqe kunas mä chʼamakan phoqhantata umakamakirakïnwa ” sasa .
Cheqas umajj jakañatakejj wali wakiskiriwa ( Génesis 1 : 2 ) .
Ukatsti “ qhanajj utjpan ” sasaw Diosajj sarakïna ( Génesis 1 : 3 ) .
Amuyatajj Intin qhanapajja , atmósfera siski uka toqe mantasaw Oraqen qhantʼañ qalltpachäna .
Ukjjarusti , waña oraqempi qotanakampiw uñstäna sasaw Bibliajj qhanañcharaki ( Génesis 1 : 9 , 10 ) .
Ukatsti , “ Oraqenjja kunayman casta alinakaw achüna .
Jathanak churir chʼojjñanaka , ukhamarak frutanak achuri qoqanaka ” ( Génesis 1 : 12 ) . Ukhatpachwa kunatï jakañatak wakiski taqe ukanakajj qalltjjäna .
¿ Kunatsa Diosajj ukham wal chʼamachaspachäna ?
Isaías profetajj Diosat akham sänwa : ‘ Aka oraqe lurki saytʼaykaraki , khititejj uchki jan chʼusäñapataki , jan ukasti jaqenïñapatakiw luri ’ sasa ( Isaías 45 : 18 ) .
Kunjamtï amuyktanjja , Diosajj wiñayataki jaqenakajj aka Oraqen jakasipjjañapwa muni .
Ukampis jaqenakajja , Diosan aka suma regalop janiw sum apnaqapkiti , niyaw qʼal tukjasipki .
Ukhamarus Diosan amtapajj janiw mayjtʼkiti .
Nayra tiempon mä qellqerejj akham sänwa : “ Janiw Diosajj jiwir jaqenakjamäkiti .
Janiw kʼariskiti ni yaqha amuyunïkisa .
Kunapachatejj jupajj kunsa arsu ukkhajj lurapuniwa ” sasa ( Números 23 : 19 ) .
Diosajj janiw aka Oraqjja jaqenakan tʼunjapjjañap ukhamak jaytkaniti , antisas ‘ aka oraqe tʼunjirinakarojja , tʼunjaniwa ’ .
Wali Uñtʼat Arstʼäwipanjja , Jesusajj akham sänwa : ‘ Kusisiñanïpjjew llampʼu chuymaninakajja , jupanakaw oraqe katoqapjjani ’ sasa .
Pachpa arstʼäwinjja , kuna toqnamsa Oraqe askichani uk Jesusajj sum qhanañchäna .
Arkirinakaparojj akham mayisipjjañap yatichäna : “ [ Reinomampisti ] apnaqapjjeta .
Munañamasti luratäpan akapachanjja , kunjämatï alajjpachana luratäki ukhama ” sasa .
Ukhamajj Diosan Reinopakiw taqe kuntï Diosajj aka Oraqetak amtkäna ukanak phoqani .
Diosan Reinopaw aka Oraqen walja askinak apanini .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Uñjam , nayajj taqe kunwa machaqat lur [ ä ] ” sasa .
Ukhamajj ¿ aka Oraq lantejj yaqha Oraqti Diosajj lurani ? Janiwa .
Cheqas janiw Oraqejj juchanïkiti , antisas jichhürunakan utjki uka gobiernonakaw ‘ oraqe tʼunjasipki ’ , jupanakarakiw kuna jan waltʼäwintï jakastan ukanakat juchanïpjje .
Diosajj jupanakarojj tukjaniwa sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi , ukat Diosan Reinopaw apnaqjjani , ukajj ‘ machaq alajjpachawa ’ , ukasti mä ‘ machaq oraqeruw ’ apnaqjjani , mä arunjja , suma istʼasir jaqenakaru .
Kuna jan walinaktï jaqenakajj Oraqeru lurawayapki uk tukjañatakejja , Diosajj kunatï aka Oraqen utjki ukanak askichaniwa .
Kunjamsa uk lurani uka toqetjja , Salmo qellqerejj akham siwa : “ Jumaw akapach oraq uñjasktajja ” sasa .
Ukhamajj jallusa , lupisa sumäjjani ukat jukʼampis Diosan bendicionap katoqañäni ukhajja , aka Oraqejj mä paraisöjjaniwa , manqʼañanakasa walirakiw utjani ( Salmo 65 : 9 - 13 ) .
Pyarelal Nayyar sat chachajja , hinduísmo religionan pʼeqtʼirin Mohandas Gandhi chachan secretariopanwa , jupajj aka arunakwa jefepat amtasïna : “ Oraqenjja , kuntï jaqenakajj jakañatak wakiski ukanak churañatakejj utjiwa , ukampis jupanakatakik taqe kuns muniri jaqenakatakejj janiw utjkiti ” sasa .
Diosan Reinopajja , kunatï Oraqen jan waltʼäwinak utjayki ukwa nayraqat chhaqtayani .
Ukatakejj jaqenakan amtapwa mayjtʼayani .
Diosan Reinop apnaqjjani ukhajja , jaqenakajj janiw jaqe masiparus ni Oraqerus jan walinak lurkaniti sasaw Isaías profetajj arsüna ( Isaías 11 : 9 ) .
Jichhürunakanjja , millón millón taqe kasta jaqenakaw Diosan kamachinakap yateqasipki .
Diosaru , jaqe masiparu munasiña , yuspärasirïña , kunanaktï aka Oraqen utjki ukanak sum uñjaña ukat kunjamtï Diosajj munki ukarjam jakasiñ yateqasipki .
Jupanakajj aka Oraqen mä paraison jakasiñatakiw wakichtʼasisipki ( Eclesiastés 12 : 13 ; Mateo 22 : 37 - 39 ; Colosenses 3 : 15 ) .
Oraqejj wali sumapuniwa , janiw tukjaskaspati
Taqe kun luratäjjana ukhajja , Bibliajj akham qhanañchi : “ Diosasti taqe kuntejj lurkän ukanakan sumätapwa uñjäna ” sasa ( Génesis 1 : 31 ) .
Aka suma Oraqejj janiw tʼunjaskaniti .
Kunay aka Oraqempejj paschini ukajj khuyapayasiri Jehová Diosan amparapankiwa .
Ukhamarus Jupajj akham sarakistuwa : “ Aski jaqenakajj oraq katoqapjjani , wiñayatakiw ukan jakapjjarakini ” sasa ( Salmo 37 : 29 ) .
Ukhamajj aka Oraqenjja , aski jaqenakaw jakasipjjani , ¿ jumajj uka taypinkarakïtati ?
Uka arunakajj Bibliat apstʼatawa , Eclesiastés 1 : 4 qellqatata .
Atmósfera .
“ Kuntï atmósfera manqhäjjapan utjki ukasa qotanakasa ukat oraqesa wal juntʼuptaskatapaw yatisi [ . . . ] . 1950 maratjja , kuntï jaqenakajj lurapki ukaw jukʼamp [ Oraqerojj ] aynachtʼayi . ”
( Sociedad Meteorológica Americana , 2012 )
Oraqe .
“ Oraqejj niya chikatpachaw jaqenakan mayjtʼayat uñjasiwayi , ukatwa animalanakas , alinakas , ukhamarak kunanakatï jakañatak wakiski ukanakas jan waltʼjjeti , [ . . . ] ukatarakwa tiempos mayjäjjejja . ”
( Global Change and the Earth System )
Qotanaka .
‘ Oraqpachan utjki uka qotanakatjja , niya taqe cheqatwa chawllanak wal apsjjapjje , mä qawqha kasta chawllanakajja , janiw utjjeti jan ukajj wasitat utjañapatakiw chʼamachasisipki . ’
( BBC , septiembre de 2012 )
Taqe kunatï Oraqen utji ukanaka .
‘ Kunanaktï jutïrin chhaqtkäni ukanakatjja , [ . . . ] jaqenakaw juchanïpjjani ’ sasa walja cientificonakajj amuyapjje ( science.nationalgeographic.com sat cheqat Internetat apstʼatawa )
Oraqenakwa jaqenakasa , animalanakasa ukat qoqanakasa jakapjjaspa .


Uk sum amuytʼañatakejja , chʼojjña alinakata Intita ukat samanat parltʼañäni .
Chʼojjña alinakajja , qʼañu samansa ( dióxido de carbono ) , umsa ukat mineralanaksa , lupin yanaptʼapampiw qʼoma samanaru ukat manqʼañanakaru tukuyapjje .
Ukhamatwa jaqenakas animalanakas manqʼsa ukat qʼoma samansa katoqapjje , ukhamat qʼañu samana samsjjañataki .
Ukham jakañataki munaski ukajja , kutin kutiniw utjaraki .
Cheqas ukhamatwa aka Oraqen jakañajj utjaskakispa .
Ukatwa Bibliajj Diosat akham sispacha : “ Amuytʼapampirakiw aka oraqsa saytʼayi ” sasa ( Jeremías 10 : 12 ) .
Biblia toqet yatjjatat mä chachajj akham sänwa : “ Aka Oraqen kawkhantï jakañjamäki ukajja , jaqen kusisiñapataki ukat ukan trabajiñapatak suma lurtʼatawa ” sasa .
“ JAQERUW jiwayatayna ” sasaw mä kutejj pä chachanakar mä markan tumpantapjjäna , tribunalajj jiwapjjañapatakiw uka chachanakar juchañchäna .
Juicionjja , cheqapunit juchanipjjäna janicha uk janiw sum qhanañchaskänti .
Abogadonakajj uka juicion pantjasipjjatap yatisajja , wal chʼamachasisaw maynïr qhespiyapjjäna .
Ukampis maynirojj janiw khitis qhespiykaspänti , kunattejj jiwayatäjjänwa .
Ukham pantjasiñjja , kawkïr markans utjakispawa .
Ukatwa kunatï “ cheqa [ ki ] ” ukarjamaw luräta sasin Bibliajj akham ewjjtʼi ( Deuteronomio 16 : 20 ) .
Juezanakajj cheqaparjam kuns lurapjje ukhajja , taqeniw sum jikjjatastanjja .
Israel markarojj jan khitir yaqhachasiñapataki ukat cheqaparjam kuns lurañatakejja , Diosajj mä Ley churäna .
Ukhamajj Diosan ‘ leyinakapajj cheqaparjamati ’ janicha , uk jichhajj yatjjatañäni ( Deuteronomio 32 : 4 ) .
Juezanakatï cheqaparjam kuns lurapjje , qollqemp jan chilltayasipjje ukhajja , taqenitakis wali askiwa .
Diosan Leyipajj ukham juezanakarojj wali askitwa uñjäna .
Israel markajj Egiptot mistjjäna uka qhepatjja , Moisesarojj akham ewjjtʼasïna : “ Ajllim suma amuytʼan chachanaka , [ . . . ]
Diosaru ajjsartirinakañapawa , ukhamarak qhana luririnaka , janiwa jupatakiki kunsa thaqherïñapäkiti ” sasa ( Éxodo 18 : 21 , 22 ) .
Ukat 40 maranak qhepatjja , Moisesajj akham saskakïnwa : juezäpjjañapatakejj ‘ sum amuytʼasiri , yatiñäni ukat experienciani jaqenak thaqhapjjäta ’ sasa ( Deuteronomio 1 : 13 - 17 ) .
Walja maranak qhepatjja , Judá marka apnaqeri Jehosafat * chachajja akham sasaw juezanakar ewjjtʼäna : ‘ Sum amuyasipjjam , janiw jaqenakatak juzgapktati , jan ukasti Diosatakiw juzgaptajja , Jupaw jumanakampïskani .
Tatitur ajjsarapjjam , ukhamarak sum amuyasipjjarakim kuntï lurapkäta ukanakanjja , jiwasan Diosasasti janiw aleqaki uñjkaniti jan cheqapar luratjja , mä qawqhaniruki uñjatarusa , ni qollqe chilltañanaksa ’ sasa ( 2 Crónicas 19 : 6 , 7 ) .
‘ Qollqempitï chilltayasipjjäta jan ukajj yaqhachapjjätajja , kuna jan walitsa Diosaw juchañchapjjätam ’ sasaw reyejj juezanakar amtayaskäna .
Juezanakajj ukarjam lurapjjäna ukhajja , taqeniw sum jikjjatasipjjäna .
Ukampis Diosajj janiw ukham arunakampik ewjjtʼkänti , jan ukasti , cheqaparjam kuns lurapjjañapatakejj walja aski yatichäwinak churäna .
Ukanakat mä qawqha uñjañäni .
Juezanakajja , sum amuytʼasiri , ukat yatiñani jaqenakapjjañapäkchinsa , janiw amuyuparjamaki ni yatiñaparjamakis juzgapjjañapäkänti . Jupanakar yanaptʼañatakejj Jehová Diosajj aski yatichäwinak churäna .
Sañäni :
Taqe kun sum yatjjataña .
Jehová Diosajj akhamwa Moisés toqnam juezanakar ewjjtʼäna : “ Sapaqat mayniruraki suma cheqa kankañampi uñjapjjam ” sasa ( Deuteronomio 1 : 16 ) .
Mä juezajj taqe kun sum yatjjatasakiw cheqaparjam kuns amtaspa .
Ukatwa Diosajj juicio sarayirinakarojj sum yatjjatapjjañapatak ewjjtʼäna .
Juicio janïr qalltkasajja , kunanakattï maynïr juchañchaski ukajj cheqapunïskiti janicha uk juezanakajj sum yatjjatapjjañapäna ( Deuteronomio 13 : 14 ; 17 : 4 ) .
Testigonakar istʼaña .
Sum yatjjatañatakejja , testigonakar istʼañajj wali wakiskirïnwa .
Leyejj akham säna : “ Mä sapa testigon mayni jucha lurir jaqeru qhanañchatapajja janiw askïkiti , kunapachatejj pani jan ukajj kimsa testigonaka qhanañchapjjani ukaw walïnejja ” sasa ( Deuteronomio 19 : 15 ) .
Testigonakarusti Diosan Leyipajj akham ewjjtʼarakïna : “ Jan kʼari arunakjja parlamti , janirak kʼari arunak parliri jaqerus arjjatasin yanaptʼamti ” sasa ( Éxodo 23 : 1 ) .
Sum yatjjatas juzgaña .
Testigonakatak utjkäna uka Leyjja , kʼarinak jan parlapjjañatakiw yanaptʼäna .
Leyejj akham säna : “ Juesanakasti [ . . . ] suma amuyumpiw ukanakjjatjja [ yatjjatapjjani ] , ukattï uka kʼari testigon arsutanakapajj jilap contra jan cheqäkani ukapachajj , pachpa arsüwimpiw juparojj tʼaqhesiyani , kunjämtejj jupajj maynitaki munkän ukhama ” sasa ( Deuteronomio 19 : 18 , 19 ) .
Amuytʼañataki , mä chachatï maynin herenciapa katusiñ layku kʼarinak parlaspänjja , uka herenciajj qawqhakantï ukjpach churañapäna .
Ukat jan juchanir jiwayapjjañapataki kʼarisispän ukhajja , jupaw jiwañapäna .
Uka leyejja , kunatï cheqäki uk parlapjjañapatakiw jaqenakarojj yanaptʼäna .
Jan yaqhachas juzgaña .
Taqe kun sum yatisjjäna ukhajja , ukarjamaw juezanakajj sum amuytʼas mä amtar puripjjañapäna .
Ukatakejj Diosan Leyipajj akham ewjjtʼäna : “ Janiraki pisi chʼamanirusa arjjatamti ni munañanina nayraqataparusa altʼasimti .
Kunapachatejj mä queja uñjkäta ukapachasti kunatejj cheqapäki ukaru jaysasa luram ” sasa ( Levítico 19 : 15 ) .
Juezanakajj luratanakarjamaw juzgapjjañapäna , janiw uñnaqaki ni qollqeniti janicha ukanak uñjasaki juzgapjjañapäkänti .
Uka Leyinakajj nayra tiempons Israel markar churaschïnjja , jichhürunakan utjki uka tribunalanakan yanaptʼarakispawa .
Ukarjam lurapjjaspajja , janiw utjkaspati jan cheqaparjam uñjat juchañchäwinaka ni ina chʼusa juicionakasa .
Diosan Leyinakaparjam lurapjjaspa ukhajja , janiw pantjat juchañchäwinak utjkaspati
Moisesajj akhamwa israelitanakar jisktʼäna : “ ¿ Kawkïri jachʼa markaraki utji leyinakapasa , arsutanakapas cheqa , kunjamtï nayajj aka yatichäwinak jumanakar churapjjsma ukhamajja ? ” ( Deuteronomio 4 : 8 ) .
Janiw yaqha markajj juicionak toqeta suma leyinakanïpkänti .
Salomón reyit amtañäni , waynäkäna ukhajja , Diosan leyinakaparjam sarnaqañatakiw chʼamachasïna . Israelitanakasti jan ajjsarasaw sum jakasipjjäna ; taqeniw ‘ manqʼasipjjäna , umapjjäna ukat kusisipjjarakïna ’ ( 1 Reyes 4 : 20 , 25 ) .
Ukampis israelitanakajj janiw Diosar istʼjjapjjänti .
Jeremías profeta toqnamjja , Diosajj akham säna : “ ¿ Kawkinkaraki yatiñapasti niyaki arunakapajj apanukupjjchi ukapachasti ? ”
sasa ( Jeremías 8 : 9 ) . Jerusalén markajj “ jaqe jiwayiri ” markäjjänwa , ukat ‘ ajjtaskañ luräwinakampiw ’ phoqantatäjjäna .
Qhepatjja , tʼunjatäjjänwa , 70 maranakarakiw apanukuta uñjasïna ( Ezequiel 22 : 2 ; Jeremías 25 : 11 ) .
Israel markan sinti jan walinak utjkäna ukhaw Isaías profetajj jakäna .
Nayra maranakat amtasisajja , Jehová Diosata ukat Leyinakapat akham säna : “ Kunapachatejj jumajj taqe aka oraqpachar uñjkäta ukkhajj , jaqenakajj yateqapjjaniwa kunatejj cheqapäki ukjja ” sasa ( Isaías 26 : 9 ) .
Jesucristojj kunjamsa jutïrin apnaqjjani uka toqetjja , Isaías profetajj akhamwa säna : “ Jupajj janiw aleq uñkatasaki kunsa uñjkaniti , chʼajjwanaksa janirakiw aleqa parlanak istʼasaki tʼaqjkaniti .
Aynachtʼatanakarusti cheqa luräwimpiw uñjani ” sasa ( Isaías 11 : 3 , 4 ) .
Khitinakatï Diosan Reinopan Jesucristomp apnaqatäpkani ukanakajja , wali kusisitaw jakasipjjani .
Jehosafat sutejj “ Jehová Diosaw Juezajja ” sañ muni .
“ Nayratjja nayraraki , lakatjja lakaraki ” sasin Bibliajj qhanañkchi uka arunakjja , waljaniw mayj mayja amuyapjje ( Éxodo 21 : 24 ) .
‘ Phoqsusiñajj Diosatakejj walikiwa ’ sasaw yaqhep jaqejj amuyapjje .
Ukampis Diosajj akhamwa sarakïna : “ Janipuni kuna luratasa phoqsusirakimti , janiraki jupa toqesa colerasiñamjja chuymamaru imjjäsimti ” sasa ( Levítico 19 : 18 ) .
Ukhamajj nayrat nayra siski uka arunakajj ¿ kamsañs munpacha ?
Éxodo 21 : 22 qellqatajj pä chachan nuwasïwipatwa parlaski , maynïrejja , mä usur warmir nuwantasaw parto usu katuyi .
Warmisa wawasa jakasipkakispänjja , warmin chachapajj janiw phoqsusiñapäkänti .
Antisas “ nuwatatir jaqejja multa pagañap [ äna ] , uka warmin chachapajj qawqhtejj mayki juesanak nayraqatanjja ukhamarjama ” .
Amuytʼañataki , juezanakaw warmin chachaparojj multa pagayapjjañapäna .
Ukampis warmitï jan ukajj wawatï jiwaspänjja , juezanakajj uka jaqerojj jiwañapatakiw juchañchapjjañapäna .
Ukhaman uñjasisajja , tribunalaw “ jakañatjja jakañaraki , nayratjja nayraraki , lakatjja lakaraki ” siski uka arunakarjam uñjapjjañapäna , janiw jan walin uñjasirejj uka arunak phoqayañapäkänti ( Éxodo 21 : 23 , 24 ) .
Uka leyirjamajja , juchañchañatakejj juezanakajj janiw jilachjapjjañapäkänti ni menostʼayapjjañapäkänsa .
Biblia toqet yatjjatat Richard Elliott Friedman chachajj akham sänwa : ‘ Amuyatajja , luratarjamaw juchañchasiñapäna , janiw jilañchjasiñapäkänti ’ sasa .
Ukhamajj ¿ kunatsa Diosan Leyiparjamajj phoqsusiñajj walikïskiwa sasin amuyapjjpacha ?
Mateo 5 : 38 , 39 qellqatan akhamwa Jesusajj säna : “ [ ‘ Istʼapjjtawa nayra jaqenakaru satäkänsa ukjja : Nayratjja nayra , lakachʼakhatjja lakachʼakha ’ , ( MT ) ] .
Ukampis nayajj sapjjsmawa : Jan jumanakajj jan wali jaqerojj kutkatapjjamti , jan ukasti maynitejj maysa ajanut tʼajjllintätamjja , maysa ajanumppacha uñachtʼayarakim ” sasa .
Nayrat nayra ( ley del talión ) siski uka leyejja , amuyatajja , Jesusajj aka Oraqenkkäna ukhaw religionanakan pʼeqtʼirinakapat mä qawqhanejj aleq arsut leyinakapamp chik yatichjjapjjäna .
Ukhamatwa phoqsusiñajj walikïtap amuyayapjjäna .
Ukampis uka amuyunakajj janiw israelitanakar Diosajj churkän uka Leyinakarjamäkiti sasaw Jesusajj qhanañchäna .
SARNAQÄWI
Peter Carrbello sat jilatan arsutaparjama
Jiskʼatpachaw yaqhachat uñjasirïta .
Ukat ajjsariri janis kunatak askïkirista ukham amuyasirïta .
‘ Bibliaw chuymachitani , ukhamajj yatichayasiñatakejj católica iglesiaruw sarä ’ sasin sarta .
Ukampis janiw yanaptʼapkitänti , ukatwa deportenak toqet chʼamachasiñataki amtawayta .
Cuerpojan jukʼamp chʼamanïñatakejja , ejercicionak lurañatak wal chʼamachasiyäta .
Tiempompejj mä gimnasio San Leandro ( California , Estados Unidos ) markan jistʼarta .
Waljanimpiw trabajayäta , maynïrejja , ‘ míster America ’ premio katoqawayäna .
Ukampis taqe ukanak lurasajj janiw kusisitäkayätti .
Biblia toqet sum amuyañ munataj gimnasionkir mä amigojj sum yatïna , ukhamajj mä amigopamp parltʼañatakiw chʼamañchitäna .
Qhepürojja , Jehová Diosan mä Qhanañchiripaw utajar purïna , pusi horaw jisktʼanakajar Bibliampi qhanañchitu .
‘ Jaypʼur kuttʼanim ’ sasaw sista , ukat chika arumkamaw parlapjjta .
Kuntï istʼaskayäta ukajj wal kusisiyitäna , ukhamajj kunjamsa Bibliat jaqenakar parlta uk uñjañatak qharur ¿ jumamp sariristti ?
sasaw jisktʼta .
Kunjamsa jaqenakan jisktʼanakap Bibliamp qhanañchäna ukajj wal muspharayitäna . Ukhamasti , nayajj uka pachpa lurañ munjjarakiyäta .
Gimnasio aljasajj uka precursor jilatampiw yatiyir sarjjayäta , Diosatak sapürunjam irnaqañatak chʼamachasipki ukanakaruw Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapajj ukham sapjje . 1948 maranwa Cow Palace de San Francisco ( California ) sat estadion mayo phajjsin bautisasta .
Mä maratjja , precursorajjarakiyätwa .
Ukat mamajar visittʼapjjañapatakiw jupanakar mayirakiyäta .
Mamajajj sum katoqäna , qhepatjja , bautisasjjarakïnwa .
Familiapatakejj ukajj janiw askïkänti , ukampis mamajajj jiwañapkamaw Diosar serviwayi , jiwatapat janiw walja tiempo paskiti .
Mamajampikiw Jehová Diosan Qhanañchiripapjjayäta .
Khä 1950 maranjja , Grand Junction ( Colorado ) markaruw sarawayjjta , ukanwa Billieru uñtʼawayta .
Jupajj 1928 maranwa nacitayna , qollqet pistʼañajj utjkäna ukhaw jilsutayna .
Sapa arumaw kerosen lamparampi Minnie mamapajj Biblia liyirapirïna .
Pusi maranirojj liytʼasirëjjanwa , Biblian utjki uka sarnaqäwinaksa sum yatjjarakïna .
Mamapajj niya 1948 tukuya maranakanwa Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapampi Bibliat yatjjatañ qalltäna . Infiernojj jan mä tʼaqhesiñ cheqätapa jan ukajj kawkhantï jiwatanakajj imatäpki uka cheqätap yateqäna ( Eclesiastés 9 : 5 , 10 ) .
Qhepatjja , awk taykapas Jehová Diosan Qhanañchiripäjjapjjänwa .
Boston markankir universidadaruw Billiejj saräna , ukampis 1949 maranwa utapar kutʼjjäna ukat Bibliat yatjjatañ qalltjjarakïna .
Profesorjam trabajañat sipansa , Diosar serviñwa amtäna .
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapan 1950 maran walja markanakat jachʼa tantachäwi Estadio de los Yankees Nueva York markan lurapkäna , ukanwa Billiejj bautisasïna .
Uka qhepatwa uñtʼasipjjta , casarasipjjta , ukat Jehová Diosar sapürunjan serviñ qalltapjjta .
Oregón markaruw puripjjta .
Eugene sat markanwa yatiyañ qalltapjjta , ukanjja walja amigonak uñtʼawayapjjta . 1953 maranwa Grants Pass cheqar sarjjapjjta , ukanjja mä jiskʼa tamaruw yanaptʼapjjta .
Uka mararakiw Escuela de Galaad ukar ( clase 23 ) sarapjjañajatak invittʼapjjetäna , uka escuelanjja , Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapajj misioneronakwa wakichapjje , ukasti South Lansing cheqan jikjjatasïna , Nueva York markat 400 kilometronak Inti jalanta alay toqenkänwa .
Phesqa phajjsina Escuela de Galaad tukuyasajja , 1954 maran diciembre phajjsin Brasil markaruw sarapjjañajjäna .
Ukatakejj pä motoran avionaruw makatapjjta .
Mä hora viajkasajj mä motorapaw saytʼjjäna , ukhamajj Bermudas ukat Cuba markanakaruw saytʼapjjta , 36 horanak qhepatwa Río de Janeiro ( Brasil ) markaru Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapan sucursalapar puripjjta .
Bauru markan nayrïr tantachasiñ uta ( 1955 mara ) .
Alquilat utakïnwa , letrerjja nayaw pintawayta
Ukan mä qawqha urunak qheparasajja , Billiempi ukat pä misionerampejj Bauru ( São Paulo ) markar misioneronakatak mä uta wakichiriw sarapjjta .
Ukan 50.000 jila jaqenakas utjkchïnjja , nanakakiw Jehová Diosan Qhanañchiripapjjayäta .
Jaqenakar visittʼiriw sarapjjta , ukampis tatakurajj nanakatakejj wal coleräna ; ‘ jan jupanakar istʼapjjamti ’ sasaw nanakar arkasajj jaqenakar sirïna .
Mä jachʼa familiaruw Bibliat yatichañ qalltapjjta , mä qawqha semanatjja Diosar serviñwa amtjjapjjäna , ukat bautisasipjjarakïnwa .
Waljaniw nanakampi Bibliat yatjjatañ qalltapjjäna .
Uka familian mä familiarapajja , wali uñtʼat grupon sarayiripänwa .
Jupampejja , kawkhantï grupojj tantachasirïkän ukan mä jachʼa tantachäwi lurañ amtapjjta .
Tatakurajj contrato jan phoqasiñapatak wal chʼamachasïna .
Grupo sarayiristi masinakapar tantachthapisajj akham säna : “ Jan phoqapjjätajja , nayajj sarjjawa ” sasa .
Jachʼa tantachäwejj apasipunïnwa .
Ukat 1956 maranjja , Santos ( São Paulo ) markaruw kimsa uru jachʼa tantachäwir 40 jilat kullakanakampi trenat sarapjjta .
Bauru markar kuttʼasajja , mä carta jikjjatta , ukanjja , tamanak tumptʼirjama Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakan tamanakap visittʼañataki khitapjjetäna .
Niya 25 maranak ukham servisajj Brasil markjja , taqpach uñtʼawayta .
Mä maranakwa walja yatiyir jilat kullakanakajj Bauru markan utj - jjäna
Uka tiempon viajañajj wali chʼamänwa , cheqas autota , trenata , carretata , bicicletata ukat kayuki viajapjjerïta .
Jaú ( São Paulo ) markar visittʼañ qalltapjjta .
Ukan tatakurajj akham sapjjetäna :
“ ¡ Janiw uwijanakajar yatiyapjjañamäkiti ! ”
sasa .
“ Janiw jumankkiti , Diosankiwa ” sasaw nanakajj sapjjta .
Kunjamsa oraqpachan yatiytan uka toqet yatiyañatakejj La Sociedad del Nuevo Mundo en acción sat video uñachtʼayañatak amtapjjta .
Ukampis tatakurajj arkirinakapampiw nuwasiñatak jutapjjäna .
Uk yatisajj jankʼakiw policiar jawsapjjta .
Tatakurampi arkirinakapampi teatror purinipjjäna ukhajja , walja policianakaw jupanak contra armanakas aytʼata suyantasipkäna .
Jaqenakatakejj uka videojj wali sumapunïnwa .
Kawkharutï sarapkayäta ukanakanjja , Religión toqet uñisiñajj utjapunïnwa .
Blumenau ( Santa Catarina ) marka jakʼanjja , Brusque sat markaw utjäna , ukan pä precursor kullakanakaruw uñtʼapjjta , uka cheqanjja , jupanakajj wal tʼaqhesiwayapjje .
Ukampis chʼamachasitapajj janiw inamayäkänti .
Jichhajj 50 maranak qhepatjja , 60 jila tamanakaw uka cheqan utj - jje , ukhamarak Itajaí markanjja , Jachʼa Tantachäwinak apañatak mä suma utapas utjarakiwa .
Tamanakar visitʼkasajja , jilatanakampi jachʼa tantachäwinak wakichañaw wali askïnjja . 1975 maran Morumbi markan estadiopanjja , jachʼa tantachäwin sarayiripäyätwa .
Janïr jachʼa tantachäwi apaskipanjja , qʼomachañatakejj uka jakʼankir 100 tamanakaruw sapa tamat tunkanir khitanipjjañapatak mayipjjäyäta .
Uka arumajj pelot anatirinakajj akham sasaw estadiot mistusajj sawkasipjjäna : “ Uñtapjjam khä warminakaru escobitanakapampi ” sasa .
Ukhampachas chika arumkamaw ‘ escobitanakampi ’ taqpach estadio qʼomachapjjta .
Estadio sarayirejj akham sänwa : “ Kuntï jumanakajj mä qawqha horanak lurapkta ukjja , nanakajj mä semananwa lurapjjeriskayätjja ” sasa .
Tatajajj 1980 maranwa jiwjjäna , mä qawqha tiempotjja mamajar uñjiriw Fremont ( California ) sat markar kuttʼapjjta .
Precursoraskakiñataki ukat portugués aru parlirinakar yanaptʼañatakejja , arumanakan edificionak pichañatak mä trabajo jikjjatapjjta .
Qhepatjja , San Joaquin sat valleruw sarjjapjjta , ukasti Fremont markat janiw jayankkiti .
Ukanjja , portugués aru parlirinakarurakiw thaqhapjjayäta . Ukampis jichhajj Sacramento cheqat Bakersfield cheqakam puriñäki ukanakanwa yatiyapjjta .
Jichhürunjja , California markan 10 tamanakaw portugués arut utj - jje .
Mamajan jiwatapatjja , 1995 maran Florida markaruw esposajan tatapar uñjir sarjjapjjta .
Esposajan mamapajj 1975 maranwa jiwjjäna .
Ukat 2000 maransti Colorado markan jikjjataski uka wasar qollunakaruw sarjjapjjta , ukajj Inti jalanta aynach toqenkiwa .
Ukanwa navajo jaqenakaru utes jaqenakar Biblia toqet parlawayapjjta .
Billie esposajajj febrero phajjsin 2014 maran jiwawayi .
Jehová Diosan mä Qhanañchiripajj jisktʼanakajar Bibliampi qhanañchatapat 65 jila maranakaw pasawayjje .
Jupar istʼatajata ukat kuntï siskitän ukajj cheqati janicha uk yatjjatatajat ¡ wali kusisitaw jikjjatasta !
Ukatwa Diosar serviwayta . Ukajj wali sumapuniwa .
Khä 1892 maranjja , Agnes Smith Lewis ukat Margaret Dunlop Gibson ispa kullakanakajja , Santa Catalina sat monasterior puriñatakejj camellotwa wasar pampnam sarapjjäna , ukasti Sinaí sat qollu aynachäjjankiwa .
Llätunka urunakaw viajapjjäna .
Jupanakajj niya 50 maranïpjjänwa , uka wasar pampanjam viajañajj nayra tiempon wali chʼamänwa . ¿ Kunatsa ukakam sarapjjpachäna ?
Uka toqet sum yatjjatasajja , Bibliar jukʼamp confiyañatakiw yanaptʼätam .
Agnes Smith Lewis sat warmimpi Santa Catalina sat monasteriompi
JANÏR alajjpachar makatkasajja , Jesusajj arkirinakaparojj akham ewjjtʼäna : “ Nayat qhanañchapjjetäta Jerusalén markana , Judeana , Samariana , taqe aka oraqpachana ” sasa .
Uka arunakarjamaw Jesusan arkirinakapajj jan ajjsarasa phoqapjjäna .
Ukampis Jerusalén markanjja , arknaqataw uñjasipjjäna , ukat Esteban sat mä chacharojj jiwayapjjänwa .
Ukhaman jan uñjasiñatakejja , waljanejj Antioquía ( Siria ) markaruw sarjjapjjäna , ukajj Roma Imperion mä jachʼa markänwa , Jerusalén markat 550 kilometronak alay toqenkänwa .
Antioquía markanjja , cristianonakajj Jesusjjat parlasipkakïnwa , jan judiöpkän ukanakat waljaniw Jesusar iyawsjjapjjäna .
Uka markan griego arsa parlaschïnjja , Siria markpachanjja , jaqenakajj siríaco aruw parlapjjäna .
Siríaco aru parlir cristianonakajj khä 100 maranakan waljäjjänwa . Ukhamajj qellqatanakajj uka arur jaqokipasiñap wakisïna .
Amuyatajj Griego Arut Qollan Qellqatanakat mä qawqhajja , janiw latín arur nayraqat jaqokipaskänti , jan ukasti siríaco aruruw jaqokipasïna .
Taciano qellqerejj 170 mara jakʼanakajja , ( niya 120 - 173 ) Mateo , Marcos , Lucas ukat Juan ( pusi Evangelionaka ) Diosan amuytʼayata qellqatanakjja , mayarukiw apthapïna .
Uka qellqatarojj Diatesarón sasin uñtʼasi , ukasti griego arut jaqokipatajj ‘ pusi Evangelionak layku ’ sañ muni .
Ukat inas griego jan ukajj siríaco arut qellqatächïna . 300 maranjja , Efrén ( niya 310 - 373 ) sat sirio chachajj Diatesarón qellqatat qhanañcharakïnwa , ukhamajj uka qellqatajj Siria markan cristianonak taypin suma uñtʼatäjjanwa .
Diatesarón sat qellqatajja , jichhürunakatak wali wakiskiriwa .
Khä 1800 maranakan Biblia toqet yatjjatatanakajj ( biblistas ) akham amuyapjjäna : ‘ Niyakejjay Evangelionakajj niya 130 marat 170 maranakan qellqaskchejja , ukanakajj janiw cheqakpachäti ’ sasa .
Kunattejj Jesusan jiwatapat walja maranak qhepatwa Evangelionakajj qellqasïna . Ukampis uka maranakan Mateo , Marcos , Lucas ukat Juan libronakajj sum uñtʼasjjatapwa Diatesarón qellqatanakajj qhanañchawayi .
Ukhamajj uka qellqatajj jukʼamp nayraw qellqaspachäna .
Maysa toqetjja , evangelios apócrifos qellqatanakajj jan cheqätapwa Diatesarón qellqatajj qhanañcharaki , kunattejj Taciano chachajj pusi Evangelionakatwa Diatesarón qellqat lurawayäna .
Bibliat qellqatanaka utjki ukanakatjja , Peshitta siríaca ( Biblian nayrïr phesqa libronakapa ) qellqataw taqet sipans jukʼamp nayrajja ( 464 ) , mayakiw uka qellqatat jukʼamp nayrajj utji
Mesopotamia alay toqenjja , 400 qallta maranakan siríaco arur jaqokipat Bibliajj utj - jjänwa .
Inas 100 marana jan ukajj 200 jichha pacha maranakan uka arur jaqokipaschïna .
Uka Bibliajj niy phoqatpachänwa , 2 Pedro , 3 Juan , Judas ukat Apocalipsis libronakakiw jan utjkänti .
Uka Bibliajj Peshitta sutimpiw uñtʼasi , ukasti ‘ qhana ’ jan ukajj ‘ sum amuykaña ’ sañ muni . Nayra maranakatätap laykojj wali wakiskiriwa , ukat kunjamsa uka tiempon Biblia qellqatanak utjäna uksa sum qhanañcharaki .
Peshitta qellqatanakat maynïrinjja , mä fechaw utji , ukajj 459 jan ukajj 460 maranakatawa . Uka qellqatajj taqet sipans jukʼamp nayrawa .
Peshitta qellqatjja , niya 508 maranwa uñakipasïna ukat phesqa libronak jan utjkäna ukanaksa phoqachasjjarakïnwa .
Uka qellqatajj Versión Filoxeniana sutimpiw uñtʼasjjäna .
Kawkïr qollan qellqatanakatejj 400 maran qellqaskäna jan ukajj uka mara qhepat qellqaskäna ukanakakiw 1800 marakamajj uñtʼasïna .
Ukhamajj biblistanakatakejj Vulgata latina Peshitta siríaca qellqatanak wali askit uñjapjjäna , kunattejj jukʼamp nayra maranakatäpjjänwa .
Peshitta qellqatajj siríaco arut jukʼamp nayra yaqha qellqatat uñakipatawa sasaw amuyapjjarakïna . Ukampis kawkïr qellqatätapsa uk janiw yatipkänti .
Niyakejjay siríaco arut Bibliajj 100 maranakan utjjchïnjja , biblistanakataki uka maranakat mä qellqata jikjjatañajj wali askipunïspawa , ukhamatwa kunjamsa yaqha arur Bibliajj jaqokipasïna uk uñjapjjaspa .
Ukampis ¿ ukham qellqata utjpachati ?
¿ Jikjjatapjjpachäniti ?
Sinaítico Siríaco .
Janapanjja , Evangelio qellqatanak niya borrsuta uñjasi
Jïsa , pä qellqata jikjjatapjjäna .
Maynïrejja , 400 maranakatawa .
Ukajj siríaco arun walja qellqatanakamp chikaw jikjjatasïna , uka qellqatanaksti Gran Bretaña markankir mä museow 1842 maran Nitria ( Egipto ) wasaran jikjjataski uka monasteriot alasïna .
Uka qellqatajj Siríaco Curetoniano sutimpiw uñtʼasi , kunattejj William Cureton chachaw jikjjatäna ukat yatiyjjarakïna , jupajj museon utjki uka qellqatanak uñjirïn yanapiripänwa .
Qellqatanjja , pusi Evangelionakajj akham apthapitänwa : Mateo , Marcos , Juan ukat Lucas .
Jichhakam utjir yaqha qellqatajj Sinaítico Siríaco ukarakiwa , aka yatichäwin qalltan parlaniwayktan uka pä ispa kullakanakaw uk jikjjatapjjatayna .
Agnes warmin janis universidadat mä titulopas utjkchïnjja , kimsaqallqo arunakwa parläna , maynïristi siríaco arünwa . 1892 maranjja , Egipto markana Santa Catalina sat monasterionjja , walja qellqatanak jikjjatäna .
Libronak imañ mueblenwa siríaco arut mä qellqata jikjjatäna .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Wali thanthänwa ; wali qʼañurakïnwa ukat jananakapas niya lipthapitänwa [ walja maranak ] jan jistʼarasjjatap layku ” sasa .
Uka qellqatajj palimpsesto * satänwa , mä arunjja , mä qellqatan kunatï qellqasiwayki uk borrsusin uka patjjar yaqhamp qellqjjatañatakïnwa .
Uka qellqatan borrsutarojja , siríaco arump qellqjjatatänwa , qollan warminakats parlarakïnwa .
Ukampis kuntï borrsutäkäna ukwa Agnes warmejj mä qawqha uñjäna , jananakan alayapanjja , “ Mateona ” , “ Marcosana ” ukat “ Lucasan ” arunakap uñstäna .
Jïsa , Mateo , Marcos , Lucas ukat Juan qellqatanakat niy phoqatpach códice siríaco qellqat jupajj jikjjatäna .
Uka qellqatajj 400 tukuya maranakanwa qellqaspachäna sasaw biblistanakajj jichhürun sapjje .
Bibliat utjki uka nayra qellqatanakatjja , Sinaítico Siríaco , griego arut Códice Sinaítico ukat Códice Vaticano sat qellqatanakajja , wali wakiskiri jikjjatäwinakapuniwa .
Ukampis jichhajj Siríaco Curetoniano , Sinaítico Siríaco sat qellqatanakajj siríaco arut jukʼamp nayra Evangelio qellqatanakat copiatawa sasinwa amuyasjje , uka qellqatanakajj 100 tukuya maranakata ukat 200 qallta maranakatawa .
Uka qellqatanakjja , jichhürunakan Bibliat yatjjatapki ukanakar ¿ yanaptʼaspati ?
Jïsa , Marcos qellqatat amuytʼañäni , yaqhep Biblianakanjja , Marcos 16 : 8 jiskʼa tʼaqa qhepatjja , yaqha jiskʼa tʼaqanakajj utjaskakiwa .
Uka jiskʼa tʼaqanakjja , 400 marat Códice Alejandrino , Vulgata latina ukat yaqha qellqatanakans utjchejja , Códice Sinaítico ukat Códice Vaticano griego arut qellqatanakanjja , Marcos 16 : 8 jiskʼa tʼaqakamakiw utji , uka pä qellqatanakajj wali respetatawa .
Ukat Sinaítico Siríaco qellqatanjja , Marcos 16 : 8 jiskʼa tʼaqakamakirakiw utjki , ukhamajj Marcos 16 : 8 qellqatjjar utjki uka yaqha jiskʼa tʼaqanakajja , janiw nayra Marcos qellqatan utjkänti , qhepatwa yapjjatasïna .
Yaqha toqet amuytʼañäni ; 1800 maranakanjja , niya taqpach Biblianakanjja , 1 Juan 5 : 7 , 8 jiskʼa tʼaqanakanjja , Trinidad yatichäwir arjjatir mä aru yapjjatapjjäna .
Ukampis uka arjja janiw griego arut nayra qellqatanakan utjkiti , Peshitta qellqatansa , janirakikiw utjkiti .
Ukhamajj Bibliat utjki uka qellqatanakaruw mä aru yapjjatasipkäna .
Jehová Diosajj Qollan Qellqatanak jarkʼaqasajj arsutapar phoqawayiwa .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Qorajj wañsuwayjjakiwa , panqaras ankuntawayjjakirakiwa ; ukampis Diosan arunakapasti wiñayatakipuniw jakarakini ” sasa ( Isaías 40 : 8 ; 1 Pedro 1 : 25 ) .
Diosan arunakapajj kunjamäkänti nayra qellqatanakan uk jaqenakaru yatiyañatakejj siríaco arut nayra qellqatanakajj askpun yanaptʼawayi .
Griego arut jaqokipatäki palímpsestos siski uka arojja , “ mayamp borrsuta ” sañ muni .
Arameo arut jutïr mä aruwa , Persia Imperionwa parlasirïna .
Mesopotamia alay toqensa , nayra Antioquía marka jakʼanakansa parlasirakirïnwa , waljanirakiw uka markan nayrïr 100 maranakan cristianöjjapjjäna .
Siríaco arut 100 jan ukajj 200 jichha pacha maranakanwa qellqasïna .
Nayra tiempojja , Daniel chacharuw yanaptʼapjjäna , jupajj Diosan serviripänwa , jichhürunakan ukhamarakiw Diosan Arup istʼapjjañapataki angelanakajj jaqenakar yanaptʼapjje
Diosajj jaqer janïr lurkasajja , millón millón angelanakaruw luräna ( Job 38 : 4 , 7 ) .
Uka chʼaman ajayunakajja , Diosaruw servipjje .
Awisajj istʼasir jaqenakar yanaptʼapjjañapatakiw Diosajj jupanakar khiti ( Salmo 91 : 10 , 11 ) .
Jichhürunakanjja , kuntï Jesusan arkirinakapajj yatiyapki uk yateqapjjañapatakiw angelanakajj jaqenakar yanaptʼapjje .
( Apocalipsis 14 : 6 , 7 liytʼäta . )
Angelanakamp yanaptʼayasiñatakejj ¿ jupanakarut mayisiñasa ?
Janiwa , mayisiñajj yupaychañampi sasiwa , jiwasajj Diosarukiw yupaychañasa .
Niyakejjay angelanakajj Diosar servipjjchejja , Juparukiw istʼapjje janiw jaqenakarojj istʼapkiti .
Ukhamajja , Diosarupuniw mayisiñasa Jesusan sutipjjaru .
( Salmo 103 : 20 , 21 ukat Mateo 26 : 53 liytʼäta . )
Angelanakajj jaqenakjamarakiw kunatï walïki , jan walïki uk ajllipjjañapatak luratäpjje .
Ukampis waljaniw Diosar jan istʼañ ajlliwayapjje .
Nayraqatjja , Supayaw Dios contra saytʼäna , yaqha angelanakas ukhamarakiw lurapjjäna , ukhamatwa sajjrar tukuwayapjje .
Niya jichhanakakiw Supayampi sajjranakapampejj alajjpachat aka Oraqeru jaqoqanitäpjjäna .
( Apocalipsis 12 : 7 - 9 liytʼäta . )
Jan walinakajja , 1914 marat aksaruw walpun jiljjattawayi .
Ukhamajja , Supayampiru sajjranakapampirojj niyaw Diosajj tukjani . Ukat aka Oraqjja mä paraisoruw tukuyjjani .
( Apocalipsis 12 : 12 ukat 21 : 3 , 4 liytʼäta . )
