Diosan Reinop taqe chuyma suyañäni
7 JANA • 108 , 129 QʼOCHUNAKA
Jumanakasti “ sacerdotenakäpjjätawa ”
13 JANA • 98 , 102 QʼOCHUNAKA
Jehová Diosar yanapañjja wali askit uñjapjjañäni
23 JANA • 120 , 44 QʼOCHUNAKA
Alajjpachat lupʼipjjam
28 JANA • 70 , 57 QʼOCHUNAKA
▪ Diosan Reinop taqe chuyma suyañäni
▪ Jumanakasti “ sacerdotenakäpjjätawa ”
Jesusan apnaqäwip toqew Jehová Diosajj kuntï aka Oraqetaki ukat jaqenakataki amtkäna ukjja phoqani .
Aka yatichäwinakanjja , walja pactonakatwa yatjjatañäni , ukat kunjamsa Diosan Reinopa phoqasiñapatakejj ukanakajj yanaptʼi uksa yatjjatarakiñäniwa .
Ukaw Diosan Reinopar jukʼamp confiyañatak yanaptʼistani .
▪ Jehová Diosar yanapañjja wali askit uñjapjjañäni
Kunsa Diosan nayra servirinakapatsa ukat jichha tiempo servirinakapatsa yateqassna ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjatañäni .
Ukaw Diosan markapan yanaptʼañajj kunja askisa uk wali askit uñjañataki yanaptʼistani .
▪ Alajjpachat lupʼipjjam
Aka qhepa urunakanjja , Diosar iyawsatasajj kunayman yantʼataw uñjasi .
Nayra tiempon Diosar taqe chuyma servirinakajj ukham jan walinakanwa uñjasipjjarakïna , sañäni Abrahamampi Moisesampejj ukham jan walinwa uñjasipjjäna ¿ kunsa jupanakat yateqassna ?
Aka yatichäwejja , Jehová Diosata ukat Reinopat lupʼiñatakiw chʼamañchtʼistu , cheqas ukaw aguantañatakejj yanaptʼistani .
3 Jupanakajj taqe chuymaw sarapjjäna : Taiwán markaru
18 Diosar servitaja
NAYRÏR JANA : Taita toqenkiri Tausa sat marknam paski uka jachʼa thakinwa pä kullakanakajj yatiyasipki , Kenia markat Inti jalsu toqenkir Mbololo sat qollu jakʼana
