▪ Khuyapayasirïñsa altʼat chuymanïñsa Jesusat yateqasipjjañäni
▪ Jan ajjsarirïñsa ukat amuytʼasirïñsa Jesusat yateqasipjjañäni
Bibliajja , Jesusat yateqasiñasatakiw chʼamañchtʼistu .
Pantjasir jaqenakjamajj ¿ kunjamsa Jesusat yateqassna ?
Nayrïr yatichäwinjja , Jesusan altʼat chuymanïtapata , khuyapayasirïtapatwa yatjjataskañäni .
Payïr yatichäwinsti , kunjamatsa Jesusjam jan ajjsarirïsna ukat amuytʼasirïsna ukwa yatjjataskarakiñäni .
▪ Diosan arunakapajj taqe markanakanwa yatiyasïna
▪ Jehová Diosaw Oraqpachan yatiyañasatak yanaptʼaskistu
Aka pä yatichäwinakat nayrïr yatichäwinjja , kunjamsa Jehová Diosajj nayrïr cristianonakar yatiyapjjañapatakejj yanaptʼawayi ukwa qhanañchi .
Payïr yatichäwisti , kunanakas aka Oraqpachan Diosan Reinopat yatiyañatakejj yanaptʼistu ukaw qhanañchasiraki .
