NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ KHITINAKAS JEHOVÁ DIOSAN TESTIGONAKAPAJJA ?
‘ Taqe Qellqatajj Diosan amuytʼayatawa , askirakiw yatichañataki ’ sasaw Testigonakajj creyipjjta .
Ukatwa Diosar uñtʼañatak Bibliat yatjjatapjjta , ewjjanakaparjam sarnaqañatakis chʼamachasipjjaraktwa .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Juma sapak [ Jehová ] Diosätam yatipjjpan , aka oraqjjar juma sapak Alajjpachankirïtam yatipjjarakpan ” sasa ( Salmo 83 : 18 ) .
* Ukatwa Jehová Dios saparuki yupaychapjjta , jaqenakarus sutipsa yatiyapjjarakta ( Isaías 43 : 10 - 12 ) .
Jesusan arkiripäpjjtwa , Jesusajj ‘ Diosan Wawapawa ’ , * jupajj aka Oraqeruw jutäna , ukat Mesiasaruw tukuwayi sasaw creyipjjta .
Jesusajj jiwatat jaktasajj alajjpacharuw sarjjäna .
Qhepatjja , Reyjamaw Diosan Reinopan uttʼayatäjje .
Uka Reinojj alajjpachan uttʼayatäjjewa , uka Reinow aka Oraqe mä Paraisor tukuyani ( Daniel 2 : 44 ) .
Bibliajj siwa : “ Llampʼu chuymaninakasti oraq katoqapjjani , jilarkir sumankañampiw kusisipjjarakini ” sasa ( Salmo 37 : 11 , 29 ) .
“ Biblia liytʼapki ukhajja , Diosas parlkiristam ukhamawa .
Jan walinakan uñjasipki ukhajj Diosan Arupan ewjjtʼanakap thaqtapjje .
[ . . . ]
Jupanakatakejja , Diosan Arupajj jakaskiwa . ” ​ (
Sacerdote católico Benjamin Cherayath , Münsterländische Volkszeitung sat periódico , Alemania )
Bibliajj taqeniruw jichhürunakan yanaptʼaspa sasaw Testigonakajj creyipjjta ( Isaías 48 : 17 , 18 ) .
Ukatwa Biblian ewjjtʼanakaparjam sarnaqañataki chʼamachasipjjta .
Sañäni , Bibliajj janiw cuerpomsa , amuyumsa qʼañuchapjjätati sasaw ewjjtʼistu , ukat cigarrsa jan pitapkti ni droganakampis qolljasipkti .
Janirakiw Diosajj jan walit uñjki ukanaksa lurapkti .
Janiw machjasipkti ni qʼañu luräwinakansa sarnaqapkti ni lunthatasipkaraktsa .
Qullan Arunaka Biblianjja , glosariopan “ Tatitu ” siski uka pʼeqeñchäwinjja , ‘ Tatitojj Yavé [ jan ukajj Jehová ] sutimpiw uñtʼasiraki ’ sasaw qhanañchi .
Bibliajj ‘ Diosan mä sapa Yoqapa ’ sasaw Jesusar saraki . Cheqas jupa saparukiw Jehová Diosajj jan khitin yanaptʼat luräna .
Ukatjja , Diosajj taqe kunanak lurkäna ukanakat Jesusajj nayrïriwa .
Kunatsa jan fiestanak amtapkta ni wilampis uchayasipkta uk yatiñ munsta ukhajja , Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma , ukatakejj SOBRE NOSOTROS > PREGUNTAS FRECUENTES siski uka cheqar mantam .
NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ KHITINAKAS JEHOVÁ DIOSAN TESTIGONAKAPAJJA ?
Sapa maraw millón millón Biblianaka , Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanak imprimipjjta , ukat lakirapjjarakta .
Oraqpachan sucursalanakasa , imprentanakas utji .
Walja tamanakar jalanoqotapjjtwa , Tantachasiñ Utanakan tantachasipjjta ukanakajj Diosar yupaychañatakjam suma lurtʼatawa .
¿ Kawkhatsa ukanakatakejj qollqe apsusi ?
Taqe ukanakajja , yanaptʼañ munirinakan churäwinakapampiw apasi .
Khä 1879 marana Zionʼs Watch Tower sat revistajj payïr kuti apsuskäna ukanjja , akham sänwa : “ [ Aka revistajja ] JEHOVÁ Diosan yanapapampi apsutawa , ukhamajj janiw qollqejj mayjaskaniti , ni jaqenakan yanaptʼapsa maykarakiniti ” sasa .
Jichhürkamas pachpak amuyasipkta .
Maynitï qollqemp yanaptʼañ munchejja , sucursalaruw apayaspa , jan ukajj Tantachasiñ Utanakan cajanakajj utjki ukaruw uchaspa .
Janiw diezmo mayipkti , ni qollqes apthapiskarakiti . Janirakiw mayninakar yanaptʼatatsa , Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakatsa qollqejj mayiskiti .
Yatiyir saratatsa , tantachäwinakan yatichatatsa ni tantachasiñ utanak luratatsa janiw khitis pagapkituti .
Jesusajj sänwa : ‘ Inakiw lurapjjäta , inaki katoqapjjatam layku ’ sasa .
Janirakiw Testigonakan oficinanakapana , jan ukajj sucursalanakan irnaqapki ukanakarusa , ni Oraqpachan Jilïr Irpirinakarus pagaskiti .
“ Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj taqe kunanaktï lurapki ukanakajja , yanaptʼañ munirinakan churatapampiw apasi . Ukhamasti sapa mayniw qawqha qollqsa churani ukat qawqha kutis churarakini ukjja , chuymapan amtapjje . ” ​ (
Tribunal Europeo de Derechos Humanos , 2011 )
Yanaptʼañ munirinakajj churapki uka qollqempejja , jan waltʼäwinakan uñjasipki ukanakar yanaptʼañatakis irtasirakiwa .
Nayrïr cristianonakajja , ukhamarakiw jan waltʼäwinakan uñjasirinakar yanaptʼapjjerïna .
Jichhürunjja , ukhamarakiw jan walinakan uñjasipki ukanakan utapsa askichapjjta , ukhamaraki manqʼsa , isinaksa , ukat qollanakampis yanaptʼapjjta .
Janiw ukakïkiti , Tantachasiñ Utanaksa askichapjjaraktwa .
Una fe más fuerte que la desgracia ( supertifón en Filipinas ) sat video Internetan jw.org cheqan uñtam .
