NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ DIOSAR MAYISIÑAJJ YANAPTʼISTASPATI ?
“ Nayajj anatañar wal chuym uchirïta .
Ukatwa walja qollqe ganañatak yanaptʼita sas mayisirïta , ukampis janiw ukajj phoqaskänti . ”
( Samuel , * Kenia )
“ Yateqañ utanjja , mayisiñ yatichapjjetäna , ukat pʼeqer yatsusaw pachpa arunakampi kutin kutini mayisipjjerïta . ”
( Teresa , Filipinas )
“ Jan walinakan uñjaskta ukhaw mayista , juchanakajat pampachayasiñatakisa , suma cristianöñatakis mayisiraktwa . ”
( Magdalene , Ghana )
Kunjamtï Samuel chachasa , Teresa ukat Magdalene warminakas sapkejja , jaqenakajj kunayman toqet mayisipjje .
Yaqhepanakan mayisitanakapajj wali askiwa , ukampis yaqhepan janiw ukhamäkiti .
Waljaniw examen churañatakisa , pelot anatir equipopan atipañapatakisa , familiapar yanaptʼañapatakisa , jan ukajj yaqha toqenakatsa mayisipjje .
Taqe ukanakajj jaqenakatak mayisiñajj wali askïtap uñachtʼayistu . Cheqas ‘ jan religionanïpki ukanakas mayisipjjarakiwa ’ sasaw yatjjatasiwayi .
¿ Jumajj mayisirïtati ?
Ukhamächi ukhajja , ¿ kunatsa mayista ?
Jumajj mayisirïstasa janisa , inas akham jisktʼasta : “ ¿ Mayisiñajj yanaptʼistaspati ?
¿ Mayisitanakas istʼirejj utjpachati ? ”
sasa . Mä qellqerejja , “ mayisiñajj mä qollampi sasikiwa , [ . . . ] kunjamtï maynejj uywapar parlkaspa ukhama ” sasaw amuyi .
Yaqhep qollirinakajja , niya pachparak amuyapjje , mayisiñajj “ yanaptʼir qolljamawa ” sasaw sapjjaraki .
¿ Jumajj kamsasmasa ?
¿ Jaqenakajj aleq mayisiñatakti mayisipjjpacha ?
Jan ukajj ¿ kuna yanaptʼanak jikjjatañatakikich mayisipjje ?
Bibliajja , mayisiñajj yanaptʼir qollanakat sipansa , jukʼamp askiwa sasaw qhanañchi .
Ukatjja , munañaparjam mayisipki ukanakar istʼiwa sasaw saraki .
¿ Ukajj cheqäpachati ?
Uka toqet jichhajj yatjjatañäni .
Yaqha sutinakampi uchatawa .
NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ DIOSAR MAYISIÑAJJ YANAPTʼISTASPATI ?
Yaqhep jaqenakajja , mayisiñajj tiempo apaqakiwa sasaw sapjje .
Yaqhepanakasti mayisipjjewa , ukampis janiw khitis jaysankituti sasaw amuyapjje .
Diosajj janiw utjkiti siri mä chachajja , kunjamäpachas Diosajj sasaw amuytʼäna , ukatwa akham sasin mayisïna : “ Istʼaskchista ukhajj jaysita , mä jukʼsa parlita ” sasa .
Ukampis Diosajj janiw kuns arskänti “ amukïnwa ” sasaw säna .
Ukampis Bibliajj mayisitanakas Diosaw istʼaski sasaw qhanañchi .
Nayra tiemponjja , markaparojj akham sasaw säna : “ Tatituw jumatjja khuyaptʼayasïtam yanap mayisisa arnaqasitamata , istʼasinsti jaysarakïtamwa ” sasa ( Isaías 30 : 19 ) .
Yaqha jiskʼa tʼaqajj akham siwa : “ Kusisiñampiwa katoqe cheqa jaqenakan mayisitanakapjja ” sasa ( Proverbios 15 : 8 ) .
Jesusajj Awkiparuw mayisïna “ Diosasti istʼänwa ” .
Biblianjja , kunjamsa yaqhep jaqenakan mayisitanakapar istʼasïna ukas qhanañchasirakiwa .
Bibliajj siwa : ‘ Jesusajj khititejj qhespiyañatak chʼamanïkäna ukaruw mayisïna , “ Diosasti istʼänwa ” ’ sasa .
Yaqhanakajj Daniel 9 : 20 , 21 ukat 2 Crónicas 7 : 1 qellqatanakanwa jikjjatasiraki .
¿ Kunatsa yaqhepanakajj janis khitis mayisitanakap istʼkaspa ukham amuyapjje ?
Mayisitanakas istʼatäñapatakejja , Bibliajj parlki uka Jehová Dios saparukiw mayisiñasa .
* Janiw yaqha diosanakarus ni nayra achachilanakarus mayisiñasäkiti .
Janiw ukakïkiti , kuntï maykañäni uk “ munañaparjama ” mayisiñas Diosajj munaraki .
Ukhamti mayisiñänejja , ‘ Jupajj istʼistaniwa ’ .
Ukhamajj mayisitanakas Diosajj istʼañapatakejja , Juparuw uñtʼañasa ukat istʼañasarakiwa .
Waljaniw mayisiñajj janiw religionanakan aleq mä costumbrepakïkiti sasin sapjje , jan ukasti , Diosajj mayisitanakas istʼistuwa ukat jaysanistaspawa sasin amuyapjje .
Kenia markankir Isaac sat chachajja , siwa : “ Biblia sum amuytʼañatakiw Diosar mayista .
Qhepatjja , mä jaqew jikjjatitu , jupaw Biblia sum amuytʼañ yanaptʼawayitu ” sasa .
Filipinas markankir Hilda sat warmejja , cigarro pitañ jaytañ munäna , ukampis janiw jaytirjamäkänti .
Qhepatjja chachapajj akham sänwa : “ Diosar yanaptʼañapataki mayisim ” sasa .
Ukatwa Hilda warmejj mayisïna , jupajj siwa : “ Kunjamsa Diosajj yanaptʼawayitu ukajj wali muspharkañawa .
Jukʼat jukʼatwa cigarro pitañ jan munjjayätti .
Ukhamatwa jaytawayjjta ” sasa .
¿ Mayisitamatï Diosan munañaparjamächejja , llakinakar saykatañatakejj yanaptʼirïstamti ?
Diosan sutipajj Jehová satawa sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ DIOSAR MAYISIÑAJJ YANAPTʼISTASPATI ?
Amigonakajj parltʼasipki ukhajj wali sum apasipjje .
Diosajj jupamp parltʼasisma ukwa munaraki , ukhamat amigopäñataki .
Jupajj akham sistuwa : ‘ Jumanakajj nayaru artʼasipjjetäta , nayaru mayisisa , nayasti mayisitanakamjja istʼapjjarakïmawa ’ sasa ( Jeremías 29 : 12 ) .
Ukhamti mayisïtajja , ‘ Diosaruw jakʼachasïta , jupasti jumanakarojj jakʼachasirakiniwa ’ .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Tatitojj artʼasirinakapan jakʼapankaskiwa ” sasa ( Salmo 145 : 18 ) .
Diosarutï sapür mayisïtajja , Jupamp wali sum apasïta .
“ Tatitojj artʼasirinakapan jakʼapankaskiwa . ”
( Salmo 145 : 18 ) Jesusajj akham sänwa : ‘ ¿ Utjaspati jumanak taypinjja wawapajj tʼantʼa mayispa ukatsti awkipajj qalak churaspa ukhamajja ?
¿ Jan ukajj wawapajj chawlla mayi ukhajj awkipasti mä asiru churaspati ?
Jumanakajj jan walïkasinsa , sumäkis ukwa wawanakamarojj churapjjtajja . ¡ Alajjpachankir Awkimasti ukatsa jukʼampiwa khitinakatejj Jupar mayki ukanakar sumanaka churañatakejja ! ’
sasa . Diosajj jupar mayisisma ukwa muni “ Jupasti jumanakatjja llakisirakiwa ” .
Llakinakam Jupar yatiyasma ukwa munaraki .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Jan jumanakajj kunats llakisipjjamti , taqe kunsa Diosar sapjjam oracionana , mayipjjam yuspagarapjjarakim ” sasa .
Jaqenak toqet yatjjatirinakajja , niya taqe jaqenakaw Diosar mayisipjje sasaw sapjje .
Diosajj janiw utjkiti , Diosar janiw uñtʼksnati sirinakas uka taypinkapjjarakiwa .
* Ukajja , jaqenakajj Diosan yanapap munatas amuytʼayistu .
Jesusajj “ kusisiñanïpjjew khitinakatejj ajay toqen aynachtʼatäpjjatap amuyasipjje ukanakajja , Diosan reinopajj jupanakankarakiwa ” sasaw säna .
Ukhamajj ajay toqet sumankañatakejj sapüruw Diosar mayisiñasa .
Diosar mayisisajj ¿ kuna askinaksa jikjjatañäni ?
Estados Unidos markanjja , sapa patakat tunka mayaniw Diosajj janiw utjkiti sirinakatsa , Diosar janiw uñtʼksnati sirinakatsa ( agnósticos ) sapa phajjsi mayisipjje , sasaw Centro de Investigación Pew sat organizacionajj pasïr 2012 maran qhanañchawayi .
Bibliajj jakäwisan taqe kunatï paskistu ukanakat mayissna sasaw qhanañchi .
Aka toqenakat mayissna :
Juchanakas arsusiñataki .
“ Jucha luratajjaw utjäna , uk amuyasta , ukat jucha luratanakajj jan imtʼksmati ” ( Salmo 32 : 5 ) .
Yuspärañataki .
“ Alajjpachankir Tatay , jumar jachʼañchañajj [ jan ukajj yuspärañajj ] sumapuniwa ” ( Salmo 92 : 1 ) .
Jachʼañchañataki .
“ Jan qarjasisaw Tatiturojj jachʼañchä , lakajjajj jupar jachʼañchapuniniwa ” ( Salmo 34 : 1 ) .
Yanap mayiñataki .
“ Arsutanakaman thakipanay irpita , ukankiw nayan kusisiñajjajja ” ( Salmo 119 : 35 ) .
Chʼam mayiñataki .
“ Uñtanikitaya , nayat khuyaptʼayasita , aka uywatamar qhespiyam , chʼamam churarakim ” ( Salmo 86 : 16 ) .
NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ DIOSAR MAYISIÑAJJ YANAPTʼISTASPATI ?
Janïr kun lurañ qalltkasajja , akham sasin jisktʼasipuntanwa : ‘ ¿ Kunjamsa ukajj yanaptʼitani ? ’ sasa .
Mayisiñ toqet ukham jisktʼasiñajj ¿ walikïskaspati ?
Jïsa .
Jaqenakajj kuntï lurkañäni ukajj yanaptʼistaniti janicha , uk yatiñ munapuntanwa .
Job chachas akham sasaw may kutejj jisktʼasirakïna : ‘ Jupar jawsirïsta ukhajj ¿ istʼitaspati ? ’
sasa ( Job 9 : 16 , NM ) . Uñjaniwayktan uka yatichäwinakanjja , mayisiñajj janiw religionanakan aleq mä costumbrepakïkiti ni mä yanaptʼir qollampi saskisa .
Jehová Diosar munañaparjama , ukat kunatï Jupatak walïki ukarjam mayisiñäni ukhajja , Jupajj istʼistaniwa .
Cheqas Jupar jakʼachassna , ukwa Diosajj muni .
Ukhamasti , Diosar sapür mayisiñajj ¿ kunjamsa jakäwisan yanaptʼistani ?
Ukanakat jichhajj mä qawqha uñjañäni .
Jan walinakan jikjjatasisajj ¿ llakimp aynachtʼirïtati ?
Ukhamächi ukhajja , Bibliajj “ jan inaktʼas orapjjam ” ukhamaraki “ taqe kunsa Diosar sapjjam oracionana ” sasaw chʼamañchtʼistu .
Ukhamtï mayisiñänejja , Diosajj samarañap churapjjätam “ uka samarañasti jumanakan chuymanakamsa , amuyunakamsa imaniwa Cristomp mayakïpjjatam layku ” sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchistu .
Diosarutï llakinakas jaytañänejja , sumakiw jikjjatasiñäni .
Cheqas “ Diosar llakinakam katuyam , jupasti chʼaman tukuyätam , Diosar jaysirin aynachtʼañapjja , janipuniw jupajj munkaniti ” sasaw Salmo 55 : 22 qellqatajj qhanañchi .
“ Diosar llakinakam katuyam , jupasti chʼaman tukuyätam . ”
( Salmo 55 : 22 ) Diosan samarañap waljaniw jikjjatawayapjje .
Corea del Sur markankir Hee Ran sat warmejj akham siwa : “ Jan waltʼäwinakan uñjaskta ukhajj Diosaruw mayista .
Ukhamat jan walinakar saykatañatak chʼaman jikjjatasta ” sasa .
Filipinas markankir Cecilia sat warmejj akham sarakiwa : “ Wawanakajatsa , mamajatsa walpun llakista , mamitajajj usuntataw uñjasi , ukat janiw khitïtsa uk amuyjjeti .
Mayisiñajj uka jan walinakar saykatañatakiw yanaptʼitu , ukhamatwa llakinakajj jan aynachtʼaykituti .
Jehová Diosaw jupanakar uñjañ yanaptʼaskitani sasaw confiyarakta ” sasa .
Jan walinakan jikjjatasisajj ¿ wali llakitat uñjasta ?
‘ Khuyapayasir Awkisaru ’ , mä arunjja , Jehová Diosaru mayisisma .
Bibliajj “ taqe tʼaqhesiñanakasanwa Diosajj chuymachistu ” sasaw qhanañchi .
Sañäni , Jesusajj wali llakita jikjjataskäna ukhajj “ orañatakiw killtʼasirakïna ” .
¿ Kunas pasäna ?
“ Alajjpachat mä [ angelaw ] uñstäna juparu chʼamañchañataki ” .
Nehemías chachajj jan wali jaqenakamp arknaqataw uñjasïna , ukhamat Diosan munañap jan phoqañapataki .
Ukatwa jupajj Diosar ‘ jukʼamp chʼamam ’ churita sasin mayisïna .
Diosajj jan ajjsaras munañap phoqañapatakiw yanaptʼäna ( Nehemías 6 : 9 - 16 ) .
Ghana markankir Reginald sat kullakajj akham siwa : “ Kunapachatï jan walinakan uñjaskta ukhajja , mayni cheqpach yanaptʼirirus parlkirista , ukat jupajja , jan llakisimti sasinsa chuymachtʼkitaspa ukhamawa ” sasa .
Cheqas Diosar mayisiñäni ukhajj Jupajj chuymachistaniwa .
Kunanaktï lurañ amtktan ukanakajj jiwasarusa , familiasarus yanaptʼaspawa , jan ukajj aynachtʼayaspawa .
¿ Kunjamsa suma amtanakar pursna ?
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Jumanakat maynintejj jan yatiñ kankañapajj utjkchi ukapachajj , Diosat maypan , [ ukajj jan walinakan uñjaskañäni ukhaw yanaptʼistani ] Diosasti juparojj churaniwa .
Jupasti jilarkirwa churi , khitirus jan kuns sasaw churaraki ” sasa .
Diosar yatiñ kankañap mayiñäni ukhajja , Jupajj qollan ajayup toqew suma amtanakar puriñasataki yanaptʼistaspa .
Jesusajj akham sänwa : ‘ Alajjpachankir Awkimajj qollan ajayup churani mayipki ukanakarojja ’ sasa .
“ Jehová Diosar mayisiskakiyätwa , ukhamat mä suma amtar puriñataki . ”
( Kwabena , Ghana )
Jesusajj suma amtanakar puriñatakejj Awkiparuw mayisirakirïna . 12 apostolonakap ajlliñapäkäna ukhajja , “ jupajj arum paqariw Diosat mayisïna ” sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Jichhürunakan waljanirakiw suma amtanakar puriñatak Diosar mayisipjje , mayisitanakapar jaysatap amuyasajja , Jesusjamarakiw wali sum jikjjatasipjje .
Filipinas markankir Regina sat warmejja , walja jan walinakanwa uñjasïna , chachap jiwkäna uka qhepatjja sapakiw jikjjatasïna , jan trabajoni ukhamaw uñjasïna .
Janiw ukakïkänti , pä phuchanakap uywañajj jupatak wali chʼamarakïnwa .
¿ Kunas suma amtanakar puriñatak yanaptʼawayi ?
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Taqe chuymaw Jehová Diosar yanapap mayisirïta , Jupasti istʼapunitänwa ” sasa .
Ghana markankir Kwabena sat chachajj Diosaruw yanaptʼañapatak mayisïna .
Jupajj akham siwa : “ Utanak luratajat walja qollq pagapjjetäna , uka irnaqäw aptʼasiwayta ” sasa .
Uka toqet sumpach amuytʼasajja , jupajj akham siwa : “ Jehová Diosar mayisiskakiyätwa , ukhamat mä suma amtar puriñataki ” , ukampis “ Diosajj suma amtanakar puriñatakiw yanaptʼawayitu , jichhajj familiajarojj ajay toqetsa , jañchi toqetsa sum yanaptʼaskta ” sasa .
Diosajj suma amtanakar puriñatak jumar yanaptʼarakiristamwa .
Kunjamsa mayisiñajj yanaptʼistaspa uk mä qawqhanak uñjaniwaytanjja .
( Jukʼampjja , “ Mayisiñajj aka toqenakan yanaptʼistaspa ” siski uka recuadro uñjjattʼam ) .
Diosajj mayisitam istʼañapatakejja , nayraqatajj Juparuw uñtʼañama ukat kunas amtapajj uksa yatjjatañamarakiwa .
Ukhamajj ¿ kunsa ukatak lurasma ? Jehová Diosan Testigonakaparuw Bibliat yatjjatañatak mayisma .
* Ukhamatwa Diosar jakʼachasisma , Jupasti ‘ mayisitanakar istʼiriwa ’ ( Salmo 65 : 2 ) .
Jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , Jehová Diosan Testigonakapampiw parltʼasma , jan ukajj Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma .
Amuyusan sumankañataki .
“ Jan jumanakajj kunats llakisipjjamti , taqe kunsa Diosar sapjjam oracionana , mayipjjam yuspagarapjjarakim . Diosajj jumanakarojj churapjjarakïtamwa samarañapa , ukasti taqe kuntejj jaqejj amuytʼkaspas ukat jukʼamp jachʼawa .
Uka samarañasti jumanakan chuymanakamsa , amuyunakamsa imaniwa Cristomp mayakïpjjatam layku ” .
Diosamp chuymachtʼatäñataki .
“ Yupaychañäni Jesucristo Tatitusan Dios Awkiparu . Jupaw jiwasar khuyapayasir Awkisajja , ukhamarak chuymachirisasa .
Taqe tʼaqhesiñanakasanwa Diosajj chuymachistu ” .
Suma amtanakar puriñataki .
“ Jumanakat maynintejj jan yatiñ kankañapajj utjkchi ukapachajj , Diosat maypan , Diosasti juparojj churaniwa . Jupasti jilarkirwa churi , khitirus jan kuns sasaw churaraki ” .
Juchanakar jan purtʼasiñataki .
“ Mayisipjjam jan yantʼäwir mantapjjañamataki ” .
Juchanak pampachayasiñataki .
“ Sutejja apki uka markajjatejj jiskʼar tukusina nayat mayisitani , thaqtarakitani , ukhamarak jan wali sarnaqäwinakapsa apanukuni ukajja , nayajj alajjpachatpachwa istʼäjja , juchanakapsa pampacharakïwa ” ( 2 Crónicas 7 : 14 ) .
Yaqhanakar yanaptʼañataki .
“ Mä aski jaqen oracionapasti wali chʼamanirakiwa ” .
Mayisitanakas istʼatapajj chʼamañchistuwa .
‘ Jehová Diosajj Salomonar sänwa : “ Nayajj istʼsmawa oración luratama , ukhamarak nayar mayisitamsa ” sasa ’ ( 1 Reyes 9 : 3 ) .
Jerusalén templojj mä qollu patankänwa , uk Salomón reyiw luräna .
Templojj inti jalsu toqetsa inti jalanta toqetsa , jachʼa perqanakampi muyuntatänwa .
Herodes reyejj Salomonan templopat sipansa , jukʼamp jachʼäñap munäna , ukatwa jachʼaptayañ amtäna .
Askichirinakajj perqanak alay toqeruw jittʼayapjjäna , ukhamat templon uta anqäjjanak utjañapataki .
Aynach toqerojj 32 metronak jittʼayarakïna .
Ukatakejja , jachʼa perqanakaw lurasïna .
Yaqhep cheqan uka perqanakapajja , altorojj 50 metronïnwa .
Herodes reyejja , templo askichasajj janiw judionakan costumbrenakap mayjtʼayañ munkänti , ukhamat judionakan chuymap jan ustʼayañataki .
Uka toqet Judea markankir Josefo chachajj akham sänwa : ‘ Kawkhantï sacerdotenakajj irnaqapjjerikäna uka cheqanak askichañatakejja , Herodesajj sacerdotenakaruw perqañatakisa , carpinterjam irnaqañatakis yatichäna ’ sasa .
Janïr askichañ tukuyaskäna ukhaw Herodesajj jiwawayjjäna .
Uka templojj 30 jichha pacha maratakejj 46 maranakaw lurasjjäna .
Ukampis Herodesan allchhipan wawapaw ( Herodes Agripa II ) templo askichañ khä nayrïr patak maranakan tukuyjjäna .
Cheqapar uñjir diosajja ( chʼeqa ) jan cheqapar uñjir diosampiw nuwasiski
Uka islan jakirinakajja , Grecia markan costumbrenakapar yatintatäpjjpachänwa .
Hechos qellqatarjamajja , apóstol Pablojj Malta sat islaruw purïna .
Pablojj mä jukʼa waña lawanak ninaruw apjjatäna , ukhamat juntʼurtʼasiñataki . Ukampis akatjamatwa mä katarejj Pablor amparapat achthapïna ukat janiw antutkänti .
Uka islankirinakajj ukham uñjasinjja , akham sapjjänwa : “ Aka chachajj jaqe jiwayirïpachawa . Qotat qhespinkchi ukasa , juchapat [ cheqapar uñjatäñapawa , NM ] ” sasa .
“ Cheqapar uñjaña ” siski uka arutakejja , Griego arunjja , dike aruw apnaqasi .
Uka arojj cheqapar uñjaña sañ muni , ukampis Dike , jan ukajj Dicea arunakjja , cheqapar uñjir diosatakiw Grecia markankirinakajj apnaqapjjerïna .
Ukatwa ‘ cheqapar uñjir diosaw taqe kunsa uñjaski , ukat Zeus sat diosaruw kuna jan walinakatï jan qhanstki uk yatiyi , ukhamat juchañchañapataki ’ sasin amuyapjjerïna .
Biblia toqet parlir mä diccionariorjamajja , ‘ Malta islankirinakajj Pablojj qotat qhespinkchi ukasa , cheqapar uñjir diosaw mä katari toqe juchap qhanstayaski ’ sasaw amuyapjjäna .
Qhepatsti janiw ukham amuyjjapjjänti , kunatejj janiw katarejj Pablor kuns kamachkänti .
BIBLIAT YATJJATASAW NAYRA JAKÄWINAKAPJJA JAYTAWAYAPJJE
Julio Corio sat jilatan arsutaparjama
NASÏWIP MARA : 1981
MARKA : GUATEMALA
NAYRA JAKÄWIPA : WAWATPACHAW LLAKINAKAN JIKJJATASÏNA
Acul sat cheqanwa nasta , Guatemala marka inti jalanta toqena .
Familiajajj ixil aru parlasir markatäpjjewa , ukajj maya sat grupot jutiriwa .
Ixil aru parlasaw jilsta , ukampis español arsa yatiraktwa .
Guatemala markanjja , 36 maranakaw markachirinak pura chʼajjwawayapjje .
Ukhamanwa jilsuwayta .
Uka tiempon ixil markachirinakajj waliw jiwarapjjäna .
Pusi maranïkayäta ukhajja , paqallq marani jilajajj mä granadamp anatasaw mä akatjamat phallayäna , ukhamatwa juykhuptawayta , ukampis jilajajj jiwänwa .
Qhepatjja , juykhunakar yatichaski uka yateqañ utanwa jakasjjayäta , ukanwa braille qellqat liyiñsa yateqawayta , ukajj Guatemala markankiwa .
Ukampis uka uta uñjirejj janiw masinakajampi parlañaj munirïkiti , masinakajas janirakiw nayampi parlañ munapjjerïkiti .
Ukatwa sapak jikjjatasirïta , maran pä phajjsiw mamitajampi qamir sarirïta , uka phajjsi puriniñap wal suyirïta .
Ukampis 10 maranïkayäta ukhaw mamajajj jiwjjäna , jupakiw wali munasiñamp uñjitäna .
Ukatwa jukʼamp llakisjjayäta .
Ukat 11 maranëjjayäta ukhajj markajaruw jilajan familiapampi jakasir kuttʼjjta , jupajj awkejj toqet jilajänwa .
Jupanakajj manqʼañ toqet yanaptʼapkchitänsa , janiw kunja llakitäyätsa uk amuyapkänti .
Ukatwa awisajj “ ¿ kunatsa mamajajj jiwawayjje ?
¿ Kunatsa akham juykhüta ? ”
sasin Diosar sirïta .
Jaqenakajj Diosan munañapawa sasaw sapjjerïtu , ukatwa Diosajj jan sinttʼasiri , jan cheqapar uñjiriwa sasin amuyjjayäta .
Ukhaman uñjasisajj jiwañ munayäta .
Juykhütaj laykojja , jan walinakat jarkʼaqasiñajj wali chʼamänwa .
Wawakayät ukhajj walja kutiw munkir jan munkir jan walinak lurapjjetäna , uk janiw khitirus awisirïkti , janis uka toqet khitis yatiñ munkaspa ukham amuyirïta .
Jaqenakajj janiw nayamp parlañ munapjjerïkiti .
Ukajj walpun aynachtʼayitäna , ukat janiw khitimp parlañs munjjayätti ni khitirus confiyjjayätti .
Qʼajjo waynäjjayät ukhajja , mä chacha warmiw escuelar visittʼapjjetu , jupanakajj Jehová Diosan Testigopapjjänwa .
Yatichirejjaw nayat sinttʼasis jawsatayna .
Jupanakasti , ‘ juykhunakajj uñjapjjaniwa , jiwatanakas jaktapjjaniwa ’ sasaw Bibliat yatichapjjetäna ( Isaías 35 : 5 ; Juan 5 : 28 , 29 ) .
Ukanak istʼañajj wali sumänwa , niyakejjay mayninakamp parlañ ajjsarchiyätjja , janiw kunsa kamsirïkti .
Ukhamäkchïnsa , Bibliat yatichirejj 10 kilometronakwa qollu patnam kayuk jutapjjerïna , ukat wali munasiñampiw uñjapjjetäna .
‘ Jupanakajj pisinsa jakasipkchejja , suma isthaptʼatäpjjewa ’ sasaw jilajajj sirïtu .
Jupanakajj cheqapuniw nayat llakisipjjäna , awisajj regalonak kun apanipjjeri .
Jesusan cheqpach arkirinakapakiw ukham lurapjjaspa sasaw amuyirïta .
Braille qellqatanakampiw Bibliat yateqayäta .
Kuntï yatichapkitäna ukanak amuyayätwa , ukampis yaqhep yatichäwinakajj nayatak mayjänwa .
Sañäni , Diosajj cheqapunit nayat llakispacha sasin jisktʼasiyäta , ukat mayninakajj Diosjamarakit nayar munasipjjpachïtu sasins jisktʼasirakiyätwa .
Kunatsa Diosajj jan walinak ukhamak jaytaski uksa sum amuyarakiyäta , ukampis wali munasiri mä Awkirjam uñjañajj nayatak wali chʼamänwa .
*
Bibliat yatjjatasajj jukʼat jukʼatwa jan nayrjam amuyjjayätti .
Sañäni , tʼaqhesktan ukhajja , Diosajj chuym ustʼayasirakiwa .
Servirinakap tʼaqhesir uñjasajja , Jupajj akham siwa : ‘ Nayajj sumwa uñjta , kunjamtejj markajajj tʼaqhesiski ukjja , ukampis nayajj sum yatta tʼaqhesitanakapjja ’ sasa ( Éxodo 3 : 7 ) .
Jehová Diosajj kunja munasirisa uk yatisajja , Jupan munañap phoqañatakiw jakäwij katuyasiñ amtawayta .
Ukatwa 1998 maran Jehová Diosan Testigopjam bautisasjjta .
Utapar jakasiñatak katoqkitäna uka jilatampïsktwa
Mä mara qhepatjja , kawkhantï juykhunakar yatichaski ukaruw sarta , ukajj Escuintla sat cheqankiwa .
Ukan jakasir mä jilatajja , Acul sat cheqar tantachäwinakar sarañajj nayatak wali chʼamätap amuyasajj yanaptʼañ munitäna .
Tantachäwinakar puriñatakejj qollu qollunak pasañajänwa , kunjamtï nayar yatichiri Testigonakajj jutapjjerïkäna ukhama .
Yanaptʼañatakejja , uka jilatajj mä familiaruw jikjjatäna , jupanakajj Jehová Diosan Testigopapjjänwa , ukanwa jakasjjayäta , jupanakarakiw tantachäwir sarañatakis yanaptʼapjjetäna .
Jichhakamas ukan jakasiskaktwa , ukampis jupanakajj familiaparjamaw sum uñjapjjetu .
Cheqas kunjamsa tamajankir walja jilat kullakanakajj yanaptʼawayapjjetu , ukajj wali muspharkañawa .
Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj wali munasirïpjjewa , taqe ukanakaw cheqpach cristianonak taypinkatajj amuyayitu .
Nayrajj janis kunatak askïkirista , ni kuna suytʼäwinikirïstsa ukham amuyasiyäta , ukampis jichhajj kusisitaw jakasjjta .
Kunatsa juykhüpachäta sasin lupʼiñat sipansa , jaqenakar Bibliat yatiyañatakiw precursorjam irnaqtʼaskta .
Tamajansa irpir chuymanjamaw irnaqtʼaskta , yaqha tamanakarus arstʼir sararaktwa , awisajj jachʼa tantachäwinakansa arstʼaraktwa .
Ukanakatjja Jehová Diosar walpun yuspärta .
Braille qellqata Bibliampiw arstʼaskta
Pasïr 2010 maranjja , Escuela de Entrenamiento Ministerial satäkis ukaruw sarta ( jichhajj Diosan Reinopat Yatiyirinakataki Escuela satäjjewa ) ukajj El Salvador sat markanwa apasïna .
Uka escuelajj jilat kullakanakar sum yanaptʼañatakiw yanaptʼawayitu .
Ukar sarasajja , Jehová Diosajj wali askitsa uñjkitaspa , walsa nayar munaskitaspa ukham amuyasta , Jupajj munañap phoqasiñapatakejj khitirus yanaptʼakispawa .
Jesusajj “ katoqerit sipansa jukʼamp kusisiñaniw khititï churki ukajja ” sasaw säna .
Nayrajj janis kusisita jakasiñajj utjkaspa ukham amuyayäta , ukampis jichhajj wali kusisitaw jakasjjta , jichhakuchaw mayninakar yanaptʼirista .
Kunatsa Diosajj tʼaqhesiñanaka ukhamak uñchʼukiski uk jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ?
sat libron 11 jaljap uñjjattʼäta , ukajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan luratawa .
“ Diosar janiw uñtʼksnati . ”
( Alejandría markankir Filón sat filosofon aruparjama , jupasti nayrïr patak maranakan jakäna )
“ [ Diosasti ] janiw jayankkiti sapaqat jiwasanakatjja . ”
( Tarso markankir Saulo sat chachan aruparjama , jupasti nayrïr patak maranakan jakir Atenas markankir filosofonakaruw ukham säna )
UKA pä qellqatanakat ¿ kawkïris jumatak wali askejja ?
Waljaniw Saulo chachan arsutapar wali askit uñjapjje , juparojj apóstol Pablo sasinwa uñtʼasiraki .
Cheqas arunakapajj jaqenakan chuymaparuw purtʼi .
Biblianjja , walja chʼamañchtʼkir yaqha qellqatanakaw utjaraki .
Sañäni , Jesusajj mä mayisïwipanjja , arkirinakaparojj ‘ Diosar uñtʼapjjasmawa ukat bendicionaps katoqapjjarakismawa ’ sasaw säna .
Maysa toqetjja , walja filosofonakaw Filón sat chachjam amuyapjjaraki .
Jupanakajj janiw Diosar uñtʼksnati , Diosajj jan amuytʼkayawa sasaw sapjjäna .
Ukhamajja , ¿ kawkïris cheqäpacha ?
‘ Jaqenakajj janiw Diosat taqpachpun amuyapkaspati ’ sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Ukanakat mä qawqhajj akanakawa , utjatapa , amuyupa , yatiñapa , ukanakajj janiw kunampis tuptʼaskaspati , amuyaskaspasa ni yatjjataskaspasa , kunatejj taqe ukanakajj jaqenakan yatiñapat jilankiwa .
Ukampis janiw ukanakajj Diosar uñtʼañat jarkʼkistuti , antisas ukanakat lupʼiñajja , Jehová Diosar jukʼampi jakʼachasiñatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Jichhajj kuntï Diosat jan sum amuyksna ukanakat mä qawqha yatjjatañäni , ukat kawkïrinaksa amuysna ukanaksa yatjjatarakiñäniwa .
WIÑAY UTJATAPA .
Bibliajj “ wiñayatpacha , wiñayatakiw jumajj Diosätajja ” sasaw qhanañchi ( Salmo 90 : 2 ) .
Mä arunjja , Diosajj janiw qalltanïkisa ni tukuyanïkarakisa , Jupajj wiñayatakiw utjani .
Jaqenakatakejj “ Diosajj jachʼawa , janiw amuytʼañjamäkiti , janirakiw qawqha maranïkitejj uksa jaktʼksnati ” ( Job 36 : 26 ) .
Kunjamsa uk yatiñajj yanaptʼistu .
Diosar uñtʼañatak chʼamachasiñäni ukhajja , Jupajj wiñay jakañ churistani .
Jupatï jan wiñayatak jakkaspa ukhajja , ¿ kunjamarak uka arunak phoqaspasti ?
Cheqas ‘ wiñay jachʼa Reyikiw ’ uka arunak phoqaspa .
YATIÑ KANKAÑAPA .
Bibliajj Diosat akham yatichi “ yatiñ kankañapasti jan tukuskiriwa ” sasa . Ukhamasti Diosajj jaqenakat sipansa jukʼamp yatiñaniwa ( Isaías 40 : 28 ; 55 : 9 ) .
Ukatwa akham sasin apóstol Pablojj jisktʼpachäna : “ ¿ Khitirak Tatitun amtäwinakapsti amuytʼaspasti ? ¿ Khitirak Diosarusti yaticharakispasti ? ” sasa .
Kunjamsa uk yatiñajj yanaptʼistu .
Diosajj taqe jaqenakan mayisitap istʼi , ukhamasti Juparojj khitis kuna horasarus mayisikispawa ( Salmo 65 : 2 ) .
Inas maynejj walja lurañanïpachawa , janiw istʼkitaniti sasin ajjsarchispa , ukampis Jupajj mayisitanakas istʼiwa .
Diosajj mä jamachʼin jiwatapsa yatiwa , uka toqet Bibliajj akham sistuwa : “ Jumanakajj uka jiskʼa jamachʼinakat sipanjja wali jila alanïpjjtawa ” sasa .
KUNTÏ LURKI UKANAKA .
Bibliajj “ Diosan luratanakapa , ukhamaraki kuntï lurkani ukanakata ” janiw jaqenakajj amuyksnati sasaw qhanañchi ( Eclesiastés 3 : 11 ) .
Diosat janiw kunapachas taqpachpun yatkañäniti .
“ Kunja sumas Diosan yatiñ kankañapajja ” ukajj janiw yatjjatañjamäkiti .
Ukhampachasa , Diosajj khitinakatï Jupar taqe chuyma thaqapki ukanakar uk yatiyaspawa ( Amós 3 : 7 ) .
Diosan utjatapasa , amuyupasa , yatiñapasa , ukanakajj janiw kunampis tuptʼaskaspati , amuyaskaspasa ni yatjjataskaspasa
Kunjamsa uk yatiñajj yanaptʼistu .
Jumatï Biblia liyïta ukat yatjjatarakïta ukhajja , thakipatsa , Jupatsa jukʼamp yateqäta .
Ukampis Jupat yateqañajj janipuniw tukuskaniti .
Ukhamajj wiñayaw alajjpachankir Awkisat jukʼamp yateqaskakiñäni .
Kunjamtï yatjjataniwaytanjja , janiw Diosat taqpachpun amuyksnati , ukampis taqe ukanakajj janiw Diosajj janis uñtʼañjamäkaspa ukham sañ munkiti .
Biblianjja , walja yatichäwinakaw utji , ukanwa kunjamas Diosajj uk yatichistu .
Ukanakat mä qawqha uñjañäni :
DIOSAN SUTIPA .
‘ Nayätwa Jehová Tatitojja , ukarakiw sutijajja ’ sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi , ukhamajj Dios pachpaw sutip uchasïna .
Uka sutejja , 7.000 kutiw Biblian qellqat uñsti ( Isaías 42 : 8 ) .
Kunjamsa uk yatiñajj yanaptʼistu .
Jesusajj mayisïwipanjja , akham sasaw arkirinakapar yatichäna : “ Alajjpachankir nanakan Awkejja , sutimajj jachʼañchatäpan ” sasa .
Ukhamajj mayiskäta ukhajja , Diosar sutipat mayisïta .
Jehová Diosajj sutip wali askiti uñjapki ukanakarojj qhespiyaniwa .
DIOSAN UTJÄWIPA .
Bibliajj alajjpachampita aka Oraqempit parli . Alajjpachanjja , ajay cuerponi angelanakaw jakapjje , ukampis aka Oraqenjja , jañchi cuerponïpki ukanakaw jakapjjaraki .
Alajjpacha siski uka arut Bibliajj parlki ukhajja , kawkhantï Diosajj jakaski uka cheqat parlaski .
Ukhamasti Jehová Diosajj alajjpachanwa jakasi ( 1 Reyes 8 : 43 ) .
Kunjamsa uk yatiñajj yanaptʼistu .
Ukanak yatiñajja , Jehová Diosajj kunjam Diosas uk amuyañatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Diosajj janis taqe cheqan jikjjataskchejja , Jupajj cheqapuniw utjaski .
Ukampis alajjpachat taqe kun uñjani “ janiw kunas Diosan luratanakapatjja jupat imantaskaspati ” .
KUNJAM DIOSASA .
Jehová Diosajj kunjam suma Diosasa uk Bibliajj sum yatichistu .
Sañäni , “ Diosajj munasiñawa ” , janiw kʼarisirïkiti , cheqapar uñjiriwa , khuyapayasiri , sinttʼasiri ukat janiw jankʼaki colerasirïkiti .
Ukampis Jupar ajjsarapki ukanakampejj wali sum apasi ( Salmo 25 : 14 ) .
Kunjamsa uk yatiñajj yanaptʼistu .
¡ Jumajj Jehová Diosan amigopäsmawa !
Diosat jukʼamp yateqaskakïta ukhajja , Jupamp wali sum apasïta , ukatjja Biblian yaqhep sarnaqäwinakapsa jukʼamp sum amuyjjarakïta .
Jehová Diosajj kunjamasa uk Bibliajj sum qhanañchistu .
Ukhamajj Jupar uñtʼsnawa , Jupajj amigosañwa muni .
Arupajj akham sistuwa : “ Jumatejj jupar thaqtätajja , jupasti jumarojj jikjjatayasïtamwa ” sasa ( 1 Crónicas 28 : 9 ) .
Jiwasatï Biblia liyiñäni , ukhamarak lupʼirakiñäni ukhajja , Jehová Diosar sum uñtʼañäni . Ukatjja , Jupajj jiwasanakar “ jakʼachasirakiniwa ” .
Jumatï Biblia liyïta ukat yatjjatarakïta ukhajja , thakipatsa , Jupatsa jukʼamp yateqäta , ukampis Jupat yateqañajj janipuniw tukuskaniti
Inas jumajj akham sasin amuysta : ‘ Janiw nayajj kunsa Diosat yatkti , ukhamajj janiw Jupan amigopäkirïsti ’ sasa .
Ukampis akham amuytʼañäni : ¿ mä doctoran amigopäñatakejj doctoräñamat wakisispa ?
¡ Janiwa !
Inas uka doctoran wali suma amigopajj yaqha irnaqäwinïskchi .
Amigopatï doctorar sum uñtʼchi ukat kunanakas jupar kusisiyi , ukat jan kusisiykaraki ukanak yatirakchi ukhajja , jupanakajj wali suma amigöpjjaspawa .
Jiwasampejj ukhamarakiw pasi , jiwasatï Diosar kunas kusisiyi ukat kunas jan kusisiykaraki ukanak yatiñäni ukhajja , Jupamp wali sumarak apasiñäni , cheqas ukanak yatiñaw amigopäñatak munasi .
Diosar janiw uñtʼksnati sasin yatichañat sipansa , Bibliajj kunjamsa Diosar uñtʼsna uk wali qhan yatichistu .
¿ Jumajj Diosan amigopäñ munasmati ?
Jehová Diosan Testigonakapaw Bibliat yatichiristam .
Ukhamajj mayan visitir jutapkani ukhaw jupanakampi parlasma , jan ukajj Internetan jw.org sat cheqaruw mantasma .
¿ Kunjamsa Diosajj pisin jakasiñ chhaqtayani ?
Sapa maraw walja millón jaqenakajj pisin jakasipjjatap layku jiwarapjje .
Qamir markanakas utjkchejja , walja jaqenakaw pisin jakasipjje .
Bibliajj pisin jakasiñajj nayratpachaw utjäna sasaw qhanañchi .
( Juan 12 : 8 liytʼäta . )
Pisin jakasiñ chhaqtayañatakejja , oraqpach apnaqer mä gobiernow munasi .
Uka gobiernojja , taqenir mä kikpak uñjañapa ukat guerranaksa chhaqtayañaparakiwa , cheqas ukanakaw jilapart pisin jakasiñ utjayi .
Diosaw ukham apnaqer gobierno uttʼayani .
( Daniel 2 : 44 liytʼäta . )
Diosajj Jesucristo Yoqaparuw aka Oraqe apnaqañapataki uttʼayi ( Salmo 2 : 4 - 8 ) .
Jesusaw pisinkirinakar yanaptʼani , jan walinaksa , tʼaqhesiñanaksa chhaqtayarakini .
( Salmo 72 : 8 , 12 - 14 liytʼäta . )
‘ Sumankañan Jilïripajjaʼ , mä arunjja , Jesucristojj sumankañwa aka Oraqjjar apanini .
Ukhamasti , taqenitakiw manqʼañas jilarkir utjani , taqenirakiw utani , mä suma irnaqäwini ukham jakasjjañäni .
( Isaías 9 : 6 , 7 ; 65 : 21 - 23 liytʼäta . )
Jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ? sat libron 8 jaljap uñjjattʼäta , ukajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan luratawa
Internetanjja jw.org / ay cheqanwa utjaraki
BIBLIAN EWJJTʼANAKAPAJJ SUM JAKASIÑATAKIW YANAPTʼI
BIBLIAJJ AKHAM SIWA : “ Jumanak purajj [ . . . ] , maynit maynirus perdonasipjjarakim jan wali lurasipjjsta ukapachajja .
Kunjämtï jumanakarojj [ ‘ Jehová Diosajj ’ , NM ] perdonapjjtamjja , ukhamarak jumanakajj perdonapjjam ” sasa .
¿ Kamsañsa muni ?
Bibliarjamajja , juchajj mä manumpi sasiwa , perdonañajj uka manu phoqañampi sasirakiwa .
Bibliat mä qellqatajj “ perdonaña ” siski uka arut akham qhanañchi : ‘ Griego arurjamajja , “ maynin manup armasjjaña , jan mayampitaki amtasjjaña ” sañwa munaspa ’ sasa .
Ukatwa perdonkañäni ukhajj jan mayampitaki armasjjañasa .
Ukampis perdonañajj jan wali luratapajj janis kunäkaspa ukham janiw sañ munkiti .
Jan wali luratapajj chuymsa ustʼaykchistojja , janiw chuymasar imjjasiñasäjjeti .
¿ Uka ewjjtʼajj yanaptʼistaspati ?
Pantjasir jaqjamajj taqeniw jan walinak lurtanjja .
Ukatwa mayninakar perdonañajj wakisi , kunatejj mayninakan jiwasar perdonañap munarakiñäniwa .
Perdonasajj jiwasas askinak jikjjatarakiñäniwa .
¿ Kuna askinaksa jikjjatsna ?
Jiwasatï jan perdonkañäni , ukhamarak colerata , chuymas ustʼata sarnaqaskakiñäni ukhajja , jan waliruw purtʼassna .
Ukham sarnaqañajj janiw kusisit jakasiykistaspati , llakimpiw aynachtʼsna , awisajj usuntañar kunaw purtʼassna .
Uka toqet Yoichi Chida sat doctorampi , Andrew Steptoe sat Psicología toqet yatichirimpejja , akham sasaw mä qellqatan ( Journal of the American College of Cardiology ) qhanañchapjje : “ Colerat sarnaqañajja , chuyma may akatjamat saytʼañaruw puriyaspa ( cardiopatía coronaria ) ” sasa .
Perdonañajj kuna askinaksa apanispa uk jichhajj amuytʼarakiñäni .
Kunapachatï mayninakar jan wali luratanakapat perdontan ukhajja , sumankañasa , mä wawak jakasiñas utjiwa , ukhamarak mayninakampis sumarak apastan .
Ukampis jukʼampi wakiskirejja , Jehová Diosat yateqasitaswa uñachtʼaytanjja , Jupasti juchapat arrepentisirinakarojj perdoniwa , ukham lurañaswa jiwasat suyaraki .
