Diosan Reinopan uttʼayasitapatjja patak maranakäjjewa
JANA 26
▪ Wawanakamar Jehová Diosaru serviñ yatichapjjam
▪ Qʼajjo wayn tawaqöpki uka wawanakamar sum uywapjjam
Jehová Diosajja , awk taykanakajj wawanakapar sum uywapjjaspa Jupar munasiñsa yatichapjjaspa ukwa muni .
Aka pä yatichäwinakajja , Jesusat yateqasisin wawanakapar munasipjjatapa , altʼat chuymanïpjjatapa , kunjamas wawanakapajj jikjjatasipjje uk amuyapjjatap uñachtʼayañatakiw yanaptʼani .
▪ Jehová Diosajj munasiriwa
▪ Jaqe masisarojj jiwas kikparjam munasipjjañäni
Nayrïr yatichäwejja , Jehová Diosajj kunja munasirisa , kunjamsa uka munasiñap uñachtʼayistu ukwa qhanañchi .
Payïr yatichäwisti , kunjamsa jaqe masisaru munasiñ uñachtʼaysna ukwa qhanañcharaki .
▪ Diosan Reinopan uttʼayasitapatjja patak maranakäjjewa
Diosan Reinopan uttʼayasitapat patak maranakaw pasawayjje , uka maranakan kunjamsa yatiyasiwayi , jilat kullakanakajj kunanakampisa , kunjam toqenakatsa , kunjamsa Diosajj yatiyapjjañapatak wakichtʼawayi ukanakwa qhanañchi .
13 Aka revista liytʼirinakan jisktʼäwinakapa
14 Diosaw taqe kuns churistu yuspärapjjañäni
31 ¿ Kunanakas imatäski ?
NAYRÏR JANA : Tamanak tumptʼir jilatampi walja precursor especialanakampejja , mä barcotwa Amazonas sat jachʼa jawirnamasa uka jakʼankir yaqha jawirnamas yatiyirejj sarapjje
