3 Sarnaqäwi : Jehová Diosaw jupat jan jitheqtañatakejj yanaptʼawayitu
8 Abrahamajj Diosan amigopänwa
13 Diosan amigonakapat yateqasipjjañäni
Jehová Diosampi jukʼamp sum apasiñatakiw aka pä yatichäwinakajj yanaptʼistani .
Nayrïr yatichäwinjja , Abraham chachatwa yatjjatañäni .
Payïr yatichäwinsti Rut , Ezequías ukhamarak Jesusan María taykapatwa yatjjatarakiñäni .
21 Jehová Diosat janipun jitheqtañäniti
26 Diosat jan jitheqtiri nayra servirinakat yateqasipjjañäni
Aka pä yatichäwinakanjja , David reyimpita ukhamarak uka tiempon jakir chachanakampitwa yatjjataskañäni .
Jupanakan sarnaqäwinakapat yatjjatañajja , jan walinakan uñjaskasin Jehová Diosat jan jitheqtañatakiw yanaptʼistani .
