BIBLIAT YATJJATASAW NAYRA JAKÄWINAKAPJJA JAYTAWAYAPJJE
Adrián de la Fuente Sat jilatan arsutaparjama
NASÏWIP MARA : 1974
MARKA : MÉXICO
NAYRA JAKÄWIPA : NUWASIR JAN WALI WAYNÄNWA
Ciudad Mante sat cheqanwa nasta , ukajja Tamaulipas ( México ) markan jikjjatasi .
Ukanjja jaqenakajj munasiri ukat wajjtʼasirïpjjewa .
Ukampisa jan walinaka lurir jaqenakaw uka cheqan utjarakïna , ukatwa ukan jakañajj chʼamakïna .
Kimsa jilanakanïtwa , jupanakat nayajj taypirïtwa .
Tatajampi mamajampejja , Católica Iglesiat bautisapjjetäna ukat iglesiansa qʼochurakiyätwa .
Diosaw juchañchitani ukhamarak ninar phichantitani sasaw ajjsarayäta , ukatwa Diosan munañap lurañatak chʼamachasiyäta .
Phesqa maranïkayäta ukhajja , tatajajj utatwa sarjjäna .
Ukajj wal llakisiyitäna , jupar wal munasipjjayäta , ukatwa kunatsa jaytapjjetäna uk jan amuykayätti .
Ukhat aksarojja , nanakar manqʼa churañatakisa ukat sum uywañatakisa mamajajj walja horanakaw trabajïna .
Niyakejjay mamajajj jan utankchïntejja , janiw escuelar sarirïkti ukat jilïr waynanakampiw chikachasirïta .
Jupanakajja jan wali arunak parlaña , fumaña , lunthataña ukat nuwasiñ yatichapjjetäna .
Jaqenakar apnaqañajj nayatak walikjamakïnwa , ukatwa boxeo , lucha libre , artes marciales ukat armanak apnaqañ yateqayäta .
Wali phiru jan ukajj qhoru waynäyätwa ukat walja kutiw jan walinakan uñjasirïta .
Awisajja wilararaw callen jaqosiskirïta , ukat jiwatäjjpachawa sasaw amuyapjjerïna .
Hospitalar apasajja mamajajj ¡ wali llakitaw uñjaspachäna !
Tunka sojjtani maranïkayäta ukhajja , Jorge amigojaw utar visittʼapjjetäna .
Jupajj Jehová Diosan Testigopäjjänwa , ukat jumanakamp parlañ munta sasaw sapjjetäna , Bibliampiw kunarus creyïna uk qhanañchapjjetäna .
Janiw nayajj Biblia leyirïkayätti , ukatwa Diosan sutipa ukat amtanakap yateqañajj wali askïna .
Jorgejj Bibliat yatichapjjäma sasaw sapjjetäna , nanakasti iyaw sapjjayätwa .
Nina aqaskir mä lugaran jan utjatap yateqañajja , wal chuymachtʼitäna ( Salmo 146 : 4 ; Eclesiastés 9 : 5 ) .
Ukhat aksarojj janiw Diosajj jan sinttʼasirïkaspas ukham uñj - jjayätti , antisas wali munasir awkirjamaw Jupar uñj - jjayäta , taqenis sum jakassna ukwa Jupajj muni .
Bibliat yatjjatasajja , jakäwejjan walja mayjtʼäwinak lurañajjaw wakisïna .
Janiw qhoruñajajjänti ukhamarak altʼat chuymanïñajjänwa .
1 Corintios 15 : 33 qellqataw ukatakejj yanaptʼawayitu , ukanjja ‘ jan wali jaqenakampi sarnaqañajj suma luräwinak chhaqayi ’ sasaw yatichi .
Jan walinaka jaytañatakejja , jan wali lurir jaqenakampejj janiw chikachasjjañajjänti .
Jan ukasti cristian taman suma amigonak jikjjatañatakiw chʼamachasiyäta . Jupanakajja Bibliarjamaw jan waltʼäwinak askichapjje .
Romanos 12 : 17 - 19 qellqatanakaw yanaptʼarakitäna , ukansti akham siwa : “ Janiraki ñanqhat ñanqha kuttʼayapjjamti [ . . . ] .
Kawkikamatejj puedepkta ukakamajj taqenimpis jumanakajj sumankapjjam .
Munat jilatanaka , jumanak purajj jan ukhamat ukham lurjasipjjamti [ . . . ] .
Qellqatanjja siwa : ‘ Nayaruw waktʼitu mutuyaskañajja , nayarakiw phoqhaskäjja , siw Tatitojja ’ ” sasa .
Jehová Diosaruw jan walinak askichañajj waktʼi , Jupaw horasapar askichani uk amuyañatakiw uka qellqatanakajj yanaptʼawayitu .
Ukhamasti jukʼat jukʼatwa jan walinak jaytjjayäta .
Kunas mä arumajj utajar kuttʼankasajj pasitäna uk janiw armkäti .
Walja waynanakaw nuwjapjjetäna , jupanakajja callen jan walinak lurir mä grupotäpjjänwa , nayrajj janiw jupanakamp sum apasipkayätti .
Jupanakat maynejja , ati patat nuwantasajj akham sitänwa : “ ¡ Arjjatasimaya ! ”
sasa . Uka pachajja , ‘ Jehová jan ukhamat ukhama kuttʼayañatak yanaptʼita ’ sasaw mayisiyäta .
Chuymajan wal jupanakar nuwjañ munayäta , ukampis janiw ukham lurkayätti , jan ukasti tʼijukamaw utar sarjjayäta .
Qhepürojja , nuwjkitäna uka waynaw thaki sapak jutaskäna , walpun colertʼasta ukat nuwjañ munayäta .
Ukampis Jehová Diosaruw ukat toqet mayampi mayisirakiyäta .
Uka waynajja jakʼachasisin akham sitänwa : “ Kunatï masür arumajj paski ukat pampachtʼita .
Nayajj jumjamaw sum jakasiñ munarakta , Bibliat yatjjatañ munta ” sasa .
Walikpun ukhamat ukham jan kuttʼaykatätti sasaw kusisiyäta , qhepatsti jupajj Bibliat yateqañ qalltäna .
Familiajajja janiw Bibliat yateqjjänti , ukampis nayajj kuntï lurañ munkayäta uk amtjjayätwa , ukjja janiw kunasa ni khitis mayjtʼaykasapänti .
Jehová Diosan markapaw jan walinak armañatakisa ukat kʼuchiki jakasiñatakisa yanaptʼitani sasaw amuyarakiyäta .
Jan walinakjja jukʼat jukʼatwa jaytawayjjta ukat 1991 maranwa Jehová Diosan Testigopjam bautisasjjayäta .
Nayrajj mayninakar jan waltʼayiri wali phiru jaqëyätwa , Diosan Arupaw jan ukham jaqëjjañatak yanaptʼawayitu .
Jichhajja Biblian sumankaña churir arunakap jaqenakar yatichañatakiw chʼamachasjjta .
Jehová Diosarojja , sapürunjamaw aka qhepa 23 maranakajj yupaychaskta .
México markan Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan sucursalapajj utjki ukansa mä qawqha maranak sirviwayaraktwa .
Ukanjja Claudia sutini mä kullakaruw uñtʼawayta , jupajj wali qʼapha tawaqönwa , ukhamajj jupampiw 1999 maran jaqechasjjayäta .
Jupar jan jitheqtas servir mä suma warmi churatapatjja , Jehová Diosaruw wal yuspärta .
Esposajampejj México markan oqaranakaru ukhamarak amutunakaruw mä taman yanaptʼawayapjjarakta . Jupanakar Jehová Diosar uñtʼapjjañapatak yanaptʼañajj wali sumawa .
Qhepatjja Belice markaruw Diosan arunakap yatiyir sarapjjarakiyäta .
Uka markanjja kunatï jakañatak munaski ukanakampiw jakasipjjta , ukampis wali kusisitaw jakasipjjta .
¡ Ukham jakasiñajja wali sumapuniwa !
Tiempompejja , wasitatwa mamitajajj Bibliat yatjjatjjäna ukat bautisasjjäna .
Jilïr jilajasa esposapas ukhamarak wawanakapasa Jehová Diosan Testigoparuw tukjjapjjarakïna .
Trabajojjan Diosan arunakapat parlkayäta uka irnaqer masinakajatsa mä qawqhanejj Diosaruw servisipkaraki .
Yaqhep familiaranakajajja , jan wali jaqëpjjatapatjja jiwataw uñjasipjjäna .
Janitï nayra jakäwejj jaytkiriskayäta ukhajj jiwataw uñjasirakiriskayäta .
Jehová Diosarojj walpun yuspärta , Jupaw juparu , markaparu uñtʼañatak yanaptʼawayitu , servirinakapasti pacienciampi ukat munasiñampiw Diosan aruparjam sarnaqañ yatichawayapjjarakitu .
¿ JUMAJJ KAMSASMASA ?
Jan walinakajja taqeniruw llakisiyistaspa .
Ukhamajj ¿ kawkhansa yanaptʼa ukat chuymachtʼäwi jikjjatsna ?
Biblia akham siwa : “ Jupaw jiwasar khuyapayasir Awkisajja , ukhamarak chuymachirisasa . Taqe tʼaqhesiñanakasanwa Diosajj chuymachistu ” sasa .
Aka revistajja kunjamsa Diosajj chuymachtʼistu ukwa qhanañchaski .
3 ¿ Kunas mayninakamp sum apasiñatak yanaptʼistaspa ?
Pantjasirïtas laykojja , mayninakampi chuym ustʼayasiñajj utjapuniwa .
Kunjamsa Biblian aski yatichäwinakapajj jan waltʼäwinak askichañatak yanaptʼistaspa ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjataskañäni .
8 “ Taqe akapachankir jaqenakar yatiyir sarapjjam , nayar arkir tukuyapjjam ”
Jesusajj Mateo 24 : 14 qellqatan arskäna uka arunakarjamajja , ¿ kunatsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapakiw yatiyasipki sasin sissna ?
¿ “ Jaqe katuri tukuyapjjäma ” sasin Jesusajj siskäna ukajj kamsañsa muni ? Ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjataskañäni .
13 ¿ Kunas suma amtar puriñatakejj yanaptʼiristam ?
¿ Jiwasatak walikjamäki ukarjamakit kuns amttanjja ?
Mayninakarojja , ¿ ‘ kunsa nayäsma ukajj lurasma ’ sasin jisktʼirïtanti ?
Aka yatichäwinjja , kunatsa Diosar kusisiykir amtanakar puriñajj wakisi uka toqetwa qhanañchaski .
18 ¿ Bibliajj jakäwiman yanaptʼaskaktamti ?
Yaqhepanakatakejja , janïr bautisaskasin jan wali luräwinak jaytañajj janiw sinti chʼamäkänti , ukampis suma cristianöñatakejj chʼamachasisipkakiwa .
¿ Jumarojj ukajj pasaraktamti ?
Kunatsa ukhamäpacha , kunjamsa Bibliajj suma cristianöñatak yanaptʼistaspa ukaw aka yatichäwin qhanañchasiski .
23 Diosajj churkistu uka yanaptʼanakat sum yatjjatapjjañäni
Kunat amuyasiñasas wakisi ukwa aka yatichäwejj qhanañchi .
Ukar purtʼassna ukhajja , janiw qellqatanakasat yatjjatjjsnati .
¿ Kunsa ukar jan purtʼasiñatakejj lurañasa ?
¿ Kunjamsa Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakatsa , Biblian yatichäwinakapatsa yatjjatsna ?
28 ¿ Kunanakas imatäski ?
30 Aka revista liytʼirinakan jisktʼäwinakapa
“ Sumankañan jumanak purajj jakapjjarakim ” .
39 , 77 QʼOCHUNAKA
Maynimp sumankthapiñatakejja , ¿ kunsa Jesusajj ewjjtʼäna ?
Maynimpi mä jan waltʼäwi janïr askichkasajja , ¿ kunanaksa jisktʼasiñasa ?
Mateo 18 : 15 - 17 qellqatan jikjjataski uka ewjjtʼanakajja , ¿ kunjamsa mä jan waltʼäwi askichañatak yanaptʼistaspa ? 1 , 2 .
Génesis libronjja , ¿ khitinakan jan waltʼayasitapatsa parli , ukat kunatsa ukanakajj Biblian qellqata ?
BIBLIAN qellqatäki uka chachanakasa warminakasa jupanakat yaqhepajj jan waltʼayasipjjerïnwa , ¿ uk amuytʼirïtati ?
Génesis libron nayrïr jaljanakapanjja , jupanakat mä qawqhanitwa parli . Sañäni : Caín chachajj Abel jilaparuw jiwayäna ( Gén .
4 : 3 - 8 ) ; Lamec chachasti mä waynan nuwjatajj uka waynaruw jiwayäna ( Gén .
4 : 23 ) ; Abraham ( Abram ) chachan uwij awatirinakapajj Lot sobrinopan awatirinakapampiw jan waltʼayasipjjäna ( Gén . 13 : 5 - 7 ) ; Agar warmisti , Sara ( Sarai ) warmiruw jiskʼachäna , Sarasti Abraham chachapatakiw colerasirakïna ( Gén .
16 : 3 - 6 ) ; Ismaelajj taqenimpiw jan waltʼayasïna , taqenirakiw jupa conträpjjäna ( Gén .
16 : 12 ) . Kunatsa mayninakamp sum apasiñatak chʼamachasiñasa uk amuyañasatakiw taqe ukanakajj Biblian qellqasiwayi .
Ukatsti , kunjamsa mayninakamp sumankthapsna uksa amuytʼayarakistuwa .
Jupanakajj jiwasjam pantjasirïpjjänwa , ukhamasti sarnaqäwinakapat liytʼañajja , kunjamsa mayninakamp suma apasiñatakejj chʼamachasipjjäna uk amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Mayninakamp sum apasipjjatap yatisajja , jiwasajj mayninakamp sum apasiraksnawa .
Cheqansa , jupanakjam jikjjatasisajj kunsa lurañasa , kunsa jan lurañasäkaraki ukwa yateqsna .
¿ Kunsa aka yatichäwin yatjjatañäni ?
Jehová Diosan servirinakapajj kunatsa ukat kunjamsa jan waltʼäwinak askichañasa ukwa aka yatichäwin yatjjatañäni .
Ukatjja jan waltʼäwinak askichañatakisa , mayninakampi ukhamarak Jehová Diosamp sum apasiñatakisa , Biblian kawkïr ewjjtʼanakapas yanaptʼistaspa uksa yatjjatarakiñäniwa .
¿ Kunjam amuyunïpjjes akapachankir jaqenakajja , ukat kunjamansa akapachajj uñjasi ?
Supayan utjatapatwa jan waltʼayasiñanakasa , chʼajjwañanakas utji .
Sapa mayniw kunatï walïki , jan walïkaraki uk amtaspa sasaw Supayajj Edén jardinan säna ( Gén .
3 : 1 - 5 ) . Ukham amuyatapatwa jan walinakajj utji .
Jaqenakajj munañaparjamakiw sarnaqapjje , jachʼa jachʼaw tukupjje , jupanakatakikiw taqe kuns munapjje , mayninakat sipans jukʼampïñ munapjjaraki .
Ukham sarnaqasaw Supayan amuyatapajj walikïkaspas ukham uñachtʼayapjje .
Supayajja , mayninakat llakisiñat sipansa , askipak thaqherinakaw amuytʼasirïpjjatap uñachtʼayapjje sasaw amuyi .
Ukhamatwa chʼajjwañanakasa , jan waltʼayasiñanakas utji .
Ukatwa Bibliajj akham qhanañchi : “ Khititejj mäki kunatsa coleraski ukajja , nuwasiñanakwa utjayi , waljanakan pantjasiraki ” sasa ( Pro . 29 : 22 ) .
¿ Kunsa Jesusajj jan waltʼäwinak askichañatak ewjjtʼäna ?
Jesusajja , munañanakap maysar apanukusin sumankañ thaqhapjjañapatakiw arkirinakapar ewjjtʼäna .
Wali Uñtʼat Arstʼäwipanjja , kunjamsa jan waltʼäwinak askichapjjaspa uka toqetwa Jesusajj arkirinakapar ewjjtʼäna .
Llampʼu chuymanïpjjañapataki , sumankañ thaqhapjjañapataki , kunanakatï colerasiñar apkaspa uk apanukupjjañapataki , jan waltʼäwinak jankʼak askichapjjañapataki , uñisirinakapar munasipjjañapatakiw ewjjtʼäna .
6 , 7 .
1 ) ¿ Kunatsa jan waltʼäwinak jankʼak askichañasa ? 2 ) ¿ Kunsa Diosan servirinakapajj jisktʼasiñasa ?
Mayninakamp sum apasiñatak jan chʼamachasksna ukajja , Jehová Diosar mayisitasasa , tantachäwinakar saratasasa , yatiyatasasa , mä arunjja Diosar yupaychatasajj inamayakïspawa .
Jiwasatï jaqe masisan pantjasitanakap jan perdonksna ukhajja , janiw Jehová Diosan amigopäksnati ( Lucas 11 : 4 ; Efesios 4 : 32 liytʼañataki ) .
Mayninakan pantjasitanakap perdonañatakisa , jupanakamp sum apasiñatakisa chʼamachasisktanti janicha uk sum amuytʼañasawa .
Ukatjja , akham jisktʼasiñasarakiwa : “ ¿ Jilat kullakanakan pantjasitanakap perdonañajj nayatak chʼamakiti ?
Chuym ustʼayapkchitu ukasa ¿ jupanakampi Diosar servisajj kusisitätti ? ” sasa .
Jehová Diosajja , mayninakar perdonapjjaspa ukwa servirinakapat muni .
Mayninakar perdonañatï jiwasatak chʼamakïchi ukhajja , Jehová Diosaruw uka toqet mayisiñasa .
Jupajja , mayisitasar istʼistaniwa , mayktan uksa churarakistaniwa .
8 , 9 .
¿ Kunsa chuym ustʼayapjjestu ukhajj lurañasa ?
Taqeniw pantjasirïtanjja . Ukhamasti mayninakajj arsutampisa , luratampisa chuym ustʼayapjjestaniwa ( Ecl . 7 : 20 ; Mat . 18 : 7 ) .
Ukhaman uñjasisajja , ¿ kunsa lursna ?
Mä kutejja , mä kullakajj pä jilataruw parltʼäna .
Kunjamtï kullakajj parlkäna uk istʼasajja , jupanakat maynïrejj chuym wal ustʼayasïna .
Kullakajj sarjjäna ukhajja , chuyma ustʼat jilatajj kullak contraw jan walinak parläna .
Maynïri jilatajja , kunjamsa uka kullakajj jan walinakan uñjaskasajj Diosar 40 maranak serviwayi ukwa amtayäna . Ukatsti akham sarakïnwa : ‘ Kullakajj janiw chuyma ustʼayañ amtampi ukham siskpachätamti ’ sasa .
Chuym ustʼayasir jilatajja , sum amuytʼasajj akham sänwa : “ Kuntï siskta ukajj cheqawa ” sasa .
Ukatsti kullakan ukham parlatapsa armjjarakïnwa .
¿ Kunsa ukat yateqsna ?
Mayninakajj kun lurasinsa chuym ustʼayapjjestani ukhajja , kunsa lurañäni uk sapa mayniw amtjjañasa .
Ukampis munasirïtasat perdonañäniwa ( Proverbios 10 : 12 ; 1 Pedro 4 : 8 liytʼañataki ) .
Ukham luratasjja , Jehová Diosajj sum uñji ( Pro . 19 : 11 ; Ecl . 7 : 9 ) .
Ukhamasti , maynejj jan munasiñampi , jan ukajj jan respetomp uñjkistu ukhajja , akham jisktʼasiñasawa : “ ¿ Janis kunäkaspa ukham uñjiristti ?
¿ Jan wal luratapat lupʼiskakiñajäspati ? ”
sasa . 1 ) Lucía kullakat jan walinak parlapkäna ukhajja , ¿ kunjamsa jupajj qalltan jikjjatasïna ?
2 ) ¿ Biblian kawkïr ewjjtʼapas kullakar yanaptʼäna ?
Maynejj arunakampi chuyma ustʼayistaspa ukhajja , janis kunäkaspa ukham amuyañajj chʼamakïspawa .
Amuytʼañatakejj Lucía sat mä precursorat parltʼañäni .
Yaqhep jilat kullakanakajja , kunjamsa yatiyañatakisa , kun lurañatakis tiempo apstʼasïna uk uñjasajj jan wal parlapjjäna .
Uk yatisasti kullakajj chuyma wal ustʼayasïna , ukatwa experienciani jilatanakamp parltʼäna .
Lucía kullakajj siwa : “ Kuntï mayninakajj parlapki uka toqet jan sinti llakisiñatakejja , Bibliarjam ewjjtʼapkitäna ukaw yanaptʼawayitu , ukatsti kunjamsa Jehová Diosajj uñjitu uk amuyañatakis yanaptʼawayituwa ” sasa .
Kullakarojja , Mateo 6 : 1 - 4 ( liytʼañataki ) qellqataw chʼamañchtʼawayaraki .
Uka tʼaqanakajja , Jehová Diosatakjam sarnaqañapajj kunja askisa uk amuyañapatakiw kullakar yanaptʼäna .
Kullakajj siwa : “ Yatiyatajat jan walinaksa mayninakajj parlapkchejja , Jehová Diosan munañap lurañataki chʼamachasisajj kusisitaw jikjjatasta ” sasa .
Lucía kullakarojja , ukham amuyañaw mayninakan parlatanakapajj janis kunäkaspa ukham uñjañatak yanaptʼäna .
11 , 12 . 1 ) Mä jilatasa jan ukajj mä kullakasa jiwas conträtap amuystan ukhajja , ¿ kunsa lurañasa ?
2 ) Abrahamajj sobrinopamp jan waltʼäwi askichkäna ukatjja , ¿ kunsa yateqsna ?
( 3 janankir dibujo uñjjattʼam ) .
“ Taqeniw walja pantjasïwinak lurtan ” .
Amuytʼañataki , mä jilataru jan ukajj kullakaru arunakamampi , jan ukajj luratanakamampi chuym ustʼayatam amuyasma ukhajja , ¿ kunsa lurasma ?
Jesusajj sänwa : “ Jumatejj altararu ofrenda apkasina amtassta jilamajj mä kunatsa juma conträtapjja , jumajj uka ofrendama altar nayraqatar jaytawayasinjja , jilamampi sumankthapiri saram , ukatsti kuttanim uka ofrendam altaran churañataki ” sasa .
Jesusan uka arunakaparjamajja , chuym ustʼaykistu uka jilatampi , jan ukajj kullakampiw parltʼañasa .
Ukampis janiw jilatana jan ukajj kullakan juchap uñtʼayañatakejj parlañasäkiti , jan ukasti jupampi sumankthapiñ amtampiw parltʼañasa .
Cheqansa , jilat kullakanakasampi sumankañaw taqe kunat sipans jukʼamp wakiskirejja .
Abraham chachampi Lot sobrinopampejja , jukʼamp jan walinakaru janïr purtʼasisaw jan waltʼäwinakap askichapjjäna .
Panpachaniw uwijanakanïpjjäna .
Uwij awatirinakapajj jupanakkamaw chʼajjwapjjäna , inas awatipjjañapäkäna uka oraqjjat chʼajjwapjjchïna .
Sumankañatakejja , Abrahamajj akham sasaw sobrinopar säna : ‘ Kawki cheqarus sarjjañ munta uk ajllisim ’ sasa ( Gén .
13 : 1 , 2 , 5 - 9 ) . Abrahamajj munañap thaqhañat sipansa sumankañwa thaqhäna .
Ukajj jiwasatak wali yateqaskayawa .
Abrahamajja , ¿ ukham luratapat jan walinti uñjasïna ?
Janiwa .
Sobrinopampi jan waltʼayasipkäna ukhat mä qawqha tiemporojja , Jehová Diosajj wal bendisïma sasaw Abrahamar säna ( Gén .
13 : 14 - 17 ) . Diosajja , jan waltʼäwinak sumat askichirinakarusa , Biblian ewjjtʼanakaparjam sarnaqerinakarusa , janiw wiñayatak jan waltʼäwin uñjasiykaniti .
1 ) Jachʼa tantachäwin mä departamento sarayiri jilatajja , ¿ kunsa mä jilatan jan parlañ munatapat luräna ?
2 ) ¿ Kunsa uka experienciat yateqsna ?
Jichha tiempon Diosar serviri mä jilatat parltʼañäni .
Juparojja , mä jachʼa tantachäwin mä departamento sarayañapatakiw uttʼayapjjäna .
Mä urojja , uka jilatajj yaqha jilataruw yanaptʼa mayiñatak telefonot jawsäna .
Uka jilatasti janiw istʼañ munkänti telefonopsa jiwayasïnwa .
Amuyatajja , nayrïr sarayiri jilatampiw chuym ustʼatäna .
Jawskäna uka jilatajja , janis kunäkaspa ukhamsa uñjkchïnjja , mä hora pasatat wasitampiw jawsäna . Jupanakajj janiw uñtʼasipkänti , ukhamajj jan waltʼäwi askichañatakejj jikisipjjañapaw wakisïna .
Ukatwa mä semana qhepat mä Tantachasiñ Utan jikisipjjäna .
Ukansti , oración lurasajj mä horaw parlapjjäna .
Ukatsti , kunatsa chuyma ustʼatäna uksa jilatar yatiyarakïnwa .
Departamento sarayiri jilatasti , jupar sum istʼasajj Bibliatwa mä qawqha qellqatanak liytʼarapïna .
Ukhamatwa jan waltʼäwi askichapjjäna , jilatas departamento sarayirirojj yanaptʼjjarakïnwa .
Jichhajja , kunjamsa departamento sarayirejj pacienciampi ukhamarak munasiñamp jupar istʼäna uk amtapuniwa .
14 , 15 . 1 ) Mateo 18 : 15 - 17 qellqatan jikjjataski uka ewjjtʼanakajja , ¿ kuna jan walinak askichañatakis yanaptʼistaspa ?
2 ) Maynejj kuna jan wals luristani ukajja ¿ kunanaksa askichañatakejj lurañasa , ukat kuna amtampis ukanak lurañasa ?
Maynimp jan waltʼayasiña utjani ukhajja , jan khitir yatiyasaw jan waltʼayasktan ukampejj askichañasa .
Ukampis awisajja , irpir chuymaninakar yatiyañaw wakisispa ( Mateo 18 : 15 - 17 liytʼañataki ) .
Jiwasar chuym ustʼayiritï Jesusan ewjjaparjamajj jan istʼañ munkistani , testigonak irpkañäni ukhas jan istʼkani , ni irpir chuymaninakarus istʼkaniti ukhajja , ¿ kun lurañas wakisispa ?
Jesusajj sänwa : “ Jan Diosar iyawskis ukhamaru uñj - jjapjjam , jan ukajj impuesto cobrir uñisita [ jaqerjama ] ” sasa .
Jichhürunakanjja , ukajj tamat jaqsuñampi sasispawa .
Maynirojja , janiw maynimp aleq jan waltʼayasitap laykukejj ukham lurasiñapäkänti , jan ukasti Jesusan arunakaparjamajj aka pä toqetwa phoqasiñapäna : 1 ) Maynejja jan waltʼayaski jupampikiw askichañapäna , ukampis 2 ) sinti jan walïtap laykojj juchapunëjjchi ukhajja , tamatwa jaqsusiñapäna .
Uka juchanakajja , maynir jan waltʼayañatak amtampi kʼarintaña , maynin askipak thaqhasina maynir engañjaña ( fraude ) ukanakäspawa .
Maynejj uka juchanak lurchi ukhakiw mä jan waltʼäwejj Jesusan ewjjtʼaparjam askichasiñapa .
Uka juchanakajja , janiw wachoq jucha , chacha pura jan ukajj warmi pura sarnaqaña , Diosan markap contra saytʼaña , jan ukajj kʼari diosanakar yupaychaña uka juchanakjamäkiti .
Ukanakasti irpir chuymaninakan uñjatäñapawa .
Maynimp sumakthapiñatakejj inas walja kuti parltʼañajj wakischini ( 15 tʼaqa uñjjattʼäta )
Jesusan ewjjtʼapajja , jilatasaru jan ukajj kullakasaru munasiñamp yanaptʼañatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Jupanakajj chuym ustʼayapjjestani ukajja , jan khitir yatiyasakiw panisaki parltʼañasa .
Ukatakejja inas jupamp walja kuti parlañajj wakischini .
Ukham lurasatï jan waltʼayasitas jan askichkañäni ukajja , paninimpi jan ukajj maynimpiw sarañasa , jupanakasti cheqapunit jucha luratajj utji janicha uk qhanstayañatakiw yanaptʼapjjestani .
Jupanakan yanaptʼatäsajj jan waltʼayasitas askichjjañäni ukajja , ‘ jilatasampejj sumankthapjjtanwa ’ .
Ukampis jan wal lurkistu uka jilataru jan ukajj uka kullakaru yanaptʼañatakejja , walja kuti chʼamachaskasas jan istʼkchistu ukhakiw irpir chuymaninakar yatiyañasa .
1 ) ¿ Kunjamsa Jesusan ewjjtʼapajj jan waltʼäwinak askichañatak yanaptʼistaspa ?
2 ) Jan waltʼäwinak Jesusan ewjjtʼaparjam askichasajja , ¿ kunjamsa munasirïtas uñachtʼaytanjja ?
Jan waltʼäwinakapjja , yaqhep jilat kullakanakajj jankʼakiw askichapjje .
Janiw Mateo 18 : 15 - 17 qellqatan utjki uka kimsa ewjjtʼarjamajj tamat jaqsuyasiñkam puripkiti .
Pantjasitapat amuyasisajja , jan wali luräwinak jaytanukjjapjjewa .
Ukhamasti , chuyma ustʼayasirejja uk amuyasajj maynin pantjasitap perdonjjewa , janirakiw jukʼampis uka toqet parljjeti .
Ukhamasti , mä jilatatï jan ukajj mä kullakatï jan wal luristani ukhajja , nayraqat jupampiw jan khitir yatiyas parltʼañasa , janiw jankʼakejj irpir chuymaninakar yatiyañasäkiti .
Ukatsti , paninimpi jan ukajj maynimpiw jupamp parltʼañatakejj sarañasa .
Ukampis maynin jan wali luratapajj qhanächi ukhakiw irpir chuymaninakarojj yatiyañasa .
¿ Kunatsa mayninakamp sum apasiñatak chʼamachasiñasa ?
Akapachanjja kunjamats pantjasipuniñäniwa , mayninakarus chuym ustʼayarakiñäniwa .
Discípulo Santiagojj akham sänwa : “ Maynitejj arsutapanjja jan pantjaskchejja , ukajj cheqa jaqewa , taqe janchipsa frenompjamarakiw apnaqe ” sasa .
Maynimp jan waltʼayasiñäni ukhajja , sumankthapiñatakiw chʼamachasiñasa ( Sal .
34 : 14 ) . Ukhamtï lurañäni ukhajja , taqenimpiw sum apasiñäni , tamansa mä wawakiw jakasiñäni ( Sal . 133 : 1 - 3 ) .
Taqe kunat sipansa Jehová Diosampiw sum apasiñäni .
Ukhamasti , taqeniw jilat kullakanakasampisa Jehová Diosampis sum apassna , ukatakejja , jan waltʼäwinakasjja munasiñampiw askichañasa .
[ 1 ] ( 10 tʼaqa ) : Yaqha sutimp uchatawa . [ 2 ] ( 12 tʼaqa ) : Jan waltʼäwinakap sumatak askichiri Diosan yaqhep servirinakapajj akanakawa : Jacob chachampi Esaú chachampi ( Gén .
27 : 41 - 45 ; 33 : 1 - 11 ) ; José chachampi jilanakapampi ( Gén .
45 : 1 - 15 ) ; Gedeonampi Efraín tribunkirinakampi ( Jue .
8 : 1 - 3 ) . Diosan yaqha servirinakapajj jan waltʼäwinak askichapkäna ukanakat inas jumajj amtasiraksta .
“ Taqe akapachankir jaqenakar yatiyir sarapjjam , nayar arkir tukuyapjjam ; bautisapjjam [ . . . ] . Yatichapjjarakim taqe kuntejj nayajj jumanakar yatichapksma ukanaka phoqhaña ” .
141 , 97 QʼOCHUNAKA
¿ Kuna toqetsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj yatiyapjje ?
¿ Kunatsa uka toqet yatiyapjje ?
¿ Kunjamsa yatiyapjje ?
¿ Kawkikamas yatiyapjje ?
1 , 2 .
Mateo 24 : 14 qellqat liytʼasajja , ¿ kuna jisktʼanakas utjaspa ?
JICHHÜRUNAKANJJA , Diosan arunakap yatiyir sartan ukhajj waljaniw istʼapjjestu , yaqhepasti janiw kunsa yatiñ munapkarakiti .
Ukampis Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj utat uta yatiyirit uñtʼatätanwa .
Diosan arunakap janis yaqhepajj istʼañ munapkchejja , yatiyktan uk sumwa uñjapjje .
Kunjamtï yatktanjja , “ Diosan reinopat aka suma yatiyäwisti aka oraqpachanwa yatiyatäni ” sasaw Jesusajj arsuwayäna .
¿ Kunatsa jiwasaw Jesusan arsutapjja phoqasktan sasin sissna ?
Ukham sasinjja , ¿ jachʼa jachʼat tukusktanjja ?
Walja religionanakaw ‘ Diosan suma yatiyäwinakap nanakaw yatiyapjjta ’ sasin sapjje .
Ukampis jupanakajja , kunjamsa Jesusar uñtʼawayapjje uka toqetakwa parlañ yatipjje . Iglesianakapana , televisionana ukhamarak Internetanakwa Bibliat parlapjje .
Yaqhepasti , ‘ hospitalanakan doctorata , enfermerata , jan ukajj profesorat irnaqasaw jaqenakar yanaptʼapjjta ’ sasaw sapjje .
‘ Ukham lurasasti , Diosan arunakapsa yatiyapkirista ukhamawa ’ sasaw sapjjaraki .
Ukampis ukham lurasajja , ¿ cheqpachapunit Jesusan arunakap phoqasajj jaqenakar yanaptʼasipkpacha ?
Mateo 28 : 19 , 20 qellqatarjamajja , ¿ kuna pusi luräwinaksa Jesusan arkirinakapajj lurapjjañapa ?
¿ Arkirinakapan ukaru jaqenakajj sarapjjaspa ukti Jesusajj munpachäna ?
Janiwa .
Jiwatat jaktkäna uka qhepatjja , Jesusajj akham sasaw walja arkirinakapar säna : “ Taqe akapachankir jaqenakar yatiyir sarapjjam , nayar arkir tukuyapjjam ; bautisapjjam [ . . . ] . Yatichapjjarakim taqe kuntejj nayajj jumanakar yatichapksma ukanaka phoqhaña ” sasa .
Jesusan uka arunakaparjamajja , pusi luräwinakwa lurañasa .
Uka pusit kimsajj akanakawa : Jaqenakaru Jesusan arkiripar tukuyaña , bautisaña , yatichaña .
Ukampis ¿ kunsa nayraqatajj lurañasa ?
Jesusajj sänwa : “ Sarapjjam ” sasa .
Uka toqetjja , Bibliat yatjjattʼat mä jaqejj akham siwa : “ ‘ Sarapjjam ’ siski uka arurjamaw taqe cristianonakajj phoqapjjañapa . Ukatakisti inas mä calle khurkataru , jan ukajj lamar qota khurkataru sarapjjañapajj wakischini ” sasa .
¿ Kunas oraqpachan yatiyasiñapatakejj munasi ?
¿ ‘ Arkirinakajajja sapa maynis sapakiw chʼamachasipjjani ’ sañti Jesusajj munaskäna ?
Jan ukajj ¿ sum wakichtʼasisinwa tamjamajj oraqpachan yatiyapjjani sañcha munpachäna ?
Mä sapa jaqejja , janiw ‘ taqe akapachankir jaqenakarojj ’ yatiykaspati , jan ukasti tamjam wali sum wakichtʼasisinakwa oraqpachan yatiyasispa .
Ukatwa Jesusajj arkirinakapar ajllkäna ukhajj akham säna : “ Jaqe katuri tukuyapjjäma ” sasa ( Mateo 4 : 18 - 22 liytʼañataki ) .
Ukham sasinjja , Jesusajj janiw anzuelor manqʼa uchasa , chawlla katuñatak qontʼaski uka chawlla katurit parlkänti .
Jan ukasti , kunjamtï mä qänampi ( redempi ) chawlla katuñatakejj waljanin yanaptʼapajj munaski uka toqetwa parlaskäna .
¿ Kuna pusi jisktʼanakarus qhanañchañasa , ukat kunatsa ?
Jichhürunakanjja , ¿ khitinakas Jesusan arunakaparjamajj Diosan arunakap yatiyasipki ? Uk yatiñatakejja , aka pusi jisktʼanakaruw qhanañchañasa :
¿ Kuna toqetsa yatiyañasa ?
¿ Kunatsa Diosan arunakap yatiyañasa ?
¿ Kunjamsa yatiyañasa ?
¿ Kawkikamasa ukat kunapachkamas yatiyañasa ?
Uka jisktʼanakar qhanañchañajja , jichhürunakan khitinakasa jaqenakar yanaptʼañatakejj chʼamachasisipki uk yatiñatakiw yanaptʼistani .
Ukatsti , Diosan arunakap yatiyaskakiñatakis yanaptʼarakistaniwa .
¿ Kunatsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapakiw Diosan Reinopat yatiyapjje sasin sissna ?
( Lucas 4 : 43 liytʼañataki ) .
Jesusajja , “ Diosan reinopat ” suma yatiyäwinakjja yatiyapunirïnwa , arkirinakapajj uka pachparak lurapjjaspa ukwa jupajj muni .
Jichhürunakanjja , ¿ khitinakas uka yatiyäwinakjja “ taqe markanakan ” yatiyasipki ?
Cheqansa , Jehová Diosan Testigonakapakiw uk lurasipki .
Diosan arunakap jan istʼañ munirinakasa , ‘ Testigonakakiw Diosan arunakap yatiyapjje ’ sasaw sapjje .
Amuytʼañataki , walja markanakan misionerot irnaqtʼiri mä sacerdotejja , akham sasaw mä jilatar satayna : “ Testigonakarojj sapa markanwa ‘ ¿ kuna toqetsa yatiyapjjta ? ’
sasin jisktʼirïta . Jupanakasti , jan sum amuytʼasisajj ‘ Diosan Reinopatwa yatiyapjjta ’ sasin sapjjetäna ” sasa .
Ukampis uka Testigonakajj janiw jan amuytʼasirïpkänti , jan ukasti cheqpach cristianonakjamajj mä amtanikïpjjatapwa uñachtʼayasipkäna .
Jupanakasti , kuna toqettï Yatiyañataki sat revistajj yatiyaski uka toqetarakwa yatiyasipki .
Uka revistasti , Yatiyañataki .
Jehová Diosan Apnaqäwipat Yatiyaski satawa .
Yatiyañataki revistajja , sapa kuti mistki ukhajj niya 59 millón revistanakaw 254 arunakan imprimisi .
Oraqpachanjja , uka revistakiw taqe revistanakat sipansa jilpachajj lakirasi .
Cristianöpjjtwa sirinakan pʼeqtʼirinakapajj janiw Diosan Reinopat yatiyapkiti sasin ¿ kunatsa sistanjja ?
Cristianöpjjtwa sirinakan pʼeqtʼirinakapajj janiw Diosan Reinopat yatiyapkiti .
Ukampis uka toqet parlapjje ukhajja , Diosan Reinopajj sapa cristianon chuymapankiwa sasakiw sapjje .
Jaqenakarojja , ‘ Jesucriston apnaqat alajjpachankir Reinokiw taqe jan waltʼäwinak askichjjani ’ sasin janiw yatichapkiti ( Apo . 19 : 11 - 21 ) .
Antisas Navidadana , jan ukajj Semana Santanakwa Jesusat parlapjje .
Ukham lurasajja , aka Oraqjjar apnaqkani ukhajj kunsa Jesusajj lurani uk janis yatipkaspa ukhamawa .
Kuna toqetsa yatiyapjjañapa ukjja janiw yatipkiti , ukhamïpanwa kunatsa yatiyapjjañapa uk jan amuyapkarakiti .
¿ Kuna amtampis Diosan arunakap jan yatiyañasäki ?
¿ Kunatsa yatiyañasa ?
Diosan arunakapjja , janiw qollqe apthapiñ laykusa ni wali suma utanak utachañ laykus yatiyañasäkiti .
Jesusajj akham sasaw arkirinakapar säna : “ Taqe akanaksti inakiw lurapjjäta , ukanak lurañataki chʼam inaki katoqapjjatam layku ” sasa .
Diosan arunakapajj janiw qollqe ganañ amtampi yatiyasiñapäkiti .
Yatiyirinakajj janiw yatiyatapat qollqe pagatäñ suyapjjañapäkiti ( Hechos 20 : 33 - 35 liytʼañataki ) .
Uka toqetjja Jesusajj wali qhansa ewjjtʼawaykchïnjja , jila parte religionanakajj qollqe apthapiñataki , jan ukajj iglesiapan qollqe toqet jan aynachtʼañatakiw jukʼamp llakisipjje .
Iglesia pʼeqtʼirinakarusa trabajirinakarusa pagapjjañaparakiwa , uka pʼeqtʼirinakat waljanisti wal qamiriptapjjaraki ( Apo .
17 : 4 , 5 ) .
Diosan arunakapa yatiyasajja , ¿ kuna amtampi yatiyapjjatapsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj uñachtʼayapjje ?
Qollqe apthapiñjja , ¿ kunjamsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj uñjapjje ?
Diosan arunakapjja , chuymatpacha yanaptʼir munirinakan yanaptʼapampiw yatiyapjje .
Tantachasiñ Utanakapansa , jachʼa tantachäwinakapansa janiw qollqejj apthapiskiti .
Pasïr maranjja , Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj 1.930 millón horanakwa yatiyawayapjje , ukatsti sapa phajjsejj 9 millón jila jaqenakaruw Bibliat yatichawayapjjaraki .
Taqe ukanakjja , jan kun mayisakiw lurapjje , ukatsti jaqenakarojj qollqepampiw yatichir sarapjje .
Kuntï Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj lurapki uka toqetjja , mä yatjjattʼat jaqejj akham siwa : “ Jupanakajja , Diosan arunakap yatiyañataki ukhamarak yatichañatakiw taqe kunat sipansa chʼamachasipjje [ . . . ] .
Pʼeqtʼirinakapajj janiw qollqe layku pʼeqtʼapkiti , ukhamatwa gastonakapajj jan añchäkiti ” sasa .
Ukhamasti ¿ kunatsa Diosan arunakap yatiytanjja ?
Jehová Diosaru ukhamaraki jaqenakar munasitas laykuw jan kun mayisaki yatiytanjja .
Ukhamatwa Salmo 110 : 3 ( liytʼañataki ) qellqatan jikjjataski uka profecía phoqtanjja .
Taqe cheqanwa yatiytanjja ( 10 tʼaqa uñjjattʼäta )
Jesusasa arkirinakapasa , ¿ kunjamsa yatiyapjjäna ?
Jesusasa arkirinakapasa , ¿ kunjamsa Diosan arunakap yatiyapjjäna ?
Janiw kawkhantï walja jaqenakajj utjki uka cheqanak yatiyapkänti , jan ukasti taqe cheqanwa yatiyapjjäna .
Utat utsa aski jaqenakarojj thaqhapjjarakïnwa .
Ukhamatwa taqenir yatiyañ munapjjatap uñachtʼayapjjäna .
11 , 12 .
Yaqha religionanakat sipansa , ¿ kunjamsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj yatiyañatak chʼamachasipjje ?
¿ Kunsa cristianöpjjtwa sirinakajj lurasipki ?
Jupanakajja , iglesian pʼeqtʼirinakajj pago katoqapki ukanakaruw yatiyapjjañapatak jaytapjje .
Ukampis uka pʼeqtʼirinakajj Diosan arunakap yatiyañat sipansa , iglesiapar saririnakajj jan jitheqtapjjañapataki yanaptʼañatakiw jukʼamp chʼamachasipjje .
Awisas yatiyapjjañapatak jaqenakar chʼamañchapjjarakiwa .
Amuytʼañataki , 2001 mara qalltanjja , Juan Pablo II papajj akham sasaw iglesiankirinakar mä carta qellqäna : ‘ Jesusan arunakap yatiyañjja , apóstol Pabljamarakiw uñjapjjañama , jupasti akham sänwa : “ Janitejj Diosan arunakap parlkirist ukajja kunakïkaspa nayatakejja ” ’ sasa .
Ukatsti saskakïnwa : ‘ Janiw mä qawqha yatjjattʼatanakakejj yatiyapjjañapäkiti , jan ukasti Diosan Markapankirinakajj taqeniw yatiyapjjañapa ’ sasa .
Mä qawqhanikiw uka arunakarjam lurapjjäna .
Maysa toqetjja , ¿ kunsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj lurasipki ?
‘ Jesucristojj 1914 marat aksaruw apnaqjje ’ sasin jupanakakiw yatiyapjje .
Jupanakatakejja , Diosan arunakap yatiyañaw taqe kunat sipansa nayranki . Uksti , Jesusan arunakaparjamaw lurapjje .
Yatjjattʼat mä warmejj akham sasaw qellqäna : “ Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajja , taqe kunat sipansa yatiyañatakiw chʼamachasipjje ” sasa .
Ukatsti , mä jilatan arunakaparjamajj akham sänwa : “ Manqʼat tʼaqhesitanakaru , saparstʼatanakaru , usuntatanakaru jikjjatasajj yanaptʼapjjewa [ . . . ] . Ukampis jupanakajja , akapachan tukusiñapata ukhamarak qhespiyasiñajj kunja wakiskirisa uka toqet parlapjjapuniwa ” sasa ( Pillars of Faith — American Congregations and Their Partners ) .
Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajja , kunjamtï Jesusasa arkirinakapas yatiyapjjerïkäna ukhamarakiw jichhürunakan yatiyasipki .
¿ Kawkikamas Diosan arunakapajj yatiyasiñapa ?
Aka qhepa urunakanjja Diosan arunakapajj kawkikamas yatiyasiñapäna uka toqetjja , Jesusajj akham sänwa : “ Aka oraqpachanwa yatiyatäni ” sasa .
Jesusan arkirinakapajj oraqpachanwa utjañapäna .
Ukatakejja , Diosan arunakapajj oraqpachanwa yatiyasiñapäna .
14 , 15 .
Jehová Diosan Testigonakapaw Jesusan arunakap phoqhasipki sasinjja , ¿ kunatsa sissna ?
( 8 janankir fotonaka uñjjattʼam ) .
Jesusan arunakaparjamajja , kawkikamas Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj yatiyasipki uka toqet amuytʼañäni .
Estados Unidos markanjja , niya mä millón pä patak waranqa Testigonakaw utji .
Ukampis taqpach religionanakansti 600 waranqa pʼeqtʼirinakakiw uka markan utji .
Católica Romana Iglesiansti , 400 waranqa peqtʼirinakakiw oraqpachan utji .
Jehová Diosan Testigonakapasti , 8 millón ukhaniw 240 markanakan yatiyasipki .
Ukham lurasaw Jehová Diosarojj gloria churapjje , jachʼañchapjjaraki ( Sal .
34 : 1 ; 51 : 15 ) . Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajja , janïr akapacha tukuskipanwa taqe jaqenakar yatiyañ muntanjja .
Ukatakejja , Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakajj walja arunakaruw jaqokipasiski , imprimisiraki .
Oraqpachanjja janiw khitis ukham lurkiti .
Libronakasa , revistanakasa , tratadonakasa waranq waranqaw jaqenakarojj inaki churasi .
Jachʼa tantachäwitaki ukhamarak Jesusan jiwäwip amtañataki invitacionanakajj ukhamarakiw waraq waranqa lakirasiwayi .
Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakasa , 700 arunakaruw jaqokipasiwayi .
Traducción del Nuevo Mundo de las Santas Escrituras Bibliajja 200 millón jilaw 130 arunakan lurasiwayaraki .
Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakasti pasïr marajj 4.500 millón ukhaw lurasiwayi .
Ukatjja Internetansa jw.org cheqajj 750 jila arunakanwa utji .
Akapachankir religionanakatjja , janipuniw kawkïris ukham lurkiti .
¿ Kunjamatsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj qollan ajayunïpjjatap yattanjja ?
¿ Kunapachkamas Diosan arunakapajj yatiyasiñapa ?
Jesusan arunakaparjamajja , Diosan arunakapajj aka qhepa urunakan yatiyasiskakiñapänwa , ‘ ukatsti akapachan tukusiñapaw jutañapäna ’ .
Akapachankir religionanakatjja , ¿ kawkïr religionas ukham yatiyaski ?
Yatiykasin jikjjattan uka jaqenakat yaqhepajj akham sapjjewa : “ Jumanakaw yatiyapjjtajja , nanakasti qollan ajayunïpjjtwa ” sasa .
Ukampis ¿ kunatsa jan qarjtasajj sapüru yatiyaskaktanjja ? ¿ Janit qollan ajayojj yanaptʼkpachïstu ? .
Awisajja , yaqhep religionanakajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapjamarakiw Diosan arunakap yatiyañ yantʼapjje , ukampis aynachtʼapjjewa .
Yaqhepajja , mä qawqha tiempo yatiyasinjja janiw mayampis yatiyjjapjjeti .
Yaqhepasti utat utas yatiyapjjarakiwa , ukampis janiw Diosan Reinopat yatiyapkiti .
Ukhamasti janiw kuna toqettï Jesusajj yatiyañ qalltawayki uka toqet yatiyapkiti .
17 , 18 . 1 ) Jehová Diosan Testigonakapakiw Diosan Reinopat yatiyasipki sasin ¿ kunatsa sistanjja ?
2 ) ¿ Khitin yanaptʼapampikis yatiytanjja ?
Ukhamasti , ¿ khitinakas Diosan Reinopat jichhürunakan yatiyasipki ?
Jehová Diosan Testigonakapakiw yatiyasipki .
¿ Kunatsa ukham sistanjja ?
Maya , kunatï yatiyasiñapäki uka toqetwa yatiytanjja , mä arunjja Diosan Reinopatwa yatiytanjja .
Paya , jaqenakar thaqer sarasaw kunjamtï yatiyasiñapäki ukham yatiytanjja .
Kimsa , janiw qollqe ganañ amtampi yatiyktanti , jan ukasti munasiñatwa yatiytanjja .
Pusi , oraqpachanwa yatiytanjja , ukhamatwa taqe markanakana ukhamarak kunayman parlani jaqenakaru yatiytanjja .
Ukatsti , akapachan tukusiñapkamaw jan qarjtas yatiyaskakiñäni .
Aka qhepa urunakanjja , kunanaktï Jehová Diosan servirinakapajj lurasktan ukajj wali muspharkañawa .
¿ Khitin yanaptʼapampikis oraqpachan yatiyasktanjja ?
Filipos markan jakasiri cristianonakar mä carta qellqkasajja , apóstol Pablojj sänwa : “ Diosaw suma amtäwinak churapjjtam , jupa pachparakiw yanapasipktamjja uka lurañanak phoqhañanjja jupan munañaparjama ” sasa .
Ukhamasti , Jehová Dios awkisajj suma yatiyäwinak yatiyaskakiñatakejj chʼamap churaskakistpan .
[ 1 ] ( 9 tʼaqa ) : Salmo 110 : 3 ( NM ) : “ Atiptʼañ urumanjja markamajj taqe chuymaw serviñatakejj sartani [ . . . ] .
Sullar uñtataw waynanakajj jumamp chika sarantapjjani ” .
Gobiernotak irnaqapki ukanakamp parlasajja , cristianonakajj concienciaparjamaw kuns amtapjjañapa
Uka jisktʼar qhanañchañatakejj walja toqenakat amuytʼañaw wakisi .
Cristianonakajj honrado chuymanïpjjañapawa , jakapki uka markan leyinakapsa istʼapjjañaparakiwa , ukampis janiw ukanak phoqañ laykukejj Diosan leyinakap pʼakintapjjañapäkiti .
Diosar servirinakajj jaqe masipar jupanak kikparjam munasiñatakiw wal chʼamachasipjje , janiw jupanakan chuymap ustʼayañ munapkiti , costumbrenakapsa respetapjjarakiwa .
Ukanak yatiñaw aka Oraqpachankir jilat kullakanakarojja , autoridadanakar qollqe wajjtʼañajj walikïskiti janicha uk amuyañatak yanaptʼaspa .
Walja markanakanjja , markachirinakajj janiw gobiernotak trabajipki ukanakarojj qollqe churapjjañapäkiti , jupanakajj kunatï lurañajj waktʼki ukakwa lurasipki .
Marka apnaqeriw jupanakarojj pagop churi , ukhamajj janiw uka irnaqerinakajj markachirinakat qollqe katoqañ suyapkiti , ni mayipkarakisa .
Kuntï lurapki ukajj leyinakarjamäkchisa , janipuniw markachirinakat qollqe katoqapjjañapäkiti , ni mayipjjañapäkisa , ukham lurapjjaspa ukhajja , markan leyinakap conträspawa , qollqe chilltañamp sasirakispawa .
Ukham leyinakanïpki uka markanakanjja , cristianonakajj janipuniw gobiernotak irnaqapki ukanakarojj qollqe wajjtʼapjjañapäkiti .
Ukampis yaqhep markanakanjja , janiw ukham leyinakajj utjkiti , utjchi ukasa , janiw taqenejj ukarjam phoqapkiti .
Inas markaman ukhamarakïchi .
Uka markanakan gobiernotak irnaqerinakajj jan sinttʼasisaw jaqenakat qollq lunthatapjje , jan ukajja , ‘ irnaqatajat qollq churañamawa ’ sasaw sapjjaraki .
Jan qollq churatajj janiw kuns lurañ munapkiti .
Casarasiñataki registror qellqayasiñatakisa , impuestonak pagañatakisa , uta lurayasiñataki papelanak apsuñatakisa , qollq mayipjjapuniwa .
Jan churatajj janiw ukanak lurasiñapatakejj permiso jankʼak churapkiti .
Mä markanjja , bomberonakajj qollq jan churatajj janiw nina jiwarayirejj sarapkiti .
Yuspärañataki maynir kun churañas walikïskiwa
‘ Ukhamanakan uñjasisajj qollqe churañajj wakisipuniwa ’ sasaw waljanejj amuyapjje .
‘ Kuna lurañatï waktʼki uk sum phoqapjjañapatakiw qollq irjjattʼañajj wakisi ’ sasaw yaqhep cristianonakajj amuyapjjarakispa .
Ukampis ukhamanakan uñjasisajja , kunatï Diosatakejj walïki jan walïkaraki uk sumwa mä cristianojj amuyasiñapa .
Irnaqtʼatapat maynïr mä qawqha qollqe wajjtʼañajj walikïskiwa , ukampis leyinakarjam jan walïki uk jikjjatañataki maynir qollqe chilltañajj janiw walïkiti .
Yaqhep markanakanjja , multa pagañajj utjki uk jan pagañ layku , jan ukajj leyinakarjam jan walïki uk jikjjatañatakiw policianakarusa yaqha ukham autoridadanakarus qollqe chilltañ yatipjje .
Jan wal lurañataki maynir qollqe chilltañasa jan ukajj qollqe chilltayasiñasa , janipuniw walïkiti .
Ukham lurasajj janiw cheqaparjam sarnaqatas uñachtʼayksnati ( Éxo .
23 : 8 ; Deu . 16 : 19 ; Pro . 17 : 23 ) .
Gobiernotak irnaqapki ukanakat yaqhepajj qollq mayiñwa yatipjje , ukampis Biblian yatichäwiparjam sarnaqer cristianonakajj janiw churapkiti .
Ukhamtï lurapjjaspa ukhajja , qollqe chilltañajj walikïskaspas ukhamwa jaqenakar amuyayapjjaspa .
‘ Leyinakarjam jan walïki uk jikjjatañataki qollqe maynir wajjtʼañajj qollq chilltañamp sasispawa ’ sasaw Diosan leyinakaparjam sarnaqer cristianonakajj amuyapjje .
Ukampis ukajj jakapki uka markan luräwinakaparjamäspawa , maynin sum irnaqtʼañapatakisa , kun katoqañatak jan añch suyañatakisa inas mä cristianojj mä qawqha qollqe churañ amtchispa .
Yaqhep cristianonakajj gobiernonkir hospitalanakanwa qollayasipjje , ukanakanjja janiw qollqejj mayiskiti .
Ukatwa yuspärañatakejj doctoranakaru jan ukajj enfermeranakar mä qawqha qollqe wajjtʼapjje , jan ukajj yaqha ukhamanak churapjje .
Ukampis qollayasjjapjje ukhaw ukanak churapjje , janïräkipan churapjjaspa ukhajja , sum uñjayasiñ laykukis qollq chilltapkaspa ukhamäspawa .
Kunjamanakansa sapa markankir cristianonakajj uñjasipjje uk janiw aka yatichäwin taqpachpun qhanañchksnati .
Ukhamajj markan luräwinakapajj kunjamäskchinisa , sapa mayni cristianow concienciaparjam kunsa lurani uk amtjjañapa .
Kunatï leyinakarjamajj jan walïki uk janipuniw mä cristianojj lurkaspati .
Janirakiw kunatï Diosan sutip qʼañuchkaspa jan ukajj mayni cristianonakar pantjasiykaspa ukanaksa lurkaspati .
Kuntï mä cristianojj lurañ amtki ukajj jaqe masipar munasitapwa uñachtʼayañapa .
Lucas 15 jaljanjja , Jesusajj 100 uwijanakani mä chachatwa parli .
Uka chachajj mä uwijap chhaqatap amuyasajja , 99 uwijanakap jaytawayasinwa chhaqat uwijapar thaqher sari .
“ Jikjjatjjasinsti kusisitaw kallachipjjaru apasinjje .
Utar purjjasinsti taqe amigonakapa jawsthapisi , ukhamarak uta jakʼanakapsa ukat saraki : ‘ Kusisipjjam nayampi , chhaqatäkäns uka ovej - jja jikjjatjjtwa ’ sasa ” .
Jesusajj akham sasaw uka sarnaqäwit parlañ tukuyi : “ Uka pachpawa alajjpachanjj jukʼamp kusisiñajj utji mä juchararan arrepientisitapatjja , llätunk tunka llätunkani aski jaqenakajj jan kunats arrepientisipjjañapajj utjki ukanakat sipansa ” sasa .
Fariseonakaru , ley yatichirinakaru cheqañchañatakiw Jesusajj uka arunak säna , jupanakajj impuesto parlirinakampi jucha lurir jaqenakampi parlatapatwa Jesusar juchañchapjjäna .
Kunapachatï mä jucharar jaqejj arrepentisisin kuttʼanjje ukhajja , ‘ alajjpachan jukʼamp kusisiñaw utji ’ sasaw Jesusajj jupanakar säna .
Uk yatisajj inas akham jisktʼassna : “ Niyakejjay alajjpachan kusisiñajj utjchejja , ¿ janit aka Oraqen maynin arrepentisisin kuttʼanjjatapata , ukhamarak ‘ cheqa thakin ’ sarnaqjjatapat kusisiñajj utjañapäkarakispa ? ”
sasa . Kunapachatï maynejj tamar kuttʼanjje ukhajj wal kusisiñasa .
Cheqas tamar kuttʼanjjasajja , jucha luririrejj taqe chuyma arrepentisitapwa uñachtʼayañapa .
Ukampis tamar kuttʼaniñ amtatapat wal kusistanjja .
Ukhamajj kunapachatï irpir chuymaninakajj maynin tamar kuttʼanjjatapat yatiyapjjani ukhajja , respetompi amparanak tʼajjllirañajj walikïskaspawa .
‘ Kunapachatï Betzata estanquen umajj onjjtki ukhajja , maynejj ukar mantasin qollasispawa ’ sasaw Jerusalenankir yaqhep jaqenakajj amuyapjjäna ( Juan 5 : 1 - 7 , NM ) .
Ukatwa usutanakajj ukar sarapjjerïna .
Judionakajj costumbrenakaparjam qʼomachasiñatakiw uka estanquer sarapjjarakirïna .
Betzata estanque jakʼan yaqha estanque utjatap laykojja , umapajj pachpakïskiriwa , janiw saraqerïkänti .
Uka pä estanquenakajj mä pachpa utankakïnwa .
Ukat mä perqaw jaljtayäna sasaw uka toqet yatjjatirinakajj sapjje .
Uka perqanjja , uma pasañapatakiw aynach toqen mä jiskʼa punkojj utjäna . Ukhamajj uka punknamaw judionakajj qʼomachasiñ suyapkäna uka estanquerojj umajj pasäna .
Ukatwa estanquen umapajj onjjtäna . Griego Arut nayra Qollan Qellqatanakanjja , Juan 5 : 4 jiskʼa tʼaqajj janiw utjkiti . 300 maranakan utjkäna uka Códice Sinaítico ukansa janirakiw utjkiti .
Uka jiskʼa tʼaqanjja , mä angelaw um onjjtayäna sasaw yaqhep Biblianakan jaqokipasiwayi .
Ukhamäkchisa , kunjamtï Bibliajj siskejja , 38 maranak usutäkäna uka chachajj janiw Betzata estaquer mantasajj qollaskänti , jan ukasti , Jesusaw uka chacharojj usupat qolläna .
“ Nayätwa Tatitu Diosamajja , nayasti kunatejj jumatakejj askïki ukwa yatichsma ” ( ISA . 48 : 17 ) .
117 , 114 QʼOCHUNAKA
Bibliana ukhamarak Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakan yaqhep yatichäwinakapjja , ¿ kun amuyasas jan liyksna ?
¿ Kunas Bibliat jukʼamp yatjjatañatak yanaptʼistaspa ?
Wayn tawaqonakataki ukhamarak jan Testigöpki jupanakatak wakichtʼat Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakajja , ¿ kunjamsa yanaptʼistaspa ?
1 , 2 .
1 ) Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajja , ¿ kunjamsa Diosan Arupar uñjtanjja ?
2 ) Jumarojja , ¿ Bibliat kawkïr cheq liytʼañas wal gusttamjja ?
DIOSAN ARUPAROJJA Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj wal munastanjja .
Ukanwa suma ewjjtʼanaksa , chuymachtʼir arunaksa , jutïrit parlir arunaksa jikjjattanjja .
Diosan Aruparojj janiw jaqen amuyunakapäkaspas ukham uñjktanti , “ jan ukasti Diosan arunakapjamwa ” uñjtanjja .
Jumarojja , Bibliat mä cheq liytʼañajj wal gustpachätamjja .
Yaqhepanakajj Mateo , Marcos , Lucas , Juan qellqatanak liytʼasajja , Jehová Diosajj kunjam chuymanisa , ukwa Jesusan sarnaqäwip liytʼasajj amuyapjje .
Yaqhepanakasti profecianakat parlir libronakwa liytʼapjjaraki .
Ukanakat maynïrejj Apocalipsis librowa . Ukansti , kunatejj akat mä qawqha tiempot paskani uka toqenakatwa parli ( Apo . 1 : 1 ) .
Salmos , Proverbios qellqatanakanjja , suma ewjjtʼanaka ukhamarak chuymachtʼkir arunakaw jikjjatasiraki .
Cheqansa , Bibliajj taqenitak qellqatawa .
3 , 4 . 1 ) ¿ Kunjamsa jumajj Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakar uñjta ?
2 ) Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakasajja , ¿ khitinakatak wakichtʼatasa ?
Niyakejjay Diosan Arupar wal munasstanjja , Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakarus ukhamarakiw uñjtanjja .
Jehová Diosajj libronaka , folletonaka , revistanaka ukhamarak yaqha ukham qellqatanak toqe yatichkistu ukanakjja , wali wakiskiritwa uñjtanjja .
Ukanakaw ajay toqet jan ikjañatakisa , ‘ suma iyawsäwinïñatakis ’ yanaptʼistu .
Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakajja , Jehová Diosan taqe Testigonakapatak lurtʼatawa .
Yaqhep qellqatanakajj wayn tawaqonakatak lurtʼatawa , yaqhepasti awk taykanakatakiraki .
Ukampis qellqatanakasan utjki uka yatichäwinakata , Internetan uchaski uka yatichäwinakat waljajja , jan Testigöpki jupanakatak wakichtʼatawa .
Ukham walja qellqatanak utjatapajja , Jehová Diosajj “ mä suma manqʼäwi ” taqe markanakataki wakichä sasin arskäna uk phoqatapwa uñachtʼayi ( Isa . 25 : 6 ) .
¿ Kunatsa janipun pächasiñasäki ?
Biblia liytʼañatakisa , Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanak liytʼañatakisa taqeniw jukʼamp tiemponïñ munpachätanjja .
Ukampis janiw taqpachpun sumpach liytʼktanti .
Ukhamäkchi ukasa , Biblia sapüru liytʼañataki chʼamachasitas uñjasasa , Bibliat jukʼamp yatjjatañataki chʼamachasitas uñjasasa , Jehová Diosajj wal kusisi , uka toqet janipuniw pächasiñasäkiti .
Ukampisa , ¿ kuna toqetsa amuyasiñasäspa ?
Uka toqet jichhajj amuytʼañäni . ¿ Kunatsa yaqhep yatichäwinak jan liyksna ?
Awisajja , Biblia liyisasa jan ukajj Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanak liyisasa , yaqhep yatichäwinakajj janis jiwasatakjamäkaspa ukham amuysna .
Amuytʼañataki , Bibliankir mä cheqasa jan ukajj jan Testigöpki jupanakatak mä yatichäwisa jan jiwasatakjamäkchi ukhajja , ¿ kunsa lurañasa ?
Uka yatichäwinaktï ina ukhamak liysna , jan ukajj jan liyjjsna ukhajja , uka qellqatanakajj kuna suma yatichäwinakanis uk janiw yatksnati .
Ukampis aka toqenakat amuytʼañaw wakisispa .
Taqe yatichäwinakajj Jehová Diosatwa juti , uk janipun armañäniti .
Jehová Diosajja , Isaías profeta toqejj akham sänwa : “ Nayätwa [ Jehová ] Tatitu Diosamajja , nayasti kunatejj jumatakejj askïki ukwa yatichsma ” sasa ( Isa . 48 : 17 ) .
Aka yatichäwinjja , kuna yanaptʼanaktï Diosajj churkistu ukanakat sum yatjjatañatakejja , kunas yanaptʼistaspa ukwa kimsa toqet yatjjataskañäni .
¿ Kunatsa jukʼamp yatjjatañ amtampejj Diosan Arup leyiñasa ?
Jukʼamp yatjjatañ amtampiw liyiñasa .
“ Taqe Qellqatasti Diosan amuytʼayatawa , askirakiw [ a ] ” sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Biblianjja , mä qawqha cheqanakajj mä jaqetakiki jan ukajj mä qawqha jaqenakatakikiw qellqasïna , ukatwa jukʼamp yatjjatañ amtampejj leyiñasa .
Mä jilatajj akham siwa : “ Biblian mä sarnaqäwit liytʼasajja , walja yatichäwinak yateqañ amtampiw liytʼta .
Jukʼamp sum amuytʼañatakis chʼamachasiraktwa ” sasa .
Janïr Biblia liytʼkasajja , jukʼamp yateqañatakisa , kunanak yateqañastï Diosajj munki ukanak amuytʼañatakisa , yanaptʼapwa mayisiñasa ( Esd .
7 : 10 ; Santiago 1 : 5 liytʼañataki ) .
¿ Biblia sapüru liyisajj jukʼamp yateqañatakit chʼamachasisktanjja ?
( 7 tʼaqa uñjjattʼäta )
8 , 9 . 1 ) ¿ Kunsa Biblia liykasajj jisktʼasiñasa ?
2 ) Irpir chuymaninakataki utjki uka mayitanakajja , ¿ kunsa Jehová Diosat yatichistu ?
Jisktʼasiñasawa .
Biblia liykasajja , akham sasaw jisktʼasiñasa : “ ¿ Kunsa akajj Jehová Diosat yatichitu ?
¿ Kunjamsa yanaptʼitaspa ?
¿ Kunjamsa akampejj yaqhanakar yanaptʼirista ? ”
sasa . Ukham jisktʼasiñaw Bibliat jukʼamp yatjjatañatak yanaptʼistani .
Amuytʼañataki , kuna mayitanaktï irpir chuymaninakajj phoqapjjañapäki uka toqet amuytʼañäni ( 1 Timoteo 3 : 2 - 7 liytʼañataki ) .
Jiwasat jila partejja , janiw irpir chuymanïktanti . Ukatwa uka mayitanakajj janis jiwasatakjamäkaspa ukham amuysna .
Ukampis , aka tʼaqa qalltan saniwayktan uka kimsa jisktʼanakarjam Biblia liyisin amuytʼañäni ukhajja , walja yatichäwinakwa jikjjatsna .
Uk jichhajj uñjañäni .
“ ¿ Kunsa akajj Jehová Diosat yatichitu ? ”
Irpir chuymaninakan phoqapjjañapatakejja , Jehová Diosajj walja mayitanakwa Biblian qellqayawayi .
Uka mayitanakjja , tamapar sum uñjapjjañapataki amtampiw Jehová Diosajj churawayi .
Irpir chuymaninakajja , tamankirinakatak yateqaskayäpjjañapawa .
Janiw ukakïkiti , ‘ Yoqapan wilapampi alasiwayki ’ uka tamaparojja , kunjamsa uñjasipki uka toqetsa Jehová Diosajj cuentwa irpir chuymaninakar mayini ( Hech . 20 : 28 , NM ) .
Irpir chuymaninakampi suma uñjatäsajja , kusisita jakasiñaswa Jehová Diosajj muni ( Isa .
32 : 1 , 2 ) . Ukhamasti , irpir chuymaninakajj taqe uka mayitanak phoqapjjañapa yatisajja , Jehová Diosajj jiwasat llakisitapwa amuytanjja .
10 , 11 . 1 ) Irpir chuymaninakajj phoqapjjañapäki uka mayitanakat amuytʼañajja , ¿ kunjamsa yanaptʼistaspa ?
2 ) Uka mayitanakampejja , ¿ kunjamsa yaqhanakar yanaptʼsna ?
“ ¿ Kunjamsa yanaptʼitaspa ? ”
Irpir chuymaninakajja , mayitanakarjam phoqasipkiti janicha uk sapa kutiw amuytʼapjjañapa , ukhamatwa kunanakansa jukʼamp chʼamachasipjjañapa uk yatipjjani .
Mä jilatatï irpir chuymanïñ munchi ukhajja , uka mayitanak sum yatjjatañapawa , ukatsti ukarjam sarnaqañatakiw chʼamachasiñaparaki .
Cheqansa , irpir chuymaninakajj phoqapjjañapäki uka mayitanakat amuytʼañajja , yanaptʼistaspawa . ¿ Kunatsa ?
Jehová Diosajja , uka mayitanakarjamaraki taqe cristianonakajj sarnaqsna ukwa muni .
Sañäni , taqeniw ‘ suma chuymanïñasa ’ ‘ suma amuytʼampis sarnaqañasaraki ’ .
Irpir chuymaninakajj tamatak yateqaskay sarnaqapjje ukhajja , jupanakat yateqassnawa , jupanakjamaw Diosar iyawsaraksna .
“ ¿ Kunjamsa akampejj yaqhanakar yanaptʼirista ? ”
Irpir chuymaninakajj phoqapjjañapäki uka mayitanakjja , Bibliat yateqañ munirinakarusa jan ukajj Bibliat yateqerinakarusa liytʼayaraksnawa . ¿ Kunatakis liytʼaysna ?
Diosan markapan utjki uka irpir chuymaninakajj janiw cristianöpjjtwa sirinakan pʼeqtʼirinakapjamäkiti , uk amuytʼayañatakiw liytʼañasa .
Irpir chuymaninakajj phoqapjjañapäki uka mayitanak uñakiptʼañajja , kunanaktï jupanakajj jiwasar yanaptʼañatak lurasipki uk amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistani .
Ukaw taman irnaqtʼapki uka irpir chuymaninakar respetañatak yanaptʼistani .
Wal irnaqtʼapjjatapat jukʼamp respetañäni ukajja , jukʼamp kusisitaw jupanakajj jikjjatasipjjani .
12 , 13 . 1 ) Jukʼamp yatjjatañataki yanaptʼanakajj utjki ukanakampejja , ¿ kunanakatsa yatjjatsna ?
2 ) ¿ Kunjamsa jukʼamp yatjjatañajj yanaptʼistaspa ? Uk mä uñachtʼäwimpi qhanañchtʼma .
Yatjjatañasawa .
Jukʼamp yatjjatañataki yanaptʼanakajj utjki ukanakampejja , aka toqenakatwa Bibliat jukʼamp yatjjatsna :
¿ Khitis aka cheq qellqawayi ?
¿ Kawkinsa , kunapachas qellqasïna ?
Aka librojj qellqaskäna ukhajja , ¿ kunanakas pasäna ?
Uka toqenakat jisktʼasiñaw Bibliat jukʼamp yatjjatañatak yanaptʼistani .
Ukatakejja , Ezequiel 14 : 13 , 14 qellqatat amuytʼañäni , ukanjja siwa : “ Mä markatejj naya toqe sartani , jucha lurasa , janiraki taqe chuymampi arkkitaniti , uka markatakisti amparajj aytä mutuyañataki , kuna manqʼaña imasitanakapatejj utjki ukanaksa apaqarakïwa . Uka markjjarusti machʼa apayanirakëjja , jaqenakasa , uywanakasa manqʼatjamawa jiwarapjjani .
Uka markantejj Noé , Daniel ukhamaraki Job ukanakatejj jakapjjaspajja , uka kimsanikiw qhespipjjaspa aski jaqenakäpjjatap layku . Naya [ Jehová ] Tatituw ukjja arsta ” sasa .
Uka qellqatat jukʼamp yatjjatasajja , uka tʼaqanakajj 612 nayra pacha maranakanwa qellqasïna .
Uka tiempotakejja , Noé chachasa Job chachasa jiwatäjjapjjänwa .

Ukampis Danielajj jakaskänwa , niya 20 maranïpachänwa . Ukapachaw Jehová Diosajj Noé chachata , Job chachata , Daniel waynata parlkasajj ‘ aski jaqenakäpjjewa ’ sasin säna .
¿ Kunsa uka qellqatajj yatichistu ?
Jehová Diosajj jupat jan jitheqtir servirinakaparojja , waynäpasa tawaqöpasa , taqeniruw munasi ( Sal . 148 : 12 - 14 ) .
Wayn tawaqonakataki lurat qellqatanakajja , ¿ kunjamsa jupanakarusa , yaqhanakarus yanaptʼi ?
( 23 janankir foto uñjjattʼam ) .
Kunjamtï uñjaniwayktanjja , Bibliat jukʼampiw yatjjatsna .
Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakatsa yatjjataraksnawa .
Uka toqet mä qawqha amuytʼañäni .
Wayn tawaqonakataki qellqatanaka .
Aka qhepa maranakanjja , walja yatichäwinakaw jupanakatak qellqasiwayi .
Yaqhep yatichäwinakajja , escuelan jan waltʼäwinakar saykatañataki ukhamarak qʼajjo wayn tawaqonakajj jan waltʼäwinakan uñjasipki ukanakar saykatapjjañapatakiw wakichtʼasiwayi .
Uka yatichäwinakajja , ¿ kunjamsa jilïrinakarus yanaptʼistaspa ?
Wayn tawaqonakajj kuna jan waltʼäwinakansa uñjasipjje uk amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistaspa , ukham amuyasasti jupanakarojj yanaptʼsnawa , jan walinakar saykatapjjañapatakis chʼamañchtʼaraksnawa .
Wayn tawaqonakataki wakichtʼat qellqatanakjja , ¿ kunatsa jilïrinakajj liytʼapjjañaparaki ?
Bibliat apstʼat uka qellqatanakajja , janiw wayn tawaqonakatakik luratäkiti , jan ukasti jilïrinakarus yanaptʼarakispawa .
Taqeniw iyawsäwis arjjatañasa , chuymasan munañaparjam jan sarnaqañatakis chʼamachasiñasa . Ukatsti , jan walinak lurañataki mayninakajj wiytapkistu ukarusa , taqenirakiw saykatañasa , jan wali kusistʼäwinakatsa jarkʼaqasiñasarakiwa .
Wayn tawaqonakataki wakichtʼat qellqatanakajja , taqe ukanakatwa parli , ukham yaqha yatichäwinakatsa parlarakiwa .
Jumatï jilïrëjjsta ukhajja , ¿ uka qellqatanakajj wayn tawaqonakatakikiwa sasinti amuyañama ?
Janiwa .
Uka qellqatanakajj wayn tawaqonakatakjam luratäkchi ukasa , Biblian aski yatichäwinakaparjam wakichtʼatawa . Ukhamasti taqeniw uka qellqatanak liytʼapjjaspa .
Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakajja , ¿ kunjamsa wayn tawaqonakar yanaptʼaraki ?
Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanakasajja , wayn tawaqonakarojj janiw jan waltʼäwinakaru saykatañatakik yanaptʼawaykiti , jan ukasti ajay toqen jiltapjjañapatakisa , Jehová Diosar jakʼachasipjjañapatakisa yanaptʼawayarakiwa ( Eclesiastés 12 : 1 , 13 liytʼañataki ) .
Jilïrinakarusa uka qellqatanakajj yanaptʼarakispawa .
Amuytʼañataki , ¡ Despertad !
abril , 2009 revistanjja , mä yatichäwiw mistüna , uka yatichäwejj “ Los jóvenes preguntan .
¿ Cómo disfrutar la lectura de la Biblia ? ”
satänwa . Uka yatichäwinsti , walja ewjjtʼanakaw utjäna , mä recuadros utjarakïnwa , uka recuadrojj khuchsusina Bibliar imañatakïnwa .
Uka yatichäwejja , ¿ jan wayn tawaqöpki ukanakar yanaptʼawayarakiti ?
Casarata ukhamarak wawani mä kullakajj akham siwa : “ Biblia liyiñajj nayatak chʼamakïnwa . Jichhasti , uka qellqatan mistkäna uka ewjjtʼanakaparjama ukat recuadrojj utjkäna ukarjam Biblia liyiñajja , nayatak wali sumäjjewa .
Biblian utjki uka libronakas kunjamsa mä toqetak sum qhanañchi uksa amuyjjaraktwa , kunjamatï mä dibujojj wali suma coloranakampi lurtʼatäkejja ukhamawa .
Jichhajja , Biblia liyiñajj wal gustitu , janipuniw kunapachas ukham gustirïkituti ” sasa .
17 , 18 .
Jan Testigöpki jupanakatak Bibliat apstʼata qellqatanakajja , ¿ kunjamsa jiwasar yanaptʼarakistaspa ?
Uk mä uñachtʼäwimp qhanañchtʼma .
Jan Testigöpki jupanakatak wakichtʼat qellqatanaka . 2008 marat aksarojja , Jehová Diosan Testigonakapatakejj Yatiyañataki ( taman yatjjatañataki ) revistaw lurasjje .
Ukampis ¿ jan Testigöpki ukanakatak lurata revistajj yanaptʼarakistaspati ?
Akham amuytʼañäni .
Jumajj Tantachasiñ Utankkasmas ukham sañäni , taqenitaki arstʼäwi janïr qalltkipanjja , tantachäwir jutañapataki invittʼkayäta uka jaqe purinispa .
Cheqansa jumajj wali kusisitaw jikjjatasisma , janirakiw jupatsa armaskasmati .
Arstʼäwi istʼkasinsti , arstʼäwejj kunjamsa jupar yanaptʼani uka toqets lupʼiraktawa .
Jumas jupa lanti istʼkasma ukhamawa .
Arstʼäwi tukuyjjepansti , arstʼäwejj wali wakiskirïtapwa amuytajja ¿ janicha ?
Jan Testigöpki jupanakatak Bibliat apstʼata qellqatanak liytʼasajja , ukhamarakiw pasaspa .
Amuytʼañataki , Yatiyañataki ( yatiyir sarañataki ) revistanjja , yatichäwinakajj jan Testigöpki jupanakatakjam wakichtʼatawa .
Internetan jw.org cheqan utjki uka yatichäwinakas ukham wakichtʼatarakiwa . Ukanakat yaqhepajj “ Preguntas sobre la Biblia ” , “ Preguntas frecuentes ” ukanakawa .
Jiwasatï uka yatichäwinak liytʼañäni ukhajja , Biblian cheqa yatichäwinakapar jukʼamp munasiñatakiw yanaptʼistani .
Ukatsti , kunarutï iyawsktan ukanakat yaqhanakar jukʼamp sum qhanañchañsa yateqarakiñäniwa .
¡ Despertad !
revistasti , Diosan utjatapat jan pächasiñasataki , ukatjja kunarutï iyawsktan ukanak arjjatañatakiw yanaptʼarakistani ( 1 Pedro 3 : 15 liytʼañataki ) .
Kunanaktï Diosajj churkistu ukanakat yuspäratasjja , ¿ kunjamsa uñachtʼayañäni ?
Jehová Diosajja , walja ewjjtʼanaka ukhamarak walja yatichäwinakwa jiwasan askisatak churawayistu .
Ukhamasti , kunanaktï Diosajj churkistu uka yanaptʼanakat yatjjatasipkakiñäni , ukhamatwa taqe kunsa jiwasan askisatak yatichiri Diosarojj yuspäratas uñachtʼayañäni ( Isa . 48 : 17 ) .
[ 1 ] ( 14 tʼaqa ) : Amuytʼañataki , Kunsa wayn tawaqunakax yatiñ munapxi , ( mayïr ukhamarak payïr ) libronakaw utji .
Internetansti , “ Los jóvenes preguntan ” sat cheqaw utjaraki .
