YATIYAÑATAKI sat aka revistajja , taqe kunjjar Munañani Jehová Diosaruw jachʼañchi .
Ukat Diosan Apnaqäwipajja niyaw aka Oraqet jan walinak tukj - jjani ukat paraisoruw tukuyjjani sasaw jaqenakar chuymachi .
Ukhamaraki , uka Apnaqäwin Apnaqeri Jesucristor iyawsapjjañapatakiw yanaptʼaskaraki , kunattejj wiñay jakañ jikjjatapjjañasatakiw Jesusajj jiwäna .
Aka revistajj 1879 maratpach jichhakamawa qellqasiski , janiw política toqet parlkiti , jan ukasti Bibliatpun yatichi , kunattejj ukaw Diosan Arupajja .
Yatiyañataki sat revistajj oraqpachan Bibliat yatichañataki wakichatawa , yanaptʼañ munirinakan churäwinakapampiw uka yatichäwejj apasi .
Janiw aljasiñapäkiti .
Qollqemp yanaptʼañ munsta ukajja , Internetan jw.org cheqaruw mantasma .
Jiskʼa tʼaqanakajja Qullan Arunaka , 1992 , Bibliata apstʼatawa , jan ukhamäkanejja qhanañchasiniwa .
Kawkhantï MT letranakampi qhanañchaskejja Machaka Testamento Bibliata apstʼatawa ( uka Biblianakatjja aka revistan kunjam qellqatäkitï ukham qellqaqatawa ) .
Ukat kawkhantï NM letranakampi qhanañchaskejja Traducción del Nuevo Mundo de las Santas Escrituras ( con referencias ) español aruta apstʼatarakiwa .
NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ KHITINAKAS ALAJJPACHAN JAKAPJJE ?
‘ ¿ Khitinakas alajjpachan jakapjje ?
¿ Kunjamäpachas alajjpachajja ? ’ sasin inas jisktʼasirïsta .
Ukampis janiw juma sapak ukham jisktʼasktati .
Jaqenakajj nayratpachaw uka toqet kunaymaninak parlapjje .
Yaqhepajj nayra achachilanakasaw alajjpachan jakapjje , jupanakarojj yupaychasiñapawa sasaw creyipjje .
Yaqhepasti alajjpachan kusisita , jan kunat llakisisa jakasiñaw utji , ukanjja angelanakampi ukat jiwapki uka suma jaqenakampiw jakasipjje sasaw sapjjaraki .
Ukhamarus yaqhepajja , alajjpachan walja waranqa diosanakas utjkaspa ukhamwa amuyapjjaraki .
Janiw alajjpachat kunsa yatksnati , janiw khitis uka cheqat aka Oraqer jutkiti sasaw waljanejj sapjjaraki , ukampis ukham parlasajj pantjasipjjewa .
Janïr aka Oraqer jutkasajja , Jesusajj alajjpachanwa jakasïna .
Khä nayrïr patak maranakanjja , akham sasaw Jesusajj religión pʼeqtʼirinakar säna : “ Nayasti janiw alajjpachat munañajj lurasir jutkti , jan ukasti khitankitu ukan munañap luririw jutta ” sasa .
Arkirinakaparojja akham sasaw jupajj alajjpachat sarakïna : “ Awkejjan utapanjja walja utjäwinakaw jakañatak utji ” sasa .
Jesusan Awkipajj Jehová satawa , Jupan ‘ utapajja ’ alajjpachankiwa ( Salmo 83 : 18 , NM ) .
Ukhamasti Jehová Diosampi , Jesusampikiw kunjamas alajjpachajj uk sum qhanañchapjjestaspa .
Cheqansa jupanakajj alajjpachat muspharkañ visionanakwa jan jitheqtas servirinakapar uñjayapjjäna .
Akjjar jutki uka yatichäwinjja , kunsa visionanakajj alajjpachat qhanañchistu ukwa uñjaskañäni .
Ukanakat yatjjatkasajja , ak amuytʼañasawa ; alajjpachajj janiw aka pachjamäkiti , alajjpachajj janiw uñjaskaspati ni llamktʼaskarakispasa .
Kunjamas alajjpachajj ukjja , Jehová Diosajj wali sum qhanañchistu ukhamarus kuntï jaqenakajj sum uñtʼktan ukanakampiw qhanañcharakistu , ukhamat sum amuytʼañasataki .
Biblian qellqatäki uka visionanakajja , khitinakas alajjpachan jakapjje uk sum amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistani .
NAYRÏR JANAN PʼEQEÑCHÄWIPA | ¿ KHITINAKAS ALAJJPACHAN JAKAPJJE ?
Biblianjja walja muspharkañ visionanakaw qellqata . Uka visionanakajja , kunjamas alajjpachajj uk sum amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Jichhajja uka toqet wali amuyumpi yatjjatañamatakiw chʼamañchtʼapjjsma .
Visionanakat yatjjatasajja , janiw kunanakatï uka visionan uñstkäna ukanakajj cheqapunis utjkaspa ukham amuyañamäkiti . Uka visionanakajja , khitinakas alajjpachan jakapjje ukat kunsa yateqsna uk amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistani .
“ Alajjpachansti mä trono uñjarakta , ukansti mayniw qontʼatäskäna .
Uka tronon qontʼatäkän ukasti kʼajkir jaspe jan ukajj cornalina qalar uñtatarakïnwa . Tronoparusti mä kürmirakiw muyuntäna , ukasti esmeralda qalar uñtatarakiw kʼajäna ” ( Apocalipsis 4 : 2 , 3 ) .
“ Uka muytatansti mä qhanaw qhanarakïnjja , uka qhanasti kürmir uñtatarakïnwa , kunapachatejj kürmejj jalluna qenay taypin uñstkis ukhama .

Ukhamwa nayajj uñjta [ Jehová ] Tatitun kʼajkir kankañapjja ” ( Ezequiel 1 : 27 , 28 ) .
Uka visionanakjja apóstol Juanampi Ezequiel profetampiw uñjapjjäna , Jehová Diosajj kunja muspharkañ Diosasa uk amuytʼañasatakejja , kʼajkir suma qalanakata , kurmita ukhamarak mä tronotwa uka visionanakajj parlistu .
Ukanakaw Diosajj kunja muspharkañasa , kunja sumasa , kunja askisa ukanak amuytʼayistu .
Salmo qellqerejj akham sasaw qellqarakïna : “ [ Jehová ] Tatitojj taqe chʼamaniwa , jachʼar aptatäñapajj wakisipuniwa , kʼari diosanakat sipan wali ajjsarkayawa .
Yaqha markanakan diosanakapajj janiw kunäpkisa , Diosasti alajjpach luririwa ; aytat kankañampi , lliphipkir qhanampiw nayraqatapanki , chʼamampi , muspharkay kankañampiw qollan utapanki ” sasa ( Salmo 96 : 4 - 6 ) .
Jehová Diosajj Taqe Kunjjar Munañanïkchisa , oración toqe Jupar jakʼachassna ukwa muni ( Salmo 65 : 2 ) .
Diosajj munasistuwa ukhamarak jiwasat llakisirakiwa , ukatwa apóstol Juanajj jan pächasis “ Diosajj munasiñawa ” sasin qellqäna .
“ Estebanajj qollan ajayumpi phoqtʼatäsinwa alajjpachar uñtasina , Diosan jachʼa kankañap uñjäna .
Jesusarusti Diosan kupëjjapan saytʼatäskiri uñjarakïna .
Ukatsti sarakïnwa : ‘ ¡ Uñtapjjam ! Nayajj alajjpachanak jistʼarat uñjta .
Jaqen Yoqaparusti Diosan kupëjjapankaskiri uñjarakta ’ sasa ” ( Hechos 7 : 55 , 56 ) .
Judionakan pʼeqtʼirinakapajja , uka nayrakiw Jesusar jiwayapjjäna .
Estebanajja uka pachpa jaqenakampiw jichhajj parlaskäna . Uka visionanjja , Estebanajj Jesusaruw Diosan kupëjjapankaskir uñjäna .
Uka toqetjja Pablojj akham sasaw qellqäna : ‘ Jehová Diosajj jiwatanak taypitwa Jesusar jaktayi , ukatsti alajjpachanjja jupan kupëjjaparuw qontʼayasi , taqe munañaninakjjaru uttʼayasa , marka apnaqerinakjjaru , autoridadanakjjaru , chʼamaninakjjaru , kunatejj utji jichhürunakansa , qhepa urunakansa utjkani ukanakjjarusa ’ sasa .
Jesusajj ukham jachʼañchatäkchisa , Awkipjamarakiw jaqenakat wal llakisi sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Aka Oraqen Diosan Arunakap yatiykäna ukhajja , usutanakaruw qolläna , pisi chʼamaninakaruw yanaptʼäna ukat jiwatanakarus jaktayarakïnwa .
Jesusajj jakäwip churasaw qawqsa Diosarusa , jaqenakarus munasïna uk uñachtʼayäna .
Jupajj niyaw aka oraqjjar apnaqjjani , Diosan arunakaparjam sarnaqapki ukanakarus walja bendicionanakwa churarakini .
“ [ Naya Daniel profetajja ] uñchʼukiskakïyätwa , ukjjarusti mä trononakaw uchatarakïna , mä Jilïri chuymani jaqew qontʼasirakïna [ . . . ] .
Waranqa waranqanakarakiw juparojj servipjjäna , millón millonanakarakiw jupa nayräjjan saytʼatäpjjäna ” ( Daniel 7 : 9 , 10 ) .
Uka visionanjja , waranq waranqa angelanakwa Daniel profetajj uñjäna .
¡ Ukajj wali muspharkañäpachänwa !
Angelanakarojj janiw uñjksnati , ukampis jupanakajj amuytʼasiri wali chʼamanïpjjewa .
Jupanakajj wali suma uttʼayatäpjjewa , serafinanakas querubinanakas uka taypinkarakiwa .
Biblianjja 250 jila kutiw angelanakat parli .
Diosajj janïr aka Oraqsa ukat jaqenaksa lurkäna ukhaw angelanakar luräna .
Diosajj aka Oraq lurkäna ukhajja , angelanakajj alajjpachatwa uñchʼukisinipkäna ukat wali kusisitaw amparanakap tʼajjllirapjjarakïna ( Job 38 : 4 - 7 ) .
Diosat jan jitheqtas servir angelanakajja , Diosan Reinopat suma yatiyäwinakajj taqe cheqan yatiyasiñapatakiw yanaptʼasipki .
Ukham yanaptʼasipkatapjja mä visionanwa apóstol Juanajj uñjäna , ukatsti akham sänwa : “ Yaqha angelarakwa alajjpachan jalanaqaskir uñjta .
Jupasti wiñay qhespiyasiñ arunakanïnwa taqe jaqenakaru yatiyañataki , taqe markanakaru , taqe casta jaqenakaru , kunayman parlani jaqenakarusa ” sasa . Nayra tiemponjja angelanakajj jaqenakampiw awisajj parlapjjerïna , jichha tiemponjja janiw ukhamäjjeti .
Ukampis angelanakajja , Diosan arunakap yatiyapki ukanakaruw suma chuymani jaqenakar jikipjjañapatak yanaptʼapjje . “ Ukatsti mä jachʼa nuwasiñaw alajjpachanjja utjäna .
Arcángel Miguelasti [ Jesucristusti ] angelanakapampi saytʼasisinjja uka dragonampiw nuwasïna , Dragonampi angelanakapampisti saytʼasipjjarakïnwa , [ . . . ]
Ukhamajj uka dragonajj jaqonukutäjjänwa alajjpachatjja . Uka dragonapï nayrapacha uka jachʼa katarïnjja , ukasti Supaya , Satanás satarakiwa , juparakiw aka oraqen jaqenakarojj wali sallqjañanak luri .
Jupampi angelanakapampisti aka oraqeru jaqtanitäjjapjjänwa ” ( Apocalipsis 12 : 7 - 9 ) .
Alajjpachanjja jan walinakajj utjarakïnwa .
Aka Oraqen jaqejj jakañ qalltkäna ukhajja , mä angelaw Dios contra saytʼäna , Diosar yupaychañat sipansa jaqenakajj jupar yupaychapjjaspa ukwa munäna . Ukhamatwa Satanás sutimpi uñtʼayasïna uka sutejj Diosan “ Uñisiripa ” sañwa muni .
Tiempompejja yaqha angelanakaw Dios contra saytʼapjjarakïna , ukhamatwa jupanakajj demonionakar tukupjjäna .
Jan walinakampi apayasisajja , uka angelanakajj Dios contraw saytʼapjje ukat jila parte jaqenakaruw Diosat jitheqtayapjjaraki .
Supayasa , demonionakapasa wali phiru jan sinttʼasirinakawa .
Jupanakajj janiw jaqenakar munasipkiti , jan walinak utjañapatakisa jila partejj jupanakaw juchanïpjje .
Amuytʼañataki , mä kutejja Diosat jan jitheqtiri Job chachan uywanakapampi , servirinakapampwa Supayajj jiwarayäna .
Ukatjja yoqanakaparu ukat phuchanakaparuw kawkhantï manqʼasipkäna uka utamp alljjattayas jiwarayarakïna .
Taqe ukanak qhepatsti , Supayajj “ Job chacharojja jan qollkaña llejjti usumpiw usuntayäna .
Ukatsti uka llejjti usojja kayuta , pʼeqekamaw katuntäna ” ( Job 1 : 7 - 19 ; 2 : 7 ) .
Supayajj aka oraqen ‘ tiempopan jukʼakïtap yatisiwa ’ .
Ukhamajj janiw jutïrin utjjaniti , ¡ ukajj suma yatiyäwipuniwa !
“ [ Juma Jesusajj ] wilamampiw Diosataki alapjjestajja , taqe casta jaqenakaru , kunayman parlani jaqenakaru jiskʼa markaru , jachʼa markaru .
Reyinaka , sacerdotenakrakwa tukuyapjjestajja Diosatakejja .
Taqe aka oraqpacharu apnaqapjjañajjataki ” ( Apocalipsis 5 : 9 , 10 ) .
Jiwjjasajja alajjpacharuw Jesusajj sarjjäna , yaqhep jaqenakajja alajjpachar sarapjjarakiniwa .
Ukatwa Jesusajj jan jitheqtir apostolonakapar akham säna : “ Mä utjäwi jumanakatak wakichiriw sarä .
Sarasinsti , [ . . . ] wasitampiw jutä jumanakaru irpasjjañataki , kawkhankkätï nayajj jumanakajj ukkhankapjjañamatakiraki ” sasa .
Khitinakatï alajjpachar sarapki ukanakajja , Jesusamp chikaw aka oraqer apnaqanipjjani ukat walja bendicionanakwa utjayapjjarakini .
Jesusajj wali uñtʼat oracionapanjja Diosan Reinop mayipjjäta sasaw arkirinakapar yatichäna , jupasti akham sänwa : “ Alajjpachankir nanakan Awkejja , sutimajj jachʼañchatäpan .
[ Reinomampisti ] apnaqapjjeta .
Munañamasti luratäpan akapachanjja , kunjämatï alajjpachana luratäki ukhama ” sasa .
“ [ Naya apóstol Juanajj ] mä jachʼa aru istʼarakta alajjpachat artʼasiniri : ‘ ¡ Akajjay , Diosajj jichhajj jaqenak taypinwa jaki !
[ . . . ] Diosajj taqe jachanakapwa nayranakapatjja picharani , janirakiw jiwañas , jachañas utjkjjaniti , warariñasa ni usuyasiñasa .
Taqe kunanakatï nayrajj utjkän ukanakajj tukusjjewa ’ sasa ” ( Apocalipsis 21 : 3 , 4 ) .
Uka visionanjja , Jesusampi ukat alajjpachar sarapki ukanakampejj Diosan Reinopan apnaqapkani ukwa Juanajj uñjäna . Jupanakajja Supayan akapachankir apnaqäwip tʼunjasinjja , mä suma paraisoruw aka Oraq tukuyapjjani .
Jichhürunakan kunanakatï jaqenakar llakisiyki , tʼaqhesiykaraki ukanakas chhaqtayatäniwa .
Janiw jiwañas utj - jjaniti .
Ukampis khitinakatï jiwapki ukhamarak alajjpachar jan sarapkani uka waranq waranqa jaqenakampejj ¿ kunas pasani ?
Jupanakajja wasitat jaktanisinwa aka Oraqen mä suma Paraison jakasipjjani .
Walja jaqenakaw kunayman kʼari cuentonakar creyipjje ukat demonionakarus wal ajjsarapjjaraki .
Jarkʼaqasiñatakejja idolonaka , amuletonaka ukhamarak qollanak alasipjje .
Ukampis ukanakajj inamayakiwa , janiw jarkʼaqkaspati .
Bibliajj akham sistuwa : “ [ Jehová Diosan nayranakapajja ] sumwa uñjaski taqe akapachana kunanakatejj lurasiski ukanakjja , ukhamata chʼama churañataki khitinakatejj cheqpachana juparu iyawsasipki ukanakaru ” sasa ( 2 Crónicas 16 : 9 ) .
Jehová Diosakiw cheqpach Diosajja , jupajj Supayat sipansa jukʼamp chʼamaniwa , jumatï Jupar confiyäta ukhajja jan walinakat jarkʼaqätamwa .
Diosampi jarkʼaqayasiñatakejja , kunas Jupar kusisiyi ukwa yateqañama ukat ukarjamaw sarnaqañamaraki .
Amuytʼañataki , khä nayra patak maranakanjja , Éfeso markankir cristianonakajj layqasiñ libronak apthapisinjja ninaruw phichhantapjjäna .
Ukhamajja Diosampi jarkʼaqayasiñatakejja idolonaksa , amuletonaksa , layqasiñ libronaksa , demonionakat “ jarkʼaqasiñatak ” pitanaksa , jan ukajj chʼankhanaksa ukhamarak kunanakatï demonionakampi mayachasitäki taqe ukanakwa apanukjjañama .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Diosaruy jaysapjjam , Supayatakisti saytʼasipjjarakim , uka Supayasti jumanakatjja jaltawayjjarakiniwa ” sasa .
Jehová Diosar taqe chuym confiyas servïta ukhajja , Supayasa , demonionakasa janiw kuna jan walsa lurapkätamti .
Uñjawayktan uka visionanakajja Jehová Diosasa , Jesucristosa , Diosat jan jitheqtiri angelanakasa , alajjpachar sarañataki ajllitäpki ukanakasa qawqsa munasistu ukwa uñachtʼayistu .
Kunanakampsa Diosan Reinopajj lurani uk yatiñatakejja markaman jakasipki uka Jehová Diosan Testigonakapampiw parltʼasma jan ukajja Internetan jw.org cheqar mantasaw ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ? sat libro apaqasma .
Cigüeña
‘ Jichhajj jamachʼinakaru , jisktʼasim , jupanakasti yatichapjjeristamwa .
¿ Khitich jan yatki Jehová Diosajj taqe kuntejj uñjktan ukanakjja amparapampi luratapjja ? ’
( Job 12 : 7 , 9 ) . JAMACHʼINAKASA , pakasa ( jan ukajj águila ) ukat wallpasa wali yateqaskayäpjjewa . Ukjja 3.000 jila maranak nayraw Job chachajj amuyjjäna .
Biblianjja , uñachtʼäwinakat parlañatakiw wal apnaqasi .
Ukat sum jakasiñataki , Diosampi sum apasiñatakis kunjamsa yanaptʼapjjestaspa ukanaksa yaticharakistuwa .
Uk jichhajj uñjañäni .
Golondrina
Jerusalén markan jakirinakajja , golondrina jamachʼinak sum uñtʼapjjäna .
Uka jamachʼinakajj uta techoruw tapachasipjjerïna , Salomón chachan templopansa tapachasipjjarakïnwa .
Golondrina jamachʼinakajja , mara maraw uka templon sumaki jakasipjjpachäna ukhamarak chhiwchinakapsa uka cheqan wali sum uywapjjarakpachäna .
Salmo 84 qellqerejja , golondrina jamachʼinakan tapanakapwa templon uñjpachäna , jupajj sapa sojjta phajjsiw mä semana templon Diosar serviri sarirïna .
Jupajj golondrinanakar uñtasitaw Diosan utapan wiñayatak jakasiñ munarakïna .
Ukatwa akham säna : “ ¡ Taqe chʼaman Diosay , qollan utjäwimajj munkayawa !
Taqpach almajjampiw temploman uyupankañ munta ” sasa .
Ukat akham saskakïnwa : “ Taqe chʼaman Tatitojjay , Reyejjay , Diosajjay , jamachʼinakamppachaw jakʼaman tapachtʼasi , golondrina jamachʼisti , chhiwchinakapatakejj altaraman tap jikjjataraki ” sasa ( Salmo 84 : 1 - 3 ) .
Jiwasasa wawanakasasa , ¿ ukhamarakit Diosan markapampi ukat jilat kullakanakampi tantachasiñ wali askit uñjtanjja ?
( Salmo 26 : 8 , 12 ) .
Jeremías profetajja , akham sasaw qellqarakïna : “ Cigüeña sat jamachʼis alajjpachanjja yatiwa kunapachatejj kuttaniñapäki ukjja ” sasa .
Jeremiasajja kunapachas cigüeñanakajj mä cheqat yaqha cheqar sarjjapjjäna uk sumwa yatpachäna , Suma Oraqenjja , ukajj wali sumaw uñjasirïna .
Primavera phajjsinakanjja , 300.000 jila cigüeñanakaw África cheqat Europa uksa cheqar Jordán vallenjam jalapjje sasaw sapjje .
Cigüeñanakarojja Diosaw ukham amuytʼasir lurtʼawayi , jupanakajj sapa verano phajjsinakaw kawkhantï wawanakapar uywapkaspa uka cheqanakar kuttʼanjjapjje .
Cigüeñanakasa ukat yaqha jamachʼinakasa “ yatipjjarakiwa kunapachatejj yaqha cheqaru sarjjapjjañapäki ukjja ” ( Jeremías 8 : 7 ) .
“ Jamachʼinakajja kunapachas mä cheqat yaqha cheqar sarapjjañapa ukjja yatipjjewa , ukajj wali muspharkañawa ” sasaw Collins Atlas of Bird Migration librojj qhanañchi .
Diosajja jamachʼinakarojj yatiñanwa lurawayi , ukhamat kunapachas mä cheqat yaqha cheqar sarjjapjjañapa uk yatipjjañapataki .
Jaqenakarojja kuna tiemponsa jakasktan uk yatiñatakejj amuytʼasir lurawayarakistu .
Cigüeñanakajja kunapachas yaqha cheqar sarapjjani uk jupanakakiw amtapjje , ukampis jaqenakajja Diosatwa nayraqatajj yatjjatañasa ukhamat kuna tiemponsa jakasktan uk amuytʼañasataki .
Jeremías tiempon jakir Israelitanakajja , janiw kuna tiemponsa jakasipkäna uk amuytʼapkänti .
Ukatwa Diosajj akham säna : ‘ Jupanakajj janipuniw kuna yatiñanïpkisa , arunakajjsa janiw istʼañ munapkiti ’ sasa ( Jeremías 8 : 9 ) .
‘ Qhepa urunakanwa ’ jakasktan sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Cigüeñat yateqasisajj ¿ qhepa urunakan jakaskatas amuyasktanti ?
Paka ( águila )
Bibliajja pakat walja kutiw parli .

Suma Oraqe uksanjja , kunjamänsa pakajja uk sum yatipjjäna .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Uka patatpachwa kunürutejj katuntkani ukarusa uñchʼukiniraki ” sasa ( Job 39 : 27 - 29 ) .
Pakanakan nayranakapajja , 1 kilómetro jayaruw uñjaspa .
Kunjamtï pakajj wali jayar uñjkejja , ukhamarakiw Jehová Diosajj kunas jutïrin pasani ukanak wali sum yatiraki .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Nayaw taqe kunan tukusiñapsa , qalltatpach yatiyta , nayratpachrakwa kunatejj qhepat luraskani ukanaksa yatiytjja ” sasa ( Isaías 46 : 10 ) .
Diosan Aruparjam sarnaqañäni ukhajja , yatiñapwa churistani ukat kunas jutïrin pasani uk amuytʼañatakis yanaptʼarakistaniwa ( Isaías 48 : 17 , 18 ) .

Bibliajja khitinakatï Diosar confiyapki ukanakajj pakar uñtasitäpjjewa sasaw akham sasin qhanañchi : Jehová Diosar confiyapki ukanakajja chʼamaniw tukupjjani , águila pakalinakar uñtatarakiw jalapjjani sasa ( Isaías 40 : 31 ) .
Pakajja , wali alton jalañatakejj oraqet juntʼu thayajj alajjpachar makatki ukampiw yanaptʼayasi .
Juntʼu thayajj utjki ukhajja , pakajj chheqanakap ayatatasaw wali altor muytas muytas makati , ukham lurasajja , janiw chʼam tukkiti .
Diosar taqe chuyma confiyapki ukanakajja , ‘ jachʼa chʼamajj Diosat juti ’ sasaw confiyapjjaraki .
Wallpampi chhiwchinakapampi
Janïr jiwayatäkasajja , Jesusajj Jerusalén marka uñtasin akham sänwa : “ ¡ Jerusalén , Jerusalén , jumawa profetanakarojj jiwaytajja , Diosan khitanitanakaparusti qalampirakiw kʼupjaraktajja ! ¡ Nayasti qawqha kutirakiw jumanakarojj tantachtʼañ munapjjäyäsmajja kunjämtï mä wallpajj jiskʼa chhiwchhinakaparojj jawsthapki ukhama , ukampis janiw munapktati ! ”
sasa .
Jamachʼinakasa , pakasa ukat wallpasa wal chhiwchinakapat jarkʼasiñ yatipjje .
Wallpatï mä pakaru uñjchi ukhajja , chhiwchinakapar jarkʼaqañatakejj warartañ yati , ukhamatwa chhiwchinakapajj taykapan chheqanakapar imantasipjje .
Jalluta ukat lupit jarkʼaqasiñatakejja , chhiwchinakajj taykapan chheqanakaparuw imantasipjjaraki .
Jesusajja ukhamarakiw Jerusalén markan jakir jaqenakar yanaptʼañsa ukat jarkʼaqañsa munäna .
Jichhürunakanjja , Jesusajj jupar llakinakas jaytañasatakiw chʼamañchtʼistu .
Jamachʼinakatsa , pakatsa ukat wallpatsa waljanakwa yateqapjjsna .
Jutïrin jupanakar uñjañäni ukhajja , kunjamäpjjesa ukat kunsa yateqsna uka toqetwa lupʼiñasa .
Mä golondrina jamachʼir uñjkañäni ukhajja , kawkhantï Diosar yupaychktan ukar wali askit uñjañatakiw chʼamachasiñasa .
Diosaw chʼam churitani sasaw pakar uñtasit confiyañasaraki .
Jan waltʼäwinakan uñjaskañäni ukhajja , Jesusaruw taqe llakinakas jaytañasa , jupajj kunjamtï mä wallpajj chhiwchinakapar jarkʼaqki ukhamwa jarkʼaqestani .
Cigüeñat yateqasisajja , kuna urunakansa jakasktan uk wali sum amuytʼañasaraki .
KHÄ 1520 maranakanjja , mä domingo alwajj iglesianwa Mateo , Marcos , Lucas ukat Juan libronak ( jan ukajj Evangelionak ) francés arut liytʼir istʼapjjäna . Nayrajj latín arutakwa Bibliajj liytʼasirïna , ukatwa Meaux sat cheqan jakasir jaqenakajj wal kusisipjjäna .
Meaux cheqajja , París , Francia markat alay toqenkiwa . Jacques Lefèvre dʼÉtaples sat chachaw francés arur Biblia jaqokipäna ( latín arunjja , Jacobus Faber Stapulensis sasin uñtʼatarakiwa ) . Jupajja akham sasaw uka qhepat mä amigopar qellqäna : “ Pisin jakasir jaqenakarojj walpun Diosajj Arupa yatipjjañapatak yanaptʼaski ” sasa .
Uka tiemponjja , Católica Iglesiasa , París markankir teologonakasa , francés arut Biblia apnaqasiñap jarkʼapjjänwa .
Ukampis ¿ kunas Lefèvre chachar francés arur Biblia jaqokipañatak yanaptʼpachäna ?
¿ Kunjamsa pisin jakasir jaqenakar Diosan Arup amuyapjjañapatak yantʼäna ?
Biblia janïr jaqokipkasajja , Lefèvre chachajj filosofía ukat teología toqenakat parlir nayra libronakatwa wal yatjjatirïna , ukhamat kunatï qellqatäki ukajj cheqäskapuniti janicha uk yatiñataki .
Jupajja kunjamsa tiempompejj yaqhep nayra qellqatanakajj mayjtʼayasïna , jan ukajj jan sum jaqokipaskäna ukwa uñjäna .
Ukatwa Católica Iglesian Bibliapat yatjjatañ amtäna , uka Bibliajj Vulgata latina sasin uñtʼatänwa .
Diosan Qollan Qellqatanakap wali sum yatjjatasajja , “ Diosat kunatï cheqäki ukanak yatisakiw maynejj kusisit jakasispa ” sasaw Lefèvre chachajj säna .
Ukatwa filosofía toqet yatjjatañ jaytjjäna , ukhamat Biblia jaqokipañataki .
Khä 1509 maranjja , Lefèvre chachajj Salmos * libro latín arur jaqokipat phesqa versionanakwa comparañataki apsüna , askichkäna uka Vulgata qellqatas uka taypinkarakïnwa .
Jupajja kunsa cheqpachapuni Bibliajj yatichi ukwa yatiñ munäna , janiw uka tiempon jakir teologonakjamäkänti .
Kunjamtï Biblia jaqokipkäna ukajja , qhepat walja jaqokipirinakaruw yanaptʼawayi ( ukatakejj “ Lefèvre chachajj kunjamsa Martín Lutero chachar yanaptʼäna ” sat recuadro uñjjattʼäta ) .
Salmos libron Diosat parlañatak apnaqaskäna uka tabla , 1513 maran apsuskäna Psalterium Quintuplex qellqata .
Lefèvre chachajj católico familianwa nasïna . Kunsa Bibliajj cheqpachapun yatichi uk pisin jakasir jaqenakajj yatipjjani ukhajja , Iglesiajj kʼari yatichäwinakap jaytjjaniwa sasaw jupajj amuyäna .
Uka tiempotakejja Bibliajj latín arutak utjäna , ukhamajj ¿ kunjamatsa jaqenakajj Biblia sum amuyapjjasapäna ?
Pusi Evangelio libronak qalltan uñstki uka qhanañchäwejja , Lefèvre chachajj taqeni Biblianipjjaspa uk munatap uñachtʼayistu .
Lefèvre chachajj Diosan Arupar wal munasïna , Bibliajj taqenin utjaspa ukwa munäna .
Ukatwa 1523 maran , junio phajjsin pusi Evangelio libronak francés arut apsüna , ukajj facil apnaqañakïnwa ukat janiw walja qollqetakïkänti .
Pisin jakasipkäna uka jaqenakasa uka Biblia alasipjjarakisapänwa .
Taqeniw uka Biblia liytʼañ munapjjäna , chachanakasa warminakasa kuntï Jesusajj yatichkäna ukwa pachpa arupat yatiñ munapjjäna .
1.200 Biblianakaw lurasïna ukat jankʼakiw mä qawqha phajjsin tukusjjäna .
Mateo , Marcos , Lucas ukat Juan libronaka qalltapanjja , Lefèvre chachajj “ pisin jakasir jaqenakaru ” yanaptʼañatakiw Bibliajj francés arur jaqokipasiwayi , “ kunatï Jesusat parlir libronakan uñstki ukanakajj cheqätapa jupanakajj yatipjjaspa , kunjamatejj latín arun amuytʼaski ukhama ” sasaw qellqäna .
Ukampis ¿ kunatsa jaqenakan Biblia liytʼapjjañap munpachäna ?
Lefèvre chachajja , kunjamsa jaqenakan filosofía yatichäwinakapasa ukat yaqha jan wali yatichäwinakasa , Católica Iglesiar jan waltʼayäna uk sumwa amuyäna .
Jupajja Evangelio libronakat “ taqe cheqan yatiyasispa , ukat jan khitisa jaqenakan jan wali yatichäwinakapampi engañatäjjaspati ” ukwa suyäna .
Khitinakatï francés arur Biblia jaqokipasiñapa jarkʼapkäna ukanakarusa , kuntï sapkäna ukanakajj kʼarïtapwa uñachtʼayäna .
Akham sasaw jupanakarojj säna : “ Jumanakajj janiw jaqenakan Biblia utjañapsa ni liyipjjañapsa munapktati .
Ukhamajj ¿ kunjamaraki kuntï Jesusajj yatichkäna ukarjam jaqenakajj sarnaqapjjanisti ? ” sasa .
Ukatwa Sorbona Universidadan , París markankir teologonakajj Lefèvre chachar amuktʼayañ munapjjäna . 1523 maran agosto phajjsinjja , Biblia jan jaqokipasiñapatakiw jarkʼapjjäna .
Uka jaqenakajja “ Iglesiaruw jan waltʼayani ” sasaw sapjjäna .
Janitejj Francia marka apnaqer Francisco I reyejj arjjatkaspäna ukhajja , mä kutkatasir chachar uñtasitaw jiwayat uñjasispäna .
Lefèvre chachajja , janiw uka jan wali jaqenakan jarkʼata uñjasisajj aynachtʼkänti . 1524 maran Griego Arut Qollan Qellqatanak ( jan ukajj Machaq Testamento ) jaqokipañ tukuyasajja , Salmos libronak francés arur jaqokiparakïna .
Ukhamat jaqenakajj Diosar “ taqe chuyma mayisipjjañapataki ukat servipjjañapataki ” .
Sorbona Universidadankir teologonakajja , jankʼakiw Lefèvre chachajj apskäna uka qellqatanak jan wali amtampi uñakipapjjäna .
Machaq Testamento jaqokipkäna uksa , taqen uñjkata phichantañwa mayipjjäna ukat yaqhep qellqatanakapajj “ Lutero chachan kutkatasitap qhanañchi ” sasaw sapjjarakïna .
Teologonakajj Lefèvre chachar jawsayanipkäna ukhajja , jupajj “ janiw kamskänsa ” ukat Estrasburgo sat lugararuw jaltjjäna , uka lugaranwa Biblia jaqokipaskakïna .
Yaqhepajja Lefèvre chachan ukham jaltjjatapajj janis walïkaspa ukhamwa amuyapjje , ukampis jupajj khitinakatï “ suma yatichäwinaka ” jan askit uñjapki ukanakampi chʼajjwañajj janiw wakiskiti sasaw amuyäna .
Jaltjjatapat mä mara pasjjäna uka qhepatjja , Francisco I reyiw pusi marani Carlos wawapar uñjañapataki Lefèvre chachar uttʼayäna .
Ukaw Lefèvre chacharojj Biblia jaqokipañatak yanaptʼäna . 1530 maranwa Bibliajj imprimisjjäna , ukampis janiw Francia markan imprimiskänti , jan ukasti Amberes , Bélgica markanwa Emperador Carlos V apnaqerin permisopampi imprimisïna .
*
Lefèvre chachajja , Iglesiajj jaqenakan kʼari yatichäwinakap jaytjjaniwa ukat Bibliajj yatichki ukarjamaw sarnaqjjapjjani sasaw amuyäna .
Jupatakejja , “ taqe cristianonakaw Biblia liyiñatakisa , amuyañatakisa derechonïna ukat ukham lurapjjañapaw wakisiraki ” sasaw säna .
Ukatwa taqenin Biblia utjañapataki yanaptʼäna ukat chʼamachasirakïna .
Iglesiajj jan wali yatichäwinak apanukuspa uksa jupajj wal munkchïnjja , ukajj janiw kunapachas phoqaskänti .
Ukampis Lefèvre chachajja , Diosan Arup uñtʼapjjañapatakiw pisin jakasir jaqenakar yanaptʼawayi . Psalterium Quintuplex qellqatanjja , Salmos libro jaqokipat phesqa vercionanakaw columnanakar jaljat uñstäna .
Diosat parlañatakejja mä tablaw utjarakïna , ukanjja kawkïr sutinakas apnaqasi ukwa qhanañchäna , ukanjja hebreo arut pusi letranakani Tetragrámaton sutiw ukankarakïna .
Ukajja , hebreo arun kunjamsa Diosan sutipajj qellqasi ukwa uñachtʼayäna .
Phesqa mara qhepatwa , 1535 maran Francia markan jakasir yaqha arur jaqokipir Olivétan chachajj Biblia apsurakïna .
Juparojj Lefèvre chachan Biblia jaqokipatapaw Griego Arut Qollan Qellqatanak jaqokipañatak yanaptʼäna .
Lefèvre chachan qellqatanakapat yatjjatkäna ukhajja , Martín Lutero chachajj janiw wali uñtʼatäkänti .
Lutero chachajj waynäkan ukhajja , kunjamsa Qollan Qellqatanak Lefèvre chachajj wali qhana ukat amuykaña qhanañchäna ukwa amuyäna .
Ukaw Lutero chachar wal yanaptʼäna ukat Biblia jaqokipiri William Tyndale chacharusa ukhamarak Juan Calvino chacharus yanaptʼarakïnwa .
Lefèvre chachajj católico jaqjamas jiwkchïnjja , qellqatanakapajj Biblia jaqokipañatak wali sum yanaptʼäna ukhamarak cheqa yatichäwinaka sum qhanañchañatakis yanaptʼarakïnwa .
SARNAQÄWI
Bernhard Merten jilatan arsutaparjama
Jaqenakajj ajjsarayasipki ukhajja , maynin amparapat katuntasipjje , ukampis nayajj janiw ukham lurirjamäktti .
Paqallqo maranïkayäta ukhaw jan jiwañajatak amparanakajj khuchoqapjjetäna .
Nayajj 1960 maranwa nasta , mamajasti 17 maranikïskänwa , ukharakiw tatajajj jaytawayjjäna .
Mamajampejj Burg sat jiskʼa markanwa achachilanakajampi jakasipjjayäta , ukajja República Democrática Alemana ( jan ukajj Alemania oriental ) markankiwa .
Uka cheqan jakir jaqenakasa ukat familiajasa janiw Diosan utjatap creyipkänti .
Achachilajajj wal munasitäna , ukhamajj kʼuchikiw jakasiyäta .
Jupampejj taqe kun anatapjjerïta , qoqanakar makatasin ramanak khuchuñsa yaticharakitänwa .

Ukanak lurañajj wal gustitäna .
Wawäkasajj kʼuchiki ukat kusisitaw jakasiyäta .
Mä urojja kunapachatï 7 maranëjjayäta ukhajja , escuelat kuttʼanisajj mä jachʼa torreruw makatayäta , ukat mä jan waliruw purtʼasiyäta .
Uka jachʼa torrejja , niya 8 metronak altünwa , ukhamajj corrientempiw katjayasiyäta .
Hospitalan sartasajja , paypach amparajajj janiw utjänti .
Kunatejj wali nakhantatänwa , ukhamajj wilaruw jan waltʼayaspäna .
Mamajampi achachilanakajampejj wali llakitäpjjänwa .
Ukampis niyakejjay wawaskchiyätjja , janiw kunjamsa jakäwijan ukajj aynachtʼayitani uk amuykayätti .
Hospitalat mistusajj escuelar kutʼjjayätwa , ukampis escuelankir masinakajajj wal jiskʼachapjjetäna , nuktʼapjjetäna ukhamarak larusipjjetäna .
Jiskʼachir arunakapajja , wal chuym ustʼayitäna .
Ukampis uka qhepatjja , Birkenwerder sat cheqan discapacitado wawanakatak utjki uka escuelaruw uchjjapjjetäna .
Uka escuelajj utajat jayankänwa , ukhamajj mamajasa ukat achachilanakajasa janiw visitir jutirjamäpkänti .
Jupanakampejj vacacionanakwa jikisiyäta , tunka maranakaw wali jayan jakasirakiyäta .

Kayunakajampejj kunaymaninak lurañwa yateqawayta .
Sañäni , kunjamsa mä cuchara jan ukajj mä tenedor kayunakampi katusma uk amuytʼma .
Cheqas ukajj wali chʼamawa , ukampis ukanak lurañwa yateqawayta .
Laka chʼakhanak cepillompi jarisiñsa ukhamarak peinasiñsa yateqawayaraktwa .
Kayunakajampi ademananak lurañsa yateqaraktwa , ukhamajj kayunakajajj amparar uñtasitaw taqe kuna lurjjäna .
Qʼajjo waynitöjasajja , jutïrin amparanëjjawa uka amparanakajajj taqe kun lurani sasaw wal kusisirïta . 14 maranëjjayäta ukhajja , cigarro fumañ qalltayäta .
Fumañajj jan sinti llakisiñatakis yanaptʼkitaspa ukat mayni jaqenakjamas taqe kun lurañ yatkirista ukham amuyayäta .
Ukatwa akham sirïta : “ Jilïr jaqenakakiw cigarro fumapjje , nayajj fumarakiristwa .
Janis amparanïkstjja , janiw ukajj aynachtʼaykitaniti ” sasa .
Jakaskayäta uka cheqanjja , jan tiemponiw sarnaqayäta .
Mä organizacionar kunaw qellqayasiyäta , ukajj Juventud Libre Alemana sat sutinïnwa .
Uka organizacionajj gobiernon yanapatänwa , ukanwa nayajj secretariot trabajiyäta .
Poesía ukat cantañ yateqañatakisa qellqayasirakiyätwa , discapacitado jaqenakatak utjki uka anatañanakansa anatarakiyätwa .
Yateqañ tukuyjjasajja , mä empresan trabaj jikjjatayäta .
Jilïrejjasajja prótesis sasin uñtʼat ampar uchasjjayäta , nayajj mayninakjam jakasiñwa munarakiyäta .
Mä urojja trabajojjar sarañatakejj mä tren suyaskayäta , ukatjja mä chachaw jakʼachasisin akham sitäna : ‘ Diosajj wasitatwa amparanakam churiristam ’ sasa .
Uk istʼasajj wal mayjtʼasiyäta , nayajj wasitat paypach amparanïña munayätwa , ukampis uka chachajj loqhëkaspasa jan ukajj kuntï siskäna ukajj janis walïkaspa ukhamwa amuyayäta .
Diosajj janiw nayatak utjkänti .
Ukatwa uka chachampejj mayamp jan parlañ munjjayätti .
Qhepatjja , mä trabajir masijaw familiapar visitir sarañatak invittʼitäna .
Café umaskasajja trabajir masijan awk taykapajj Diosat parlañ qalltapjjäna .
Jehová sasaw uka Diosar sapjjäna , ukhapuniw nayrïr kuti Diosajj sutinïtap istʼayäta ( Salmo 83 : 18 , NM ) .
Ukampis akham sasaw nayajj amuyayäta : “ Diosajj janiw utjkaspati , inamayaw uka suti apnaqasipki .
Nayaw jupanakar pantjasipjjatap sum qhanañchirista ” sasa .
Diosajja janiw nayatakejj utjkänti , ukhamajj Bibliat jupanakamp parlañwa qalltayäta .
Ukampis janiw kunapachas Diosajj jan utjatap qhanañchkayätti .
Profecianak yatjjatasajja , kuntï amuykayäta ukajj mayjtʼjjänwa .
Biblian qellqatäki uka profecianakajj phoqasipunïnwa , yaqhepajj walja maranak nayras qellqaskchïnjja phoqasirakïnwa .
Mä kutejja kunjamäskis aka pachajj uk amuytʼañatakejja , Mateo 24 jaljata ukat Lucas 21 jaljampita ukhamarak 2 Timoteo 3 jaljampitwa yatjjatapjjta .
Mä jaqejj kuna usunisa uk yatiñatakejja , doctorajj kunas uka jaqer usu ukwa yatjjatañ yati , Biblian profecianakapajja ukhamarakiw “ qhepa urunakan ” jakaskatas amuytʼañataki yanaptʼistu .
* Ukanak yatjjatasajja , walpun muspharayäta .
Uka profecianakajj cheqapuniw phoqasiskäna .
Kunanaktï Biblian yateqkayäta ukajj cheqäskapunïnwa .
Ukatwa Diosar oracionan mayisjjayäta , walja maranakas cigarro fumkchiyätjja , jaytjjäyätwa .
Mä mara Bibliat yatjjatasajja , 1986 maran 27 abril phajjsinwa mä bañeran jamasata bautisasiyäta .
Uka maranakanjja Alemania oriental cheqan Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj jarkʼatäpjjänwa .
Niyakejjay Testigonakajj uka cheqan jarkʼatächïnjja , mä utan jukʼanikiw tantachasipjjerïta , janiw walja jilat kullakanakarus uñtʼkayätti .
Qhepatjja , jilïr autoridadanakaruw Alemania occidental cheqar viajiñatak permiso mayiyäta , uksanjja janiw Testigonakajj jarkʼatäpkänti , jupanakajja viajiñatak permis churapjjetänwa .
Ukhapuniw nayrïr kuti mä jachʼa tantachäwir sarayäta , walja jilat kullakanakar uñjañasa wali kusiskañänwa .
Muro de Berlín satäki uka jachʼa perqanakajj jaqonukutäkäna uka qhepatjja , janiw Testigonakajj jarkʼata uñjasjjapjjänti .
Ukhat aksarojj jan khitin jarkʼataw Diosar servjjapjjayäta .
Ukatwa nayajj jukʼampi horanak yatiyañ amtayäta , ukampis jan uñtʼat jaqenakamp parlañ wal ajjsarayäta ukat janis kunatakis askïkirista ukhamwa amuyayäta .
Ukhamarus 1992 maranjja , sapa phajjsi 60 horanak yatiyañ amtayäta , wali kusisitäyätwa .
Ukhamasti sapa phajjsi 60 horanak yatiyañ amtjjayäta , ukat kimsa maraw ukham yatiyawayta .
Aka arunakajj wal yanaptʼitu : ‘ Maynitejj aynachtʼatächi ukhajja , nayajj wal llakista ’ sasa .
Nayajja amuytʼasiñsa , parlañsa puedisktwa , ukhamajj mayninakar yanaptʼañatakiw wal chʼamachasta .
Niyakejjay jan paypach aparanïkstejja , khitinakatï ukham uñjasipki ukanakajj kunjamas jikjjatasipjje uk sumwa yatta .
Kunapachatï maynejj kun lurañsa wal muni ukat jan lurirjamäkiti uk sumwa yatirakta .
Ukatwa mayninakar yanaptʼañataki wal chʼamachasta , ukham lurasajj kʼuchikiw jikjjatasirakta .
Bibliat jaqenakar parlañajj walpun kusisiyitu .
Awisajja mä jukʼanak llakisiraktwa , mayninakjam paypach amparanïña munta .
Taqe kun lurañatakiw wal chʼamachasta , ukampis tiempompi ukat chʼamampiw munasi .
Aka arunakaw yanaptʼitu : “ Criston chʼamapampejj taqe kunaruw saykatirista ” .
Jehová Diosaw sapür chʼam churitu .
Jupajj janiw kunapachas jaytkituti , ukatwa nayajj Jupar jan jaytañ munkarakti .
Diosajj mä suma familiampiw bendesiwayitu , waynäkasajj ukham familianïñ wal munayäta .
Esposajajj Elke satawa , jupajj wali munasiri khuyaptʼayasir warmiwa .
Oraqpachanjja walja jilat kullakanakaw utjarakitu , jupanakaw jilanakajasa kullakanakajasa ukhamarak familiajasa .
Elke esposajampi
Diosajj akham siwa : “ Uñjam , nayajj taqe kunwa machaqat lurta ” sasa . Ukhamajj paypach amparajajj wasitampiw utjjetani , uk yatiñajj wal chuymachtʼitu .
Jesusajj kunanaktï aka oraqenkkasajj lurkäna ukanak yatiñaw yanaptʼitu .
Jupajja usutanakaruw qolläna ukat jiñchu khuchoqapkäna uka chacharus qollarakïnwa .
Jehová Diosajj arsuwayki uka profecianakasa ukhamarak Jesusajj lurkäna uka milagronakasa , jutïrin paypach amparajaw utjjetani sasin amuyañatakiw yanaptʼitu .
Ukampis jukʼamp jachʼa bendicionajj akawa , Jehová Diosar uñtʼaña .
Jupaw Awkejasa , amigojasa , chuymachirijasa ukat yanapirijasa .
Nayajj David reyjamarakiw akham sirista : ‘ Jehová Tatituw chʼamajäjja , jupasti yanaptʼituwa . Chuymajjajj kusisitawa ’ sasa ( Salmo 28 : 7 ) .
Diosan cheqa yatichäwinakap taqe chʼamajampiw qhomjjarta , janiw kunapachas jaytkäti .
Janis paypach amparanïkstjja , taqe chʼamajampiw qhomjjarta .
Ukatakejja ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ? librot yatjjatma , uka libron 9 yatichäwipajj “ ¿ ‘ Qhipa urunakankxtanti ’ ? ” sat pʼeqeñchäwiniwa , ukajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan luratawa , Internetan jw.org cheqansa utjarakiwa .
¿ DIOSASAJJ . . . taqe oracionanakti istʼpacha ?
yaqhep oracionanakakti istʼpacha ?
janit oracionanak istʼkpacha ?
BIBLIAJJ AKHAM SIWA
‘ Jehová Tatitojj artʼasirinakapan jakʼapankaskiwa , cheqa chuymampi artʼasirinakapan jakʼapana ’ ( Salmo 145 : 18 ) .
BIBLIAJJ AKHAM SASKAKIWA
Khitinakatï yatkasin jan walinak lurapki ukanakan oracionanakap janiw Diosajj istʼkiti ( Isaías 1 : 15 ) .
Ukampis taqe chuyma arrepentisipki ukanakajj wali sum Diosampejj apasipjjaspa ( Isaías 1 : 18 ) .
Diosan mayisitanakas istʼañapatakejja , munañaparjamaw Diosar mayisiñasa , mä arunjja , Bibliajj yatichki ukarjamaw orasiñasa .
JAQENAKAJJ AKHAM SAPJJEWA Diosarojj qonqortʼasisa , pʼeq altʼasisa , jan ukajj paypach ampara katthapisisaw mayisiñasa sasaw sapjje .
¿ Jumajj kamsarakismasa ?
BIBLIAJJ AKHAM SIWA
Saytʼata , qontʼata , qonqortʼata jan ukajj altʼata mayisipkäna ukanakar Diosajj istʼänwa ( 1 Crónicas 17 : 16 ; 2 Crónicas 30 : 27 ; Esdras 10 : 1 ; Hechos 9 : 40 ) .
Diosajj kunjamsa Jupar orasiñasa uka toqet janiw kamskistusa , ukampis wali respetompiw mayiñasa .
BIBLIAJJ AKHAM SASKAKIWA
Diosajj altʼat chuymanïpki ukanakan mayisitanakap istʼiwa ( Salmo 138 : 6 ) .
Diosajj taqe aru yati , ukhamajj taqeniw kunayman arunakat oracionan mayissna , amuki mayiskañäni ukhas Jupajj istʼarakistaniwa ( 2 Crónicas 6 : 32 , 33 ; Nehemías 2 : 1 - 6 ) .
Jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ?
sat libron 17 jaljap uñjjattʼäta , ukajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan luratawa .
