Janiwa
Inas ukhamächi
Bibliajj akham siwa
“ Qhepa urunakanjja jan wali tiemponakaw jutani ” .
Biblian qellqatäki uka profecianakasa kunatï jichhürunakan pasaski ukanakasa , ‘ qhepa urunakankataswa ’ uñachtʼayi .
Bibliajj akham saskakiwa
Qhepa urunakanwa guerranakasa , manqʼat pistʼañanakasa , oraq khatatinakasa jan qollañjam jan wali usunakas utjañapäna .
Qhepa urunakanjja , jaqenakajj jan suma chuymani jan walinak lurirïpjjañapänwa .
Jaqenakajj akham sapjjewa Qhepa urunakajj tukuyjjani ukhajja , aka Oraqesa jaqenakasa qʼala tukjatäpjjaniwa sasa .
Yaqhepasti , taqe kunas sumakëjjaniwa sasaw sapjjaraki .
¿ Jumajj kamsasmasa ?
Bibliajj akham siwa
“ Aski jaqenakajj oraq katoqapjjani , wiñayatakiw ukan jakapjjarakini ” ( Salmo 37 : 29 ) .
Bibliajj akham saskakiwa
Jan walinakajj chhaqtayaskani ukhaw qhepa urunakajj tukusjjani .
Aka oraqejj mä suma paraisöjjaniwa ( Isaías 35 : 1 , 6 ) .
Qhepa urunakat jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , aka libron 9 jaljap uñjjattʼäta , ukajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan luratawa .
Internetanjja jw.org cheqanwa utjaraki .
